UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'HOW TO GET CUSTOM LOGOS! [please sticky!]', post_text = 'OK WHAT YOU NEED TO DO... Get your pldecal.wad file on hand. Right click on the logo>properties. Make sure the logo is 16 kb or less or it will not appear in game. At the bottom of the properties box, there should be 3 selections. Read-Only, Hidden, and Archive. Uncheck all of them except for Read-Only. Place this file into the x:\\Steam\\SteamCache\\Counter-Strike\\Cstrike\\ folder. If it asks to replace, click yes. Now in that same folder you placed the logo in (cstrike), there should be two files in there. custom.hpk custom.hp2 YOU MUST DELETE THEM BOTH! VERY IMPORTANT! After this is all done, you may start up CS. Have fun, happy spraying! P.S. DO NOT GO INTO THE OPTIONS AND LOOK FOR YOUR SPRAY IN THE LIST. IT WILL NOT BE THERE. THIS LOGO IS A CUSTOM FILE AND IS INDEPENDENT FROM CS. This fix is guaranteed, so if you have any problems with this, contact me at: AIM - x sN 5 ICQ - 199455181 YAHOO - tekr0n MSN - tekr0n@msn.com (mailto:tekr0n@msn.com)\n\n__________________ Eine...Zwei...Drei...Vier...F�nf...Sechs...Sieben...Acht...Neun...AUS!' WHERE post_id = 21817 AND is_historical = 1;
