UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Steam 6/18 Release', post_text = 'We\'ve released a new version of the desktop components of Steam to the beta. If you restart Steam, you will automatically receive this update. This update is mostly targeted at improving the stability of the Steam Authentication server. There are no changes to any of the games with this release. We\'ll will be doing a new release in the next few days of Counter-Strike 1.6 that will address a number of the issues that have been posted in these forums. We\'re constantly working on making Steam and Counter-Strike better, and appreciate all of the feedback from everyone. Everyone working on the beta reads these forums each day. We\'ll also be releasing a Steam enabled version of the Linux game server, which will increase the number of quality game servers the beta. Erik Johnson' WHERE post_id = 41516 AND is_historical = 1;
