UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'The AWM has been a point of much heated discussion. Personally I am able to shoot a AWM of hand without zoom or use the zoom to shoot one guy and when there\'s someone standing anywhere near the person I shot aim and shoot him without zooming. I know it\'s just a game but with a weapon like an AWM there is no way you can hit anything unless you first take very carefull aim, which takes time. In CS you can just flip out a AWM and shoot anybody without even trying to aim. I feel that when you pull out an AWM for the first second or so it should be really inaccurate, thus simulating the aiming. Second I agree with Zim. When you are reloading an AWM and intterupt the reload then the reload should start from 0 when you pull it out again. This goes for every weapon in CS btw.' WHERE post_id = 42195 AND is_historical = 1;
