UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'If you buy a shield at the beginning of a map before the game comences you will still have the shield in the next round, rather than it being cleared. Occurs when starting money is high enough to purchase shield. Seems in some cases there is no audio message when the bomb is planted or when a team wins by bombing or defusing. I don\'t think it\'s a silent plant bug related to the map. Some join lag/freeze experienced when the client requests all the pldecal.wad files from the server at once. The console shows the spam for all the requests in one shot rather than spreading them out like in 1.5 When carrying a shield and crouching, you can\'t jump left, forward+left or backward+left. Granted that\'s probably not a maneuver used much from that position but it seems odd the other directions are not affected. Note this doesn\'t affect crouch jumping as in jumping first then pressing crouch to get onto ledges and such, however if crouch is pressed first when moving in the left directions then the player can\'t jump. --------------- And on a more positive note it appears the shield strafe bug was finally squashed with the 6/20 release, and to boot the bullet impacts significantly slow the movement of the shield user, which is a good addition. []' WHERE post_id = 42344 AND is_historical = 1;
