UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'How To Use Custom Spray/logo', post_text = 'Okay, how do it... quote:HOW TO USE CUSTOM SPRAYS! 1) Take your custom spray, which should be a file called pldecal.wad. 2) Paste it under c:\\...\\steam\\steamcache\\emailaccount\\counter-strike\\cstrike\\ 3) Select overwrite 4) Delete custom.hpk and custom.hp2(If it exists) 5) Right click on pldecal.wad, and select properties. 6) Here, set it\'s attribute to READ ONLY. This will prevent Steam from overwritting the file EVER AGAIN! Neat huh? quote:EXAMPLE OF MAKING A SPRAY (Read more into thread for BETTER detail...) Here is visual proof of a spray in the making. This is one i made last night, works, and kicks alot of ass! A picture you want to make into a spray... (http://dumbasstm.com/silenthunters/mylogo_noedit.jpg) I then took this pic, resized it to 64x128pixels, and reduced color depth to 256 colors (using the optimized octree(sp) method). Finally, I set the 255th color on the pallet to pure blue(0 0 255), and since this pic has no other pure blue colors in the pallet, I am done! All i need to do is compile it. The new spray formatted pic should look like this... (http://dumbasstm.com/silenthunters/mylogo.bmp) And there you have it! Visual proof that manual works better than those crappy spray makers! There ya go, enjoy! If you have any issues, post here and I will resolve them.' WHERE post_id = 44708 AND is_historical = 1;
