UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'ABout the dimentions of the picture, both dimentions have to be multiples of 16, AND the product of the 2 numbers MUST be less than 12288. a good and common size = 112 x 64 (my spray specifically) and 128 x 64 is cool too. most people use 112 x 96 for box like sprays, and 112 x 64 for elongated ones. Experiment ^_^. Also, you need your colors down correctly. 256 Color pallet, with the 255th color set to RGB value 0 0 255 (pure blue). Also make sure that all other pure blues (0 0 255) other than the 255\'th color is set to RGB 0 0 254 (One step down from pure blue, but looks the same neways ^_^. If confusing, just post and I\'ll clarify. If you need a specific program help, just ask and I\'ll assit ja. EDIT: Using the pure blue set on the 255th pallet block is the TRANSPARENCY, which is not shown in the game.\n\n__________________ ~Neme, the Soujiro\'ed one' WHERE post_id = 69074 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'here, a program to do it manually', post_text = 'here the files 4 it. sry, got \'em alr. few years, cant say where i got them from colorspr.zip 68kB (http://www.netcologne.de/~nc-loerscma/colorspr.zip) ok, got a german readme added, but here is also an detailed english explanation how u do it: what u need: calculator (windows calculator can do it) graphic program (no, paint is not enough) counterstrike or another half life game (wouldnt be so interesting creating sprays if u dont got it [] 1. get a pic which is a) extreme funny b) naked or c) lame ok, now we first need a good resolution. 2. crop away the unimportant part of the pic 3. we now try to resize it without shrinking/enlarging one side too much. it takes 2-3 steps, but its worth and after 2 sprays pretty easy. look under file info what resolution it got. then divide the bigger number by the smaller one. we need the relation. we now hope that the realtion is very close to one found here: (in my zip the following is the spray.txt) 16 x 688 11008 43 32 x 336 10752 10.5 48 x 224 10752 4.66667 64 x 160 10240 2.5 80 x 144 11520 1.8 80 x 128 10240 1.6 96 x 112 10752 1.16667 left is the resolution. middle the real amount of pixel (maybe u can use it if u like high resolution [] and last number is the relation between height and width) so. i guess we got about 1.5 so we r close to the 96 x 112 one. then... lets change our image to 96 x 112. (if u dont got a relation close to one in the list, try to crop a little bit more of one side) in paint shop pro its in the menu, search for resize image or smthing which sound simelar [] be sure to switch off the relation lock. otherwise ot never looks deformed but ull also harly ever get it to the right resolution. 4. ok, now we still got 32bit colors, but we are only allowed to use 256 colors... colors - decrease color depth - 256 colors. a menu will pop up, where u can try out a few options. if u make it right u will hardly see a difference to the 32bit picture 5. edit palette last rule we have to follow is , that last palette color is the transparent color blue. so go to color - change palette choose last color box and set it to RGB 0 0 255. make sure that there is no other 0 0 255 color, or if there is, just change it a little bit. 6. pixel work if the palette change let some blue dots appear in ur pic, then choose another color in ur palette and paint those dots with it. dont trust new appeared intensive blue dots. in game they always hide cuz they change to transparent 7. if u want, make the background transparent by painting it intensive blue 8. give it a filename sorry, but u need to give it a 8 + 3 filename. colorspr is not the latest program. and 8 chars are really enough for all ur pics [] ############# 9. work with the colorspr ive added a bat file. maybe u shd edit it before first use. u have to use 8+3 dir names. if u dont know them use start run "command" and there use "dir /x" to see dirs and files in current directory in the 8+3 format. (... to change dir use "cd dirname" or to go one dir up, use "cd ..") the bat 1.creates a wad, 2.copies it into hl dir and 3. deletes the bmp file., so never move ur bmp into the colorspr dir. only copy it. if u want to make it read-only then try out the command "attrib filename +r" on, u now nearly got it. now we got the \'debugging\': if u forgot any of the steps above, it wont converti bmp to a wad file. but dont worry. if it dont convert it, it will at least tell u what u forgot. the messages first look a but confusing, but they are really simple. just only read the last line [] and now u got it. the door spray which hopefully works to make the next n00b mad. or.. the naked chick. u may loose the game, get fragged 4 times in a row w/o even one kill, u still got ur naked chick spray []. dont try to spray that naked chick in enemy base. its too much fun spraying chicks, so u will inadvertently spray one also in ur base, and then half team will stare at it, shooting some \'dots in the pic\' ^^ if u r present low on creativity, ive also uploaded some pics 338kB (http://www.netcologne.de/~nc-loerscma/pics.zip) i use. they are not all from me, but i just collect the best ones [] some are even from the program sprayview with which u can get every spray u ever seen in hl (because u can only see them bcuz they are saved in one file on ur hd) if its a picture from sprayview, u still need to change the color depth from 32 bit down to 8 bit. if u dont know if it got 32 or 8 bit, and pic alr got the right resolution, just check its filesize. if its ~10-15 kB its ready to convert. if it got 50-60 kB, u shd reduse colors ok, hope uve understand all steps. [] greetingz, Ame' WHERE post_id = 71401 AND is_historical = 1;
