UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Steam 7/4 Release', post_text = 'We\'ve released a new version of Counter-Strike and the dedicated servers (Win32 and Linux). You don\'t need to exit Steam to get the update, it will automatically download when you launch Counter-Strike. Your dedicated servers should automatically update as well. There are a few items from yesterday\'s reverted release that will have to wait until next week. Here is the actual changelog for today\'s: Changes: - Bots now buy armor more often. - Added "BOT" to the scoreboard for players who are bots on the server. - Reduced entity count in Aztec to improve server performance. - Improved Bot navigation on Aztec. - Improved Bot navigation on Airstrip. Bug Fixes: - Fixed bug where radar would disappear during gameplay. - Fixed bug where tactical shield wasn\'t removed during a round restart. - Fixed friends and serverbrowser settings not being saved correctly if edited in-game. - Fixed bug where sounds weren\'t played properly when using Friends. - Fixed bug where progress bar would only show the first file you\'re downloading from a game server. - Fixed bug in keyboard settings list where you could scroll selection bar off the visible page using the arrow keys. - Fixed bug where the first mouse click wouldn\'t work after exiting the UI. - Fixed bug where the scoreboard would be incorrect when users were connecting. - Fixed bug where the M4A1 silencer animation wouldn\'t play the sound at the correct time.' WHERE post_id = 47124 AND is_historical = 1;
