UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Ya the update process is even more screwed than the last time if you start from scratch. (or forced to from steam not responding after update causing you to delete and start from the steam installer) I finally got my CS to update by right clicking on the game and choosing options. Then click on the Status applet. Now in the last update this was the only way I could get cs to update by selecting the "make sure to update automatically". It would then show you your update download bandwidth which was the only updating information you could get that the game was actually downlaoding. Eventually it finished but you never know how long it will take. The new update is even more screwed up. Now if you select "update game automatically" it will begin to download the game files but it will them automatically revert to "Do not automatically keep game up to date" (or whatever the wording is). I finally found that if I selected nothing the box would say "do not automatically download" but it showed that it was updating above it with the download bandwidth! WTF? Owell atleast I\'m getting the game files I need...' WHERE post_id = 47193 AND is_historical = 1;
