UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'The deal about gcache.gcf', post_text = 'Because of the surfacing information about having spyware that detects mp3 files and kazaa, i have on request from some people edited the original post, and it\'s sub-post. A quick reminder. A harddrive would not by itself execute any kind of code. Furthermore the appearances of MP3 is only directed at ingame MP3 music(Which Half-Life music is changed too, but not working yet). And config/menu files including MP3. The appearances of Kazaa is only chained together with a other set of useless chars remind a lot of a name like kazaa, (kakakaka, zazazaza, zaazaazaa, azazaz, and so on. While appearences of "kazaa" occur there is no such thing as your username in the harddrive, if there is, it\'s because you have gotten a changed copy of steam or you put it in it yourself.) And this has been verified by 8 people, and then verified again by me. I can\'t remember the exact numbers but i believe 2 had the official KMD, while the rest used Kazaa lite. I also installed kazaa lite. Edit: I\'m sorry the information had to go, and i\'m sorry for making all replies useless.' WHERE post_id = 55947 AND is_historical = 1;
