UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Steam 7/24 Release', post_text = 'There is a new version of Steam that has been released to the beta. Please shut down Steam and restart it down to download the update. Changelog for this release: - Fixed problem on Linux servers where you would get an error saying "Ticket Expired". - Added the ability to encrypt data in the cache. - Fixed assert in client when the master authentication server is down. You will have to have this update on your machine before you will be able to launch Steam products. In a few hours we are going to begin preloading the next Half-Life 2 movie (Traptown) to the Steam beta. The movie will be available to play likely tomorrow, but we\'d like to give people the opportunity to get a head start on downloading it if they choose to. If you would not like to automatically download the movie, you can right click on "Half-Life 2 Movies" in your games and choose "Do Not Automatically Update This Game". I\'ll post in here when the movie is available. Erik Johnson' WHERE post_id = 62000 AND is_historical = 1;
