UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Steam 8/05', post_text = 'There is a new version of Steam available to the beta. If you shutdown Steam now and restart you will automatically be brought up to date. Changelist: - Fixed bug where steam monitor would occasionally show incorrect data when first opened - Fixed game name of mods showing incorrectly in \'third party\' section of Games list - Changed friends authorization request dialogs to appear sequentially, instead of all opening at the same time - Fixed bug where you couldn\'t re-add a user to your list who had previously been removed - Increased heartbeat rate to server if friends or chat dialog windows are open - Fixed a problem when using Friends behind a firewall. - Fixed logged friends chats being saved incorrectly. - Fixed problem where users would not always get disconnected properly, and have messages build up to be sent to them. - Fixed problem where Steam would not properly update for users running WindowBlinds.' WHERE post_id = 69634 AND is_historical = 1;
