UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'GameServer Hosting Company\'s', post_text = 'Well, first of all CS 1.6 is pretty good. I like the visual effects added and re-done models. Of course there are some less better points but that is on every game, so live with it. But there is one thing which is very bad about steam and that is that gamehosting company\'s are going down by it. On 1 rack server it asks 30/40% of CPU power per gameserver. So we would only be able to get a stable 1.6 server by putting only 2 gameservers on 1 server in our rack. Also, a 1.6 server consumes more than 20 % of bandwith compared to 1.5. So my question is.... Did valve also think about gameserver hosting company\'s? And why does the terms of agreement almost say that only valve can put up and control gameservers? I think this was needed to say because we from www.getfragged.nl (http://www.getfragged.nl) are now forced to buy new hardware. We where also planning a price lowering, but thanks to 1.6 we can\'t make that anymore. /SynergY ps. Yes, we got good cpu\'s and internet access. So that ain\'t the problem. (AMD 2400+ 1gb ddr SCSI and so on)' WHERE post_id = 91230 AND is_historical = 1;
