UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'They are aware of the CPU problem but (they say) have seen wildly conflicting reports about the CPU usage. They also are looking into \'potential\' optimizations, but do not have a concrete timeline. So don\'t expect an update soon (eq. months if you know how fast they update sometimes)... What one could do is doing some test (time consuming): 1: install linux 2.4.9 (just for testing, not for production as it is a non-secure kernel) 2: disable all plugins (doesn\'t matter much) 3: do not use pingboost 4: test different kernels 5: test different hardware (they say Intel works better, but I couldn\'t see a difference compared to AMD) We will have to reconsider our market-strategy and prob. have to raise the prices for almost every HL mod. Valve (and Alfred) are reading these topics (I know they read the hlds_linux list), and I hope they begin to realize that this is a serious issue.' WHERE post_id = 99951 AND is_historical = 1;
