UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Just thought I\'d add to the good work by RxWookie and post the steps for ppl with the "Tiny" personal firewall, even though if you are using Tiny you prolly don\'t need me to tell you how to do it. [] 1) Right click on the TPF icon in the sys tray and click on Firewall Administration. 2) Ensure the slider is set to "Ask me first" and click on "Advanced". 3) In the config window that comes up click on "Add", a new ruleset window will appear. Fill it in as follows. Description: Whatever rocks your world [] Protocol: TCP and UPD Direction: Both Local Endpoint: (Leave it on the Default) Remote Endpoint: (Leave it on the Default) Application: Only Selected Below. (Then use the browse button to navigate to your " c:\\programfiles\\steam\\steamapps\\youremailaddy\\coun ter-strike\\" folder and select hl.exe) Rule Valid: Always Action: Permit Click ok out of the rule window and click ok again out of the config window then ok again out of the admin window. Hope this helps someone. Happy fraggin.' WHERE post_id = 132756 AND is_historical = 1;
