UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'No, you are wrong, first of all, nobody has mentioned skins except you. The program "Wally" has a half life custom decal wizard which makes the pldecal.wad file. I mentioned nothing about making skins and neither did anyone else. The person who made this thread already has Wally and gives the impression that he knows how to use it with previous versions of CS. Is this the "bad advice" that you complained about? Catch_ME, try editing the origional 1.5 pldecal file with the Wally logo wizard and then copying it over to the Steam cstrike folder. You should also make it read only once it is there or cs is liable to overwrite it. Also, make sure that the filename within the pldecal file is "{LOGO", without the quotes. The Wally decal wizard should do this on its own though. I actually havent tried making a custom decal for 1.6 yet, Ill get right on it and write something a bit more detailed in a bit. Actually, the thread\'s author is nowhere to be found. I meant Catch_ME.' WHERE post_id = 124857 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Sprays', post_text = 'Directions for Counter-Strike Steam 1.6 Beta After Downloading Decal converter and making your .wad file. (see above) Goto my computer C:/ProgramFiles/Steam/SteamApps/Counter-Strike/cstrike . Once you have that folder open you need to delete these files custom.hbk, and the pldecal.wad file. Then go to the logos folder in that window and delete all the files in that folder but leave the folder. Then you can make your pldecal.wad file, mark it read only and put it into the cstrike folder. THE END' WHERE post_id = 124886 AND is_historical = 1;
