UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'If you are still having problems go here (http://cscustom.fr.st/) where you can get a copy of decal convertor. It is really quick and simple to use and will have a custom spray running in no time. Make sure you set your default game folder for decals as C:\\Program Files\\Steam\\SteamApps\\your e-mail\\counter-strike\\cstrike and that the wad file you make isn\'t to large, I find if they are to large they tend not to work. (nothing more then about 14kb.) You will find that any spray you make will not show straight away because you need to allow the server to upload the decal first, it should work after 3 or 4 sprays. The great thing about this program is that there is no need for any other graphics program, you just choose your picture, resize it and make the decal, is that simple. Also you will not see your spray in your CS options, I am not sure if it is the same with 1.6 but in 1.5 if were to go into your game options you would lose your custom spray and it would be replaced with the default lambda spray.\n\n__________________ Want great Counter Strike? Come pay us a visit at The Asylum 66.208.107.38:27015 http://sga.recongamer.com' WHERE post_id = 125166 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'i dont know about 1.6 but in 1.5 it would not show in the options and in fact would be overwritten as soon as you entered the options. however if you simply copied the pldcal.wad to your cstrike folder it would automatically be used whenever you spray\n\n__________________ using something steampowered will inevitably make you sweat' WHERE post_id = 125276 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'To prevent it being overwritten, make pldecal.wad read-only.' WHERE post_id = 125311 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Low-End Computer users and 3dFx card fixes!', post_text = 'Yes, I have a lowend computer, 300mhz Celeron, Voodoo3 2000, and 384mb memory. I got CS 1.6 Work pretty good. The only thing is that I can\'t play clan matches no more, because have a fps of 15 in de_aztec. My FPS is now 30-50, at it\'s low, 15. I can play dust1 & 2 properly, and prodigy runs well too. Now I want to tell you what I did. First time I opened CS 1.6, I noticed that MiniGL drivers aren\'t usable anymore. So I knew I have to tweak a bit to get it work. First thing was that I installed WickedGL FULL version, 3.0. Then, put opengl32.dll from C:\\Prog Files\\Wicked\\ to C:\\Windows\\System and overwrited the old file, (I suggest a backup copy) then I put my WickedGl minidriver to C:\\Games\\Steam\\SteamApps\\myemail@provider.com\\counter-strike\\gldrv\\ And overwrited the old file. Then I copied the hole **** (GLDRV folder) in C:\\Games\\Steam\\SteamApps\\myemail@provider.com\\gldrv. Then, opened Steam > Games > rightclick on Counter-Strike > properties > launch options > write there ��gldrv 3dfxgl.dll� without ��. Now I had a working CS with opengl. So, that\'s not all. Put resolution to 640x480, texture depth to 16bit, smokesprites to medium, max smokepuffs to 1 and max shells to 1. I wasn\'t still happy and I put corpsestay to 1 (1= one second, 0 = corpses stay). FPS didn\'t still satisfy me. So I Rebooted, put bios, overclocked my Celeron 300mhz to 374mhz (4.5 x 83mhz) and my computer started. So Now my CS runs �fine� and I can play it barely! If you want more fps, you should open your console, and write �gl_texturemode gl_nearest� without �� and textures come ugly, but fps raises. You can also write �gl_texturemode gl_linear� without �� but your fps won\'t raise so much, but walls are not awful big pixels then. To reset gl_texturemode, change server or quit CS. It will automatically reset gl_texturemode to default. Thanks for listening, I Hope that I have helped 3dfx users. If you want to know where to get WickedGL 3.0, Private message me. And you should NEVER overclock your CPU with fsb like 83mhz, because it can **** up your hdd, pci and agp cards, but I was desperate. Usually you only have to format your drives if you fuc]{ those things up.' WHERE post_id = 124828 AND is_historical = 1;
