UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'CPU : AMD Athlon XP 1900+ (1.61. Gigz) RAM : 768 DDR Ram VIDEO CARD : GF3 Ti 500 WINDOWS VERSION : Windows XP HE DIRECT X : 9.0 VIDEO DRIVERS : 45.23 VIDEO METHOD : OpenGL GAME RESOLUTION : 800X600 GAME COLOR DEPTH : 32-bit V-SYNC : Off INTERNET CONNECTION : Cable I have also noticed that on cirtain maps my FPS drops from 99 to anywhere around 40ish. 40 fps doesn\'t sound so bad, but when its dropping from 99 to 40, re-coil, rate of fire ... everything is effected. I\'ve noticed that when my fps nears 40, when trying to go full-auto, its almost as if my gun jams, and I fire really slow. I have noticed, that after a little work on my computer, I\'ve been able to increase my fps, and been able to play a little bit better. After cleaning up my disk and defrangmenting I was able to get my fps to hold 99 on most maps. They really need to fix this problem, because I know a lot of people that can\'t play CS anymore, because it is un-playable. I hope they do something, cause not everyone out there is able to afford a top of the line comp.' WHERE post_id = 132381 AND is_historical = 1;
