UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Creating New Accounts "fixall"', post_text = 'Hey everyone, Just a quick note about trying to create a new account when you are having problems with Steam. Creating a new account is only something to try if maybe you\'ve never been able to login (ever), and suspect it\'s because something happened during your account creation. Though, if this is the case, you can email us and we\'ll try to get your account straightened out. If you\'ve already entered one or more CD-Keys in the first account, you will not be able to re-use them in the new account.' WHERE post_id = 132997 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'SteamAMP', post_text = 'Hi. Just thought I\'d share with the steam community my latest little utility. It\'s called SteamAMP and it managed your MP3\'s while playing Steam enabled MODS. I developed this method after reading about the mp3 commands in the forums, and i didn\'t know there was no such util, other wise you guys would have had it a bit more than a week ago =D As far as I know, this is an original concept, thought up by myself. Please enjoy. Please send bugs, typos, feedback and critisism to: brok3n@iinet.net.au (mailto:brok3n@iinet.net.au). It\'s all appreciated. Also, I am not sure if the userconfig.cfg works on startup, I did not have time to test that. Next release will have that worked out? Anyways, please ensure that you have the following keys bound: bind f6 "wait; wait; wait; wait; exec mp3command.cfg;" bind f7 "wait; wait; wait; wait; exec mp3command.cfg;" bind f8 "wait; wait; wait; wait; exec mp3command.cfg;" For help, just click the \'?\' in the app. Brok3n. SteamAMP V1.0 Download: http://ii.net/~lynch1/steamamp/steamamp.zip (http://ii.net/~lynch1/steamamp/steamamp.zip) VB Runtime Files: http://ii.net/~lynch1/steamamp/vbruntimes.zip (http://ii.net/~lynch1/steamamp/vbruntimes.zip) I\'ll update this.... Someday.... :|' WHERE post_id = 133981 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'You sure VAC won\'t detect it as a cheat? []' WHERE post_id = 134311 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Good Point', post_text = 'Good Point, but I don\'t think VAC will 1) Detect it/ 2) Detect it as a cheat. It may be that cheats like that nasty anti-recoil thing that sits outside of HL and just moves the mouse down will couse this to be detected aswell. I doubt it tho =D (Hope not anyways). Thanksfor pointing that out =D What this util does is, from the mod directory you specify, get the /mp3 directory (that you create, and put mp3\'s in), list the fiels there, and whever you press one of the control keys(F6=Stop, F7 = Prev, F8=Next) write a script file with the mp3 command and the path of the mp3, so that you do not have to make clumsy (no offense) aand time cinsuming commandmenu.txt\'s or other scripts. But please, download it and try it. It works =D And please post or email me some Feedback! Brok3n.' WHERE post_id = 135081 AND is_historical = 1;
