UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I\'ve noticed a few issues with SteamAMP. But before I get to those, I think I can offer a bit of help to other users. First: To my knowledge, SteamAMP doesn\'t work in DoD (anyone gotten it to work there?). Second: Make sure that "Monitor Keys" is ON before playing. This is what causes SteamAMP to write the mp3command.cfg and is the driving force behind the thing. Third: Songs do not automatically play, so when one finishes you have to hit F8 to load the next. Fourth: Songs do not play right off the bat, so you\'ll have to use F8 to get them started. Fifth: Use "MP3 Volume" in Audio Options to mess with the volume. Now those issues I mentioned: - I can\'t minimize SteamAMP, and I\'d kinda like to. Is there a reason behind this? - Doesn\'t work in DoD (mentioned earlier). And some suggestions: - Allow different keys to be used (user-defined). - Allow user to select multiple folders, and write new mp3command.cfg into all of them, so that the user doesn\'t have to select a new folder before changing games. Thanks for your time. Congrats on the Sticky.' WHERE post_id = 169287 AND is_historical = 1;
