UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Taylor, I didn\'t mean to imply that your developers are stupid. I\'ve made some awfully poor choices in my own career. This particular authentication method paints one into a corner a little. I hope you don\'t think I\'m attacking you guys personally. Steam is a great idea, it just needs time to be fleshed out. I\'ll be really impressed if you figure out a way around this. In the mean time, I\'m back to running a 1.5 server. Keep plugging away, and don\'t let the complainers get you down. I just wanted people to understand the real problem. Dean' WHERE post_id = 139023 AND is_historical = 1;
