UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I spent $25 on Day of Defeat a few months ago for the sole purpose of running a Counter-Strike server on my fast T1 line and be able to play on my own server. I use NAT and am a Computer Tech of 10 years, and a Game Server Admin of 5 years. To my dissapointment Steam authentication doesnt work well with NAT. So I thought to myself, surely Valve will fix such a serious problem ASAP, it will be worth it to wait a bit for Steam to be fixed. That was 2 months ago! When I started up my server, watching others be able to play on it, but not be able to play on my own server, lets just say I was upset. Luckily a nice free game called Enemy Territory came out that I was able to run a server for and play on my own server. I am not joking when I say this ... I will not buy Half-Life 2. By then many other great games like UT2004 and DOOM3 will be taking up my time. The fact such a major networking standard has been overlooked and then not fixed in a timely manner says a lot about where Valve holds its priorities. I was planning on being a server admin for Half-Life2, CounterStrike2, TeamFortress2, etc. But this has put a very sour taste in my mouth. In summary, I want my $25 back. I have gotten no play time out of that game.\n\n__________________ Game Server Admin midwestmayhem.gotdns.com' WHERE post_id = 254489 AND is_historical = 1;
