UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = '"no 2003 yet"', post_text = 'Look harder. If you look at what G. Newell said about the code, it wouldn\'t be illogical to assume this is code from only last month. If you want a faster way of seeing how recent this code is. . . you can just \'grep\' through the whole source tree for the string of "2003" and get a whole mess of matches. No doubt about it. This is very recent, perfectly working code that just needs material for it to run on. (i.e. art, models, music...etc) As for GPL code in Source, that\'s FUD. There is LGPL code in there and it\'s all part of the licenced Havoc 2 physics middleware that Valve paid for with a lot of money. Dirtbox/Mr. Chris: this is totally unrelated to the topic but you\'d be better to use the ignore feature for people who don\'t bother thinking before typing. Does me wonders and saves me groans.' WHERE post_id = 144944 AND is_historical = 1;
