UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Hackers and Cheaters are free to attack any server', post_text = 'I monitor the hacker and Rage clans to keep updated on how to counter them but I found one thing I could do nothing about. U can by entering a new E-mail get a new STEAMid ! That means that ban lists and STEAMid databases are non functional. We can do nothing to stop Hackers, Lamers, Rasists (yes there are many of them on the DOD severs), Cheaters and disruptive players in general. I have when we had WONid\'s made a big database that helped to keep all these offenders out. If Steam gets up and working a community can join my database network and we can get rid of the Cheaters and Lamers. It will hit them harder if they get banned by like 20 communitys spanning 40-50 servers ! If anyone is interested in this project then u can e-mail me and u will get the full info on how I will do this. Stalingrad' WHERE post_id = 157252 AND is_historical = 1;
