UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Actually, I found the email interview where they said their adding Gunman, Blue-Shift and the HD pack: Are there any plans to support Half-Life Blue Shift through Steam? Why not? [Erik Johnson] Yes, we\'re going to look at this. There is an issue that we have to address where Blue Shift made some changes to the engine. Will you include the option for users to use High Definition Models; the new models that shipped with Half-Life Blue Shift in a High Definition Pack? [Erik Johnson] This is also something we need to deal with. I\'ll add it to our list. Will there be support for Gunman Chronicles (a forgotten Valve game that is based on HL Tech.)? [Erik Johnson] This is in the same realm as Blue Shift, but yeah, we need to get this on Steam also. Read the whole thing, it\'s the second news post down. http://www.planethalflife.com/news/...p;recordcount=0 (http://www.planethalflife.com/news/search.asp?function=search&advanced=1&search=gunman%2Bblue%2Bshift%2Bsteam&startmonth=6&startday=8&startyear=1996&endmonth=10&endday=12&endyear=2003&order=rankdesc&recordcount=0)' WHERE post_id = 168032 AND is_historical = 1;
