UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by 007Bistromath Valve is a BUSINESS. What would you do if you were in their position? In any business transaction, cutting out the middleman is always beneficial. Well lets see.. If it where my company maybe I wouldnt have waited five years to make a sequel and then try to make up my losses by jipping out retailers, hastily releasing a poorly thought out program full of bugs like Steam so that they can take your credit card numbers on their highly secure network. Oh and actually providing the paying customers w/ technical support would be a nice gesture too, considering all I see are "HELP ME" posts and not to mention the amount of people w/ plain old complaint posts about the lack of service they are being provided, all shuffled in with the countless pages of bug reports. All which seem to go unanswered by anyone representing their business. IMO Vivendi/valve/steam are primed for failiar. I\'d be curious to see what stockholders are doing w/ their share. The repeated delays, the lies in regards to how much content they actually have, and the sheer lack of support has more than proven to me that this company is hanging on by the skin of their teeth. I mean what would you call their release of DoD retail a short while back? I\'d say it was a quick money maker to feed their bellies, considering not a whole lot of work has actually been done within the company.' WHERE post_id = 168075 AND is_historical = 1;
