UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'here is my answer to Steam!', post_text = 'I can not sit still and remain calm about this. As myclan and friends all know I have the patients of a rock, but they have broken me. Some people are not going to want to here this. But You must!!!!!!!!!!! I have just tested something I heard from a veteran server operator/owner/admin about STEAM! They say that this is the software that will be hooking us together weather we like it or not. I call there bluff. If we the server owners don\'t act now we will have no more game to serve. It has been brought to my attention that the STEAM id\'s. The ID that you use to ban some jerk/cheater/sexualoffender is not generated by your HL cd key. It is generated by your EMAIL address you give steam. So this evening I took about 15 min and made 5 emails with hotmail.com. Then Entered my server and banned myself. Exit server and log out of STEAM. Then Logged back in to steam under one of my 5 new email addy and re-entered the server no problem. If I was a Lawyer I would say rest my case but I am not finished. My patients have now turned to a new cause. After adding up roughly how much money I have spent to bring this game to people as a server host "$9000 range" 250,000 people bying HL added up to 10 million dollars valve has made of us. I am going to dedicate my time to stopping steam before they ruin our game we love. We need to stand together. I recommend that you do what ever it takes to get your servers back to 1.5 If we go back and most steam servers disappear they will hear are cry!!!! I count about 400 tfc servers. I see around 30000 people all togather allready switched. Can they fix that many id\'s? Do you think they will do something or not. If the servers go back what can they do. They may change alot of ways but I only four see more trouble as they try to pull out of this one. As a client you may not see the importance of this, but as a server admin/owner this is cause for alarm. With mygot alone on the prowl to crash servers and harm your stuff we are un protected as server owners.. I am not finished here I will send more to help get the word out. Talk to server admins of the servers you play on. Let them know.' WHERE post_id = 175768 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Yeah, and there are lots of people that have pirated half-life with cd-key (and that cd-key can be your own cd-key). Or they can create a cd-key with those stupid hacker programs that amke auto cdkey for half-life (and that also can match up your cd key). I know myself...' WHERE post_id = 175927 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'smklizard - One CD-Key can only be used ONCE - with one Steam account (Steam ID). There is a TEMPORARY situation with Steam right now, allowing all those duplicate accounts to function. We\'ve started working on the backlog, and eventually all of those accounts will be unsubscribed from the games. Only the first account to use a CD-Key will be able to play. Ban that account, and they will stay banned. This is, in fact, the whole crux of the problem that TheWorx brought up (we need to make it more obvious that it\'s pulling your Cd-key from the registry). So, I\'m sorry you\'re so upset but don\'t worry as your concerns are rather groundless.' WHERE post_id = 175996 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'i may have not understud your story exactly but i\'ll tell you the LAW!!!! The law states that a licence you buy must be installed only on 1 computer or may be installed on multiple computers as long as only 1 copy of the software is running at one time. Thats the law. Now i dont know why your installing the CD on another person\'s PC but you shouldn\'t.' WHERE post_id = 176187 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Catch_ME i may have not understud your story exactly but i\'ll tell you the LAW!!!! The law states that a licence you buy must be installed only on 1 computer or may be installed on multiple computers as long as only 1 copy of the software is running at one time. Thats the law. Now i dont know why your installing the CD on another person\'s PC but you shouldn\'t. There\'s no law that says that. What you\'re talking about is what an End-User License Agreement might say. The agreement is written by the company that sells the software. Mostly, that is typical of what a EULA says. "The Law" basically just says: as that\'s a contract, you are legally bound by it if you accept it. Anyway - I\'m not saying that the HL etc EULAs do or don\'t say that (sorry I\'m a coder not a lawyer), but I thought I would clear that point up.' WHERE post_id = 176689 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Taylo, off-topic question ... Will there be a steam user database cleanup where all accounts get deleted and every cd-key can only be used once ? Because now, even me having a valid cd-key form HL Platinum Pack having bought it sealed in Shop, never giving my Key out, i sometimes get locked out of CS or HL due to the "Key in use" error. I can only think of one explanation: Key-Gen that per accident threw out my cd-key and someone else is using it now ... In addition, will you give us a possibility to dlete our own acount ... I have two account for example, from the beta, where someone told me that a second account would fix some error. Its useless and can be deleted. But i cant do that and i would like to. Would be in your interest, to keep the database nice n\' small. NoVa' WHERE post_id = 176701 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'No CZero or other leak posts please', post_text = 'Please, no links to CZero downloads, installer zips for models, or anything like that for CZero stuff ok? As you probably know, anything someone\'s giving out is from leaked stuff and not legit at all. Also a reminder of the policy on this sit that basically no tolerance for linking to, etc. the leaked stuff. "No tolerance" translates as "ban" by the way.' WHERE post_id = 178492 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Whiner-Operated Network.', post_text = 'If you hate steam: GO BACK TO WON. If you hate 1.6: GO BACK TO WON. If you hate shields: GO BACK TO WON. /index.p...382375772523900 (/index.php?area=news&archive=yes&id=106382375772523900) WON is still up. Steam is still being worked on. Steam will eventually fix all these stupid bugs like the CPU usage and such. You have absolutely no right to complain about steam, whine how much WON is better, and then keep playing on steam. WON is there for your amusement. Everyone just go back to WON and leave the mature, patient players to CS 1.6 and steam. Really. I mean it. All you stupid little brats whining about your 1.5 being gone...it\'s not. Go back and play it. It\'ll make all the CS 1.6 games I play include better, mature players. You\'ve already got your stupid little \'elite\' low steamID number, ready and waiting for when you return after all the steam bugs are fixed. Seriously. Go the heck away. Now. quote:Originally posted by MaxDamagel33t To all the people who refuse to go back to WON because they claim it\'ll be shut down anyhow: Do you refuse to eat hot food because it may get cold later? If so, then at least you\'re being consistent in your logic. If you\'ve paid ANY attention to what\'s going on, you\'ll know that Valve have stated that WON will stay up until Steam is ready to fully support the community. Until then, if you hate Steam, DON\'T F\'ING USE IT! Simple as that. It\'s not brain surgery. You\'re being given a choice - the developers say you have a choice. You people are acting like you\'re being bundled into game-concentration camps at gunpoint and Steamed to death! These forums are proof that people have way too much time on their hands, and that some people just get off being jackasses. If you have the clear option to go back to WON, and choose not to do so, then you have no right to whine about Steam either. Refusing to go back to WON and persisting to whine about something that you have the full option not to use is not only counterproductive, but fantastically childish. The only half-reasonable excuse I can think of is that if you installed Steam (which recovered your old CD key), foolishly deleted your old HL directory, and then threw out your old half-life disc because you won\'t need it due to Steam. The chances of that happening are about a billion to one, but we all know that somone out there is stupid enough to do it. Einstein was right. "Two things are infinite: the universe and human stupidity; and I\'m not sure about the universe."' WHERE post_id = 180696 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'haha, putting up with this rediculous mess, doesnt make someone more "mature". lets face iit, for now Steam is a pile of dog feces. until it works like it should we shall complain all we want.' WHERE post_id = 180710 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by dRh4x haha, putting up with this rediculous mess, doesnt make someone more "mature". lets face iit, for now Steam is a pile of dog feces. until it works like it should we shall complain all we want. Go away, whiner. #1: Are you paying for steam? No. #2: Are you paying for steam? No. #3: Are you paying for steam? No. #4: Are you forced to use steam? No. #5: Is someone smacking you over the head with a spiked club every time you use WON instead of steam? No. #6: Go the heck away you loser whining flaming brainless git. Play WON and get out of here. I am sick and tired of all the useless steam-hating crap that goes on in these forums, when there is absolutely no point, and you could all be playing \'the perfect 1.5\' right this very second.' WHERE post_id = 180713 AND is_historical = 1;
