essage displaying frequency: 10:00 minutes Adding auth server 65.73.232.251:27040 Adding auth server 65.73.232.253:27040 Adding master server 207.173.177.12:27010 Adding master server 207.173.177.11:27010 L 10/27/2003 - 17:16:42: Login: "NSPlayer<1><STEAM_0:1:478212><>" become an admin (account "STEAM_0:1:478212") (access "abcdefghijklmnopqrstu") (address "155.31.213.103") SZ_GetSpace: overflow on MessageBegin/End FATAL ERROR (shutting down): MESSAGE_END called, but message buffer from .dll had overflowed Add "-debug" to the ./hlds_run command line to generate a debug.log to help with solving this problem Mon Oct 27 17:16:45 EST 2003: Server restart in 10 seconds So I thought I fixed the problem, but I ended up making a new one... lol... geez -Rick' WHERE post_id = 190894 AND is_historical = 1;
