UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'How would it be hacker galore? People are tracked based on three things:Steam IDCD key(s) enteredE-mail addressA Steam account can be banned by banning any of the three from all Steam services. (And in most cases where banning is nessesary I would imagine all 3 would be banned) Steam ID\'s are just unique ID\'s that relate back to your account. They are unique for every e-mail address used to make a Steam account, and hold all of your vital information. (CD key[s], join date, email, etc) Of course creating a new account would give you a new Steam ID, but the account is worthless without a CD key tied to it as well. How is this inviting hacking/cheating? []\n\n__________________ I\'m here to help, don\'t diss me or yell at me for trying to be of assistance.' WHERE post_id = 191550 AND is_historical = 1;
