UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'This does not appear to work. I tried a number of drivers and they were all ignored and the stock files are just reinstated. I even tried very old ones and I tried the very latest opengl build which I know works because I use it with Milkshape and Hammer and there is absolutely no change in performance, much less evidence that any of the drivers are being loaded. To prove this, I ran a detailed task monitor program and actually looked to see what files were being used and found that on my Nvidia G4 4200 card these were the only functioning OPENGL drivers attached to the HL task: Microsoft Corporation C:\\WINDOWS\\System32\\opengl32.dll Microsoft Corporation C:\\WINDOWS\\System32\\GLU32.dll NVIDIA Corporation C:\\WINDOWS\\System32\\nvoglnt.dll whatever was in gldrv/drvmap.txt had no effect whatsoever. Moving these files to the Steam directory serves no purpose. In fact, this thread serves no purpose and just adds to the confusion.' WHERE post_id = 191103 AND is_historical = 1;
