UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by nebula this is utter non-sense, what opengl/d3d driver do u think steam is loading? it doesn\'t have opengl/d3d hardcored into the engine, it calls whatever the system points at, which would be your current video driver api Tru, i was actually gunna follow the instructions of this thread, till i kept reading it. Another thing, I think the added "choppiness" is just do to Valve, or whoever updates cs, adding more graphic enhancments, on a really old game engine that isn\'t optimized for all thos FX, (Aztec rain anyone?) Thats really the only map that gets choppy 4 me, so i dun see what the big fuss is all bout, u guys \'plaining bout 70 to 60 fps??! c\'mon!! I do a steady 30 - 35 fps, and around 15 - 20 when it chopps up. There is no secret formula to fix it, its up to the programmers to PROGRAM better, or to OPTIMIZE the engine for faster fram rates.' WHERE post_id = 191289 AND is_historical = 1;
