UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'kaishin: It isn\'t the type of connection you have that is the problem but what the settings are in Steam ... It doesn\'t just automatically know what type of connection you have. Read my instructions in the post and check your settings. Typical non-modem connections should have a rate of 5000 to 7500 with a maximum of 9999 for internet connections. You can also check and change this in console, just enter "rate" and it will tell you what the setting is. Your specs also said 512k not 256k, which is correct?' WHERE post_id = 198949 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'That load failed error happens to everyone on my server so it\'s not just an individual case, there are over 3000 players that come to the server and every one of them has that problem so look a little deeper into Steams problems rather than everyone elses. If it\'s happening to every system under the sun than it\'s not a local problem, it\'s a steam problem. Also I noticed this just start happening about 2 weeks ago, maybe something in your update is buggin out.' WHERE post_id = 200284 AND is_historical = 1;
