UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I agree with the author of this thread, it is the only thread i have seen in a long while here that is worth anything. I broke out my Cs box, which you can still buy at the store. Now some Dad is going to get this for his 15 year old son with a PC that fits the bill as stated on the box. Now lets say that they are just normal people who like to play PC games... Where would they go, what would they do? I have been playing since 1.3, everything was fine, 1.4 to 1.5 in like a week was a mess, but went off ok. Now this... I think someone should get a law suit for this. You go and pay for something it should work as the direction says! If you go buy a $20,000.00 car and they have you come back over and over for a radio update, sometimes it works... some not. Would you not do something about it? This is the same thing... different scale I know...but still, some people work hard for money, so do not, thats not the point. We all paid for this, ( Ok, there are many ways to get a CD key, not the point ) and we go buy what the product offers... this product is not standing up to what it offers, you can not use older PC\'s, you have to have something much better then what is on the box... that alone is wrong! Sure.. it is playable, i have 3 Pc\'s. One has a 450mhz, 64mb Radeon video card, 512 MB ram, worked great with 1.5, with 1.6... my kid can not play. Yoiu say stick with 1.5? Why should I (WE) have to? We paid for the samething you did, my PC meets and exceeds what is printed on the box... that should be good enough. But it is not! Thats sad!! and very wrong! Sorry to ramble... but this is by far the best post I have seen here! Hats off to the author! I hope you do something about this and are not just blowing smoke or trying to make nosie. Pitt' WHERE post_id = 209408 AND is_historical = 1;
