UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'bout time, only question is, why all of a suddon? I doubt the dod dev team is interested themselves on releasing updates way to late, maybe just to test it for cscz.. But isn\'t it also a fact that a lot of players have given up dod, discouraged by the ages it takes to clear major bugs and glitches - sorry, let me restart: ...to release a patch that the dev certainly have had ready for release for ages, just to test it for some other cause? Having taken dod into retail was just as it seems a step to just rank up the own account, least the dev\'s finally got payed for their work. But going retail is a responsability as well, one that definatly hasn\'t been met at any point. my 3 year old son has mor responsability then some ppl here, it seems. I can only thank the lord that I wasn\'t stupid enough to get the retail version, i was thinking about giving up the mod-version, but paying for something that isn\'t going to be repaired UNTIL the repair of it will be used to test a new product is just insane. I am as it seems going to follow the path of many others and move on to other games, I only feel sorry for those that actually put a lot of work in dod, a game that was fun to play, but if this patch doesn\'t cover up ALL the bugs and not create no new ones, it is over for me... I am not going to wait until the next "test" needs to be done and wait way to long for the next patch. Just wanna give out my thanks to all those ppl that actually tried to keep the game alive...' WHERE post_id = 217839 AND is_historical = 1;
