UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'YES', post_text = 'OMG Cyrax I think thats the problem. I read some where about someone having a problem with hl.exe still being open when steam was closed and to fix this permanately you have to remove the compatability mode. Then I remembered that I had to press ctrl+atl+del for some reason and I closed CS that way and I was able to get back in without having to restart. I am gonna do this straight away and report back. Thank You sooo much! /EDIT YES IT WORKS! Go into C:\\Program Files\\Steam\\SteamApps\\"your email"\\counter-strike and right click on hl.exe and click on the compatability tab and remove compatability. [][] This should be sticked for all those people having the problem with "Game currently not avaliable" problems.\n\n__________________ Eddie' WHERE post_id = 247210 AND is_historical = 1;
