UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Easy HLDS Update Tool v2.0', post_text = 'MOVED, LAST TIME: /forums/...;threadid=50127 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=50127) ------------------------------------------- OLD POST: --------------------------------------------- OLD THREADS: /forums/...;threadid=39033 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=39033) /forums/...;threadid=39270 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=39270) --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- What is this program? This program makes it SIMPLE to update your HLDS and Mods! You just fill in some details, and hit update. Way easier than the command line one that comes with steam. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- December 1, 2003: I FOUND THE PROBLEM!!! THIS *IS* THE WORKING FIX!!! If you have already downloaded the program, and cant get it to run, go into the dir that the EXE is in, and create a BLANK TEXT FILE named "settings.ini" and your problem is FIXED. If you havent, i have included this file in the download below. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Well I have completed version 2 with MANY minor fixes as well as major ones. You can see some screenshots here: http://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpdater/SS1.jpg (http://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpdater/SS1.jpg) <-- Updated for V2 http://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpdater/SS2.jpg (http://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpdater/SS2.jpg) http://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpdater/SS3.jpg (http://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpdater/SS3.jpg) and you can download the utility here: http://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpd...yHLDSUpdate.zip (http://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpdater/EasyHLDSUpdate.zip) PLEASE EVEN IF YOU HAVE NO PROBLEMS AT ALL, POST A REPLY TO BUMP THIS, OR GIVE ME YOUR COMMENTS/SUGGESTIONS. THANK YOU!! Please inform me about ANY and EVERY bug found! no matter how small! Comments and suggestions are GREATLY appreciated. Thanks! NOTE: This is not a *fix* or update for the update tool, its just an easier way of using it. Installing: Extract all of the zip files anywhere on your PC, for best results extract to the same folder as \'HLDSUpdateTool.exe\' (usually C:\\HLServer) Then just run the EXE provided! --KaOs Valve please tell me if you like my work, I would love to hear from you.' WHERE post_id = 249832 AND is_historical = 1;
