get shot.... also the kar is ruined, you have basically given the allies the upper hand, you have weakened the kar, given the garrand more accuracy and left the british rifle alone..lol i think that needs more work too. This is not a flaming post, this is a post that needs to be read, valve your only hurting yourselves here. Since steam has come about the entire HL community has been in kaos. I have faith that you will correct these problems, but it would be nice to know that you actually do intend to do somethign about them... i dunno what to suggest but maybe valve you should pop into a server or two and see for yourself. How do you know it bans players using Cheating-Death? You should not be using CD if you\'re connecting to a VAC server - this warning is clearly written in the documentation for CD. Also, CD does kick you from joining a server if VAC is detected on that server.' WHERE post_id = 258854 AND is_historical = 1;
