UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Steam program opens but doesnt run', post_text = 'My steam opens up but it does not run. The icon is displayed but the game itself doesn\'t run. In the beginning, my 1.6 worked alright, but after awhile it didnot even run anymore. I am hooked up to my UC\'s connection, does that have anything to do with it? When i tried to fix it back at home it was a different problem happening then it was fixed. Once i got back to my college, the previous problem started again. Im thinking its the UC\'s connection. I had to download certain things for the UC\'s connection to actually work on my computer.THis was in the beginning of the school year. I have tried downloading different steam_installs from different mirrors , but all have the same outcome of the steam program not running. Edit by Taylor Sherman: So that people first reading this can find the latest easily: This appears to be caused by a conflict between Steam and McAffee Personal Privacy / Privacy Service software. We\'re looking into what\'s going on and how to fix it. The program "Steganos Internet Anonym" can also cause this problem. Taylor' WHERE post_id = 257481 AND is_historical = 1;
