UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'When I run in developer mode, "developer 1" is the CVAR to enable it, I notice that my Counter-Strike is running into some problems every few seconds [ranging from 20-40s intervals]. I am kind of confused why this happening, and I wonder if anyone can help me. I analyzed the problem like this: I an running: 1.80 Ghz P4 oc 1.99 Soundlive Blaster Live! XGamer+ ATI Radeon 9600 PRO When playing counter-strike, I got the problem "Sentence or Pitch shift ignored. > 16 playing!" every so often, so trying to solve it, I went on google and realized that this was a sound issue, so I turned on my s_eax, since EAX is a creative hardware plugin. Also, I turned off the Sound Acceleration on dixdiag [the Direct X dialog], so that isn\'t the problem. And, no, even if I turn the CVAR developer to 0, the problem still occurs, just it would be reported to me. So, can anyone help me? When either the "Sentence or Pitch shift ignored. > 16 playing!" error or the "sound overrun" error occurs, I notice a BIG latency raise and my bullets become ineffective and my CS lags. This only happens when I am in a fights. When I am facing a few people or more, my bullets become inneffective, unaccurate and everything sort of lags. I get the error "Sentence or Pitch shift ignored > 16"' WHERE post_id = 266826 AND is_historical = 1;
