UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Are People Cheating, Hacking on CS 1.6', post_text = 'Hello everyone .. I am starting this thread to hopefully get some, " PROOF/or Close enough [] " that there are people cheating on 1.6.... I myself have been acused of Hacking on CS, and know for a fact, I AM NOT ! ( happened 2 or 3 times and i\'m really not very good ! ) But it seems to be a non stop wheel of accusations ... that " we all " wind up having to deal with... I also downloaded and tried some, (so called) working cheats for counter strike 1.5 and NONE of these will work, on CS 1.6, because of the nature in which, ( HL.exe is launched ) I only did this because of the non stop arguments , name calling accusations etc..(in servers) with the whole cheating issue... I am soooooo sick of hearing people bad mouth, others behind there back, "that they are hacking" example: Aim Bots;Wall Hacks etc.. I know some "Scripting" for the game (CS), and have made a few maps with "Hammer" and none of the scripts ,I have seen etc.. are really nothing all that bad.. And the respawn thing that another guy was, asking if people were interested in...(on another post) Is an absolutly retarded cheat (if it works) - USLESS & LAME !!! ha ha ha....... So.... if you think YOU can proove to me that, "These" people are actually cheating, or at least explain to me technicly how you can "exec" these hacked Dll\'s or EXE\'s .... let me know ! Cause in my opinion, It\'s a bunch of Paranoid Mis-Informed.. BULL ... \'cause they suck at CS ? oh and if ya diagree with my opinion, no dis respect intended.... Please don\'t flame me to death - a polite response is enough ! ~WESTSIDEBUD~' WHERE post_id = 46146 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'There seem to be more people blatantly cheating in 1.6 beta than in 1.5 and even being arrogant about it and admitting they cheat. But it may just be a case of the small number of beta servers with no admins or admins that are themselves cheating. Once 1.6 is released publicly the good dedicated servers that have good dedicated admins will handle the cheaters better than what is occurring in the beta servers.\n\n__________________ "Basically, what we got was a big floppy boob on national television brought to you by the new AOL 9.0 optimized." - Matt Drudge Waffles are no more than a vehicle for butter and syrup...' WHERE post_id = 46148 AND is_historical = 1;
