UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'er.....so what?', post_text = 'ok this is kinda nice but...eh...what are you all woo-hooing about? These are minor changes I say. Dont get me wrong, it\'s good they fix these things but I think they should care more about things like these! -AA which doesnt work right now: FPS drop like MAD also Direct3d is not quite bugless yet, altough really close. -the dual elites suck (no-one would even like them as a start-round gift like the USP or Glock. These weapons actually are useable) -almost all other pistols (non-glock, non-usp, non-deagle) are not worth buying :P... almost noone likes them well enough to actually buy them every round... no-one is serious about consistency in buying them, even when using a shield when most players will just take the "good old" desert eagle... -TMP, UMP, P90, Mac-10 are almost always not even near the effectiveness of the Mp5. These are my suggestions for future updates. WALTER PPK WISHES A HAPPY NEW YEAR TO EVERYBODY!!! except to Osama bin Laden and Sadam Houssein []. **** them []' WHERE post_id = 297338 AND is_historical = 1;
