UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'That problem appears to now be under control, but there is one that is out of the hands of the extremely hardworking Cyber X crew, and that is a problem with Counterstrike and Valve. There is a long series of e-mails between Valve and the Cyber X crew, in which Valve said they would be on site an offer support, and a few other things. Valve didn\'t show, and what little support it offered came way way too late to make a difference. A hint to companies, when 1200+ of your most rabid fans are in a room together playing the game that made you, and is much of your ongoing income, don\'t blow off the people who set the event up. taken from http://www.theinquirer.net/?article=13552 (http://www.theinquirer.net/?article=13552)' WHERE post_id = 309490 AND is_historical = 1;
