UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Take the time to go to the inquirer website and read the info', post_text = 'Some of you guys that are posting are ignoring the news report from the inquirer folks who have people actually in Las Vegas at the CES. Also KillerKoala and others are obviously ignoring the fact that every major electronics ,pc, manufacturing company , along with vendors such as Compusa are there. Seeing it all play out first hand. more excerpts from the article : That problem appears to now be under control, but there is one that is out of the hands of the extremely hardworking Cyber X crew, and that is a problem with Counterstrike and Valve. There is a long series of e-mails between Valve and the Cyber X crew, in which Valve said they would be on site an offer support, and a few other things. -------------------- Ah Valve obviously was supposed to support and did people there who didn\'t bother to help. -------------------- You guys fail to see how damaging this is to Valve\'s reputation. Who else is there? Representatives of the US Army whom designed America\'s army which is also being played there.' WHERE post_id = 309625 AND is_historical = 1;
