UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Same here man our east server people\'s pings have increased 50% - 70% since the update. Needless to say since it was cal match night we got our rear ends handed to us. By the way we tried switching our rates around on our match server from cl_cmdrate 10 - 40 cl_updaterate 10 - 40 rate 9000 - 2000 We found that we could go all the way to 10 and not have high pings (on scoreboard) or any choke or loss (on netgraph) but when you played it felt really laggy. So I am not sure what is going on, all I know is we are ping high on all 3 of our servers now. Pings are high from HLSW or server list as well not only when in the server. Just to update everyone I logged in this morning and it still pings high, we have 3 servers, 2 match server and 1 public server and they are all updated and have been rebooted several times. I am not sure what else to check. ===Specs=== Windows 2000 SP4 Processor: Dual Processors P4 3.2 ghz Ram: 1 gig 32 Player Server Latest Version of all Plugins Latest Version of HLDS' WHERE post_id = 319112 AND is_historical = 1;
