UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'PAIN: liblist.game file', post_text = 'Why does DOD keep trying to update the liblist.gam file (in listen server mode)? For people running DOD bots ( www.sturmbot.net (http://www.sturmbot.net) ) we require to modify the liblist.gam file ... gamedll "sturmbot\\dlls\\STURM_bot.dll" This file keeps getting overridden when we launch dod in steam. Workaround #1) One solution was to force this file as "READ ONLY". This only works up until the time when DOD gets an update. The next time DOD is launched, and the liblist.gam file is still READ ONLY, dod crashes. Workaround #2) Turn off READ ONLY. Watch DOD replace the liblist.gam file. Exit DOD, update liblits.gam file and turn READ ONLY back on. This is one pain we would like eliminated (still allowing us to play DOD of course). If anyone can shed some light on us 56kers that still play DOD because of bots, please give us hope. Thanks, Gooofy' WHERE post_id = 346262 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'It should be said that making it read-only doesn\'t do jack squat if your HDD is FAT32. And gamestartup.mp3 has the same problem. If it is replaced DOD ALWAYS overwrites it with the original.' WHERE post_id = 346541 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'thats weird i have mine to read only and my Sturmbot and DoD work fine [] ive had it set on that for like a month or two and ive had no probs [] and im useing Win ME and all works fine [] and i use Sturmbot allot bigtime with your waypoints Gooofy and allso with Gotchas [] i even have my Config file set to Read-Only and have had no probs with that too [] but there is alot that Steam and DoD Dev need to fix in here [] im still waiting on a dam DoD update or a nice Steam update [] they seem to update dam CS alot more then DoD :P' WHERE post_id = 346605 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'back it up. make a copy called liblist.bak, and after dod updates, delete the new one, and change the name of the old one to liblist.gam.' WHERE post_id = 346727 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'LIBLIST.GAM file cure is here (steam only)', post_text = 'Jowo just pointed this out to me: Steam News February 9, 2004, 6:26 pm (/?area=news) .... "Greg Coomer" quote: ENGINE (all games) Added new command line option "-dll"; Syntax is -dll [game_dll_to_load] Which means that the LIBLIST.GAM file does NOT need to be touched at all. Instead just add -dll sturmbot\\dlls\\STURM_bot.dll to the Day of Defeat launch options. Instructions: 1. Steam -> Games 2. Click on Day of Defeat with the right mouse button 3. Select Properties 3. Click on Launch Options 4. Enter: -dll sturmbot\\dlls\\STURM_bot.dll 5. Click OK 6. Click CLOSE 7. Double click on Day of Defeat That\'s it. Note: If you have LIBLIST.GAM file as READ ONLY, I recommend that you take READ ONLY off, as it (used to) prevents patches for Day of Defeat from installing properly.' WHERE post_id = 367562 AND is_historical = 1;
