UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Complete Mod List for Half-Life and half-Life 2!', post_text = 'Complete Mod List for Half-Life and half-Life 2! These are a couple of sucky/good/great mods. (My opinion) [=============================================] Half-Life Mods List [=============================================] Sven CO-OP (http://www.svencoop.com/) (good for the 1st few times its played) Natural Selection (http://www.natural-selection.org/) (great) Adrenaline Gamer (http://www.planethalflife.com/agmod/) (great) FireArms (http://www.firearmsmod.com/) (good) Surprise (http://www.planethalflife.com/ps07/) (great fun) Mission Failed (http://www.neodelight.com/missionfailed/) (good single player) Hostile Intent (http://www.planethalflife.com/hostileintent/index.asp) (havnt played it much yet cant say) Earths Special Forces (http://www.esforces.com/) (Good) Science and Industry (http://www.planethalflife.com/si/) (sucky) The Battle Grounds (http://www.bgmod.com/) (never tryed it) International Online Soccer (http://www.planethalflife.com/ios/) (never tryed it) Digital Paintball (http://www.digitalpaintball.net/?site=2&sid=) (never tryed it) The Specialists (http://www.specialistsmod.net/) (great) Grenades, Snarks & Teleporters (http://www.planethalflife.com/gst/) (sucky) Bumper Cars (http://www.planethalflife.com/bumpercars/) (sucky) Public Enemy (http://www.public-enemy.org/page/index.php?page=news&lang=engl) (Looks cool) Morbid Inclination (http://www.planethalflife.com/morbid/) (sucky) Weapons Factory (http://www.planethalflife.com/hlwf/index.html) (sucky) Glitter\'s HL-GUN (http://www.glitterstream.net/hl_gun/) (havnt tryed it yet) Counter-Life (http://cl.cscentral.com/) (good single player) Dragonmod Z (http://dmz.flagrun.net/index.php) (havnt tryed it yet) Underworld (http://www.planethalflife.com/features/motw/underworld.shtm) (good) Wanted (http://www.planethalflife.com/features/motw/wantedhl.shtm) (good) Frontline Force (http://www.planethalflife.com/features/motw/flf15.shtm) (good) Escape (http://www.dmc-interactive.de/escape/index.html) (not sure but i think i played this before dont remember, but if it is what im thinking it was good) Holy Wars (http://www.planethalflife.com/holywars/news.htm) (sucky) They Hunger 1-3/others (http://www.planethalflife.com/manke/) (great) InstaGIB:HL (http://www.planethalflife.com/instagib/) (sucky) Resident Evil The Escape (http://www.planethalflife.com/rete/) (Really looking forward to this one) Sex, Drugs & Beer Can (http://www.s-t-u-f-f.com/mod) (Looks dumb) Global Warfare (http://dynamic6.gamespy.com/~globalwarfare/) (Looks cool) Defiance (http://www.frontline2.com) (Played it a while back really didnt like it) Nightwatch (http://www.hl-nightwatch.net) (Really looking forward to this one) Poke646 (http://www.poke646.com/) (Looks ok, Still need to play it) Bushido (http://www.planethalflife.com/bushido/) (very interesting) Chemical Existence (http://www.redgenesis.com/ce/ce.shtml) (Hum.. Maybe if they updated it would be good hehe) Counter-Strike Deathmatch (http://cs-dm.cjb.net/) (This would be cool if they finished it) Unknown (http://www.dbpshome.com/) (dunno i would like to see some ss) Unknown (http://eftd.netzgames.net) (Looks good) Half-Life Rally (http://www.hlrally.net/) (Not a big racing fan but ill still give it a shot) Counter-Strike 1.3 mod (http://www.cs13mod.com/) (for the people who like 1.3) Tour of Duty (http://www.tourofdutymod.com/) (Not into war games but for whoever is this mod looks good) Main Site (http://www.halfquake.com) HalfQuake (http://farm.muddasheep.com/hq/) HalfQuake2 (http://farm.muddasheep.com/hq2) Halfquake3 (http://farm.muddasheep.com/hq3) (Never got to play these mods but they look good, when i find some time ill check them out) Goldeneye (http://www.terragna.com/goldeneye/news.php) (Has potential lets see what they will do) Monkey Strike (http://www.monkeystrike.com/) (really dont know what to say about this :/) Water Wars (http://www.water-wars.net/ww.php) (looks fun) Test Your Skill (http://www.tys-mod.de.vu/) (Havnt played it yet) Gangwars (http://www.gangwars.net/) (Dont feel this will be worth while) Sweet Half-life (http://www2d.biglobe.ne.jp/~ks_wca/shlhtm/shl_fm_e.htm) (Looks interesting) Nostalgia (http://www.planethalflife.com/nostalgia/) (Havnt played it yet) Paroxysm (http://dynamic3.gamespy.com/~paroxysm/site/news.shtml) (Havnt played it yet) Escape From Woomera (http://www.escapefromwoomera.org/) (Looks Cool, will try it when i get more time) Escape From Woomera walkthrough (http://users.tpg.com.au/shinobe/EscapeFromWoomera-Walkthrough.doc) [=============================================] For more mods check out these sites. [=============================================] http://www.planethalflife.com/espacemod/us_index.html (http://www.planethalflife.com/espacemod/us_index.html) http://www.moddb.com/ (http://www.moddb.com/) http://www.half-life.hu/indexeng.php (http://www.half-life.hu/indexeng.php) [=============================================] Half-Life 2 Mods [=============================================] Coldwar: Melting Point (http://cw-meltingpoint.hl2files.com/) (Looks ok) Neoshock Online (http://www.neoshockmod.net/) (Looking forward to this one) Stormforge (http://www.stormforge.dk/index.htm) (Looks real good) Aftermath (http://www.planetunreal.com/aftermath/news.htm) (Dunno looks ok but we will see) Infected (http://infected.half-lifenews.com/) (Interesting) Team Fortress Classic 2 (http://www.tfc2.net/) (Team Fortress Classic Fans watch out) Silenced (http://silencedmod.suddenlaunch.com/) (Really looking forward to this one, Here are some screens for this mod http://mods.moddb.com/gallery/2119/?start=0 (http://mods.moddb.com/gallery/2119/?start=0)) Resistance & liberation (http://www.resistanceandliberation.com/) (Looks real good) Renegade X: The Dead 6 (http://www.renevo.com/d6/index.php) (Really looking forward to this one) Post Apocalypse (http://postapocalypse.vaneede.com/?page=home) (Looks ok, looking forward to it) XX7 (http://www.007gaming.com/xx7/index.php) (Doesnt look so great but we will see) Project Ascension (http://www.projectascension.org/) (Not much to see but still good to follow) No More Room In Hell (http://nmrh.hlgaming.com/index.php) (Hum Interesting) Nuclear Dreams (http://www.nucleardreams.com/index.php) (Going to keep an out for this one looks good) Operation: CO-IN (http://www.opcoin.net/) (Looks worth while) Dawn of the Dead (http://www.littlelostpoly.co.uk/Dodmain.htm) (Dont know about this eh will see when it gets released) Hull Breach (http://www.hull-breach.com) (Really looking forward to this one) Eternal Silence (http://www.eternal-silence.net/) (Cant wait for this mod to come out looks really good) Chaos ops (http://www.chaosops.net) (Eh doesnt look like something worth while) War of the Worlds (http://wotw.scifiheaven.net/) (War Of the Worlds mod seems interesting. StarGate: Brokenoath (http://www.brokenoath.net/) (bassed on a old movie stargate this might be something interesting) Black Dragon (http://www.blackdragonmod.com/) (The planes look neat waiting on this one) Firstmoon (http://www.firstmoon.net/) (Looks like a good single player mod) Dracten (http://www.dracten.halflife-mods.com/news.php) (This looks like a really good single player fast passed action game) Crisis 51 (http://crisis51.hl2db.com) (not enough info for me to say anything) Boones End (http://www.boones-end.com/?section=index) (This looks great cant wait) [============================================] Have fun playing! If anyone has a different opinion about the mods plz post what you think. I would also like if people posted mods that i havnt posted and the link to the site where i can download them. +---------------------------------+ |List updated June 28 2004| +---------------------------------+\n\n__________________ ----------------------------------------------- #Exidence @ irc.gamesurge.net -----------------------------