UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'CD Key', post_text = 'This is very frustrating. Its been a while since I have played HL. bought the game several years ago, and loved it. The CD became so scratched, I went out and bought the Platinum Edition, I think. It came with all 4 games. Well its an older version so I needed to update it to play online. I spent forever looking for the update and then when I tried to use gamespy get the updated files, I had to sit and wait for 2 hours for the download to start. I dont understand why Valve cant have the updates on their own site. If they do, I sure can\'t find them. Well, after 10 hours of downloading I was able to update. I set up my steam account and tried to play. I was bummed when it made my machine crash over and over. I gave up. Now I have a new machine, and loaded HL, waited 2 hours to download update from Gamespy again. Luckily , i have cable now so it only took an hour to get the update this time. So, now i have a new machine, cable connection, new account, and my cd key is invalid. Son of a *&*(^. Then it took me 2 days to be able to post here. Do you want my business or not? It seems so easy to fix the cd key issue, My question is... ARE YOU GOING TO FIX IT? A little feedback from the powers to be would be nice. Even if you just lie to us, its better than not answering the issue of " the cd Key" I would think the easier it is to use Steam, the more players you would have, and the more software you would sell.' WHERE post_id = 414732 AND is_historical = 1;
