UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Heh, Thanks I\'ve never been called on specifically. The Steam.DLL problem is the one I have actually had, and acutally solved for Steam. (well solved the way to fix it quickest) So I\'ll start with it. First, you have to go to your Steam Folder, then click on the program \'UNWISE\' (it slightly resembles the recycle bin) Next, let it uninstall using the "automatic" mode. After this has happened you no longer have steam on your computer :\'( but heres how to get it back and fixed. [] First get the latest installer from /download/SteamInstall.exe (/download/SteamInstall.exe) This link is the straight DL from steam, how nice of them to be considerate and not make you sit through two hour lines on Fileplanet or Fileshack eh? Ok once you have the installer, its simple! Install steam! And it will work, everyone who has had this problem, and followed my guidelines for fixing it are now playing on steam once again. The Win32 Problem has been touched on by steam in the red "Read First" Threads. Next time I see waldo or Sherman online, i will also ask them for updated information on this problem to give to you all. (p.S. Thanks for the thank you. [] When you get your Steam//Cs working would you like to play? Aim me: xPiXoNx --- No hate mail on that please only here people [] )' WHERE post_id = 432920 AND is_historical = 1;
