UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'IMPORTANT: For Those With Input Lag Problems', post_text = 'Since the last update there have been more and more people complaining about input lag. This is NOT connection loss or choke nor is it an FPS problem, it is problem *ONLY* with the last 2 Steam updates. The symptoms are: A significant (0.5-3second) delay from mouse movement or keyboard input to them taking effect ingame. This is usually intermittant rather than constant. No lag whatsoever when specating, ie. Other people ingame appear to move/shoot perfectly normally. I say again: THIS IS NOT A CONNECTION BUG. No FPS drop lower than the previous updates have caused. So far no members of Staff have commented on any of this, those of us suffering with this problem have been flamed for not reading the Sticky threads concerning ATI FPS Drops or Laggy Server Connections. Once again THIS IS NOT A PROBLEM WITH RATES OR FPS. I have not changed any of my settings, either Steam or Hardware related, since the update before this happened. All my other games work perfectly well, as did Steam before the Offline Mode update. This is a very real a serious problem affecting all Steam games, and I\'ll keep bumping this until someone from Valve responds with a valid answer. If you need to know, I\'m running: WinXP Home SP1 Athlon XP 2400+ 512Meg Ram 256Meg Radeon 9600Pro Microsoft Optial Mouse with Standard Keyboard If you have the same problem (*That is, input Lag NOT connection or FPS problems*) please post here with your system spec.' WHERE post_id = 438308 AND is_historical = 1;
