UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'not just one bug', post_text = 'Aside from the fact that it has been two weeks since there "update" has reaked havoc on systems everywhere... [rant] Strikes me as ood as when virii do this we call it a crime... when software companies do it it\'s called a bug. Bug... Virus... hmmm [/rant] I\'m not having just the crash bug.. I have posted this in another thread and others agreed they are having a hard time with it as well... quote:Originally posted by Targeted I don\'t know if anyone else has this problem as well but it is related to the ones mentioned above. Please be constructive in your comments. I notice usually when I start out playing DOD that I get really good on targeted kills. By targeted I mean my crosshairs are narrowed and I get a what you see is what you get type shooting soloutions. After some time of playiing it seems that the stability of my shooting soloution weakens. That is to say I shoot but do not hit my targets in the crooshair field. While I tend to use a semi automatic soloution I can really feel this difference. If I use an automatic it\'s alot less evident but can tell it to some extent. I have checked to make sure its not lag. Typically i can play in the 45-60ish pings and thats what I\'m used too. After this starts happening..it is only a matter of time before DOD will crash. Sometimes its not long after sometimes its way after Any ideas anyone? Others backed me up on this. So it\'s not just one bug we are talking about. Not to mention that it\'s thier update that messed it up. Obviously it doesn\'t take a genius to figure this..back out the "update" since so many people are having problems untill they fix it(which would require them using people to beta test OTHER than US!!!) I\'m starting to picture the standard attire at Valve\\Steam is white lab coats. Gues what we get... mouse ears and whiskers..and guess what we ain\'t the Mousekateers people!!!!' WHERE post_id = 470433 AND is_historical = 1;
