UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'The real reason CZ won\'t make it!', post_text = 'My biggest complaint about the game and I think the downfall of it, is the lack of backwards compatibility with cs 1.6 Dedicated Servers. Example: I am in a clan of 31 members, Our server runs cs 1.6 all of our clan members run cs 1.6. not to mention the Hundreds of "regular" players that come to our server to play with us. I just purchased a copy of CZ. I can NOT use it to play with my fellow clan mates. I will still be playing CS 1.6 every night with my fellow clan members, and having a blast......... If I run CZ I will be playing on a small number of servers out there with people I don\'t know.. If any of have ever been in a clan you will see the problem of getting everyone to change. Community is what made this game BIG. CZ has no community, It is alieneted itself due to the lack of backwards compatiblity. and lack of IMPROVEMENTS that would make people want to upgrade... Look at what makes CS popular, at peak times there are about 90,000 people playing CS at once world wide. It\'s the fact that it IS popular that attracts new customers(players) The CZ version will be just like any other online game out there, it will have a following, but why should people stop playing something that is already a MASS played GAME!!! It would NOT be worth it to convince my fellow clan members that the clan as a whole should upgrade. Then convince all the hundreds of Regulars that play on our server to upgrade as well. If both of those things don\'t happen at "ONE TIME" then it won\'t happen at ALL. now when HL2 comes out and there is a online version with dedicated servers, and the graphics engine is better, maps better, models better, and so on then That is a compeling reason for an upgrade....' WHERE post_id = 462751 AND is_historical = 1;
