UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Re: Sloppy work, just very sloppy', post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Devlin I\'m wondering if you guys are lacking resources. Logically, you haven\'t published in 5 years and did a lot of development. That\'s a hellof a bill to pay. That about sums it up in a nutshell. Valve isn\'t a big company, everybody tends to confuse it with a large (sometimes international) company. They don\'t have a lot of people to work on every single bug fix you want, but it\'s on their to-do list (eventually). Valve put all the money they got from HL + a bit more and put it into the development of HL2. THis was said numerous times from Gabe Newell in interviews I have seen over the internet. That\'s not a whole lot of money left to hire new support reps or a bug development team. Just be patient.\n\n__________________ Get your official Killer Koala postings right here at steampowered.com. Now with over 1800+ posts to my name, that shows dedication!' WHERE post_id = 470775 AND is_historical = 1;
