UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'request for statement from valve', post_text = 'This is a request for some kind of statement regarding the future of the counterstrike: condition zero title from a valve employee. I know you are aware that many of your customers were left a bit confiused regarding the condition of the released title and its content. Some of your customers have shown great frustration at what they ended up buying. Although some users are completely happy and may not agree with those that are showing such frustration. It\'s my hopes that you can release some kind of statement regarding its future. Even something simple like "Don\'t worry cs fans, were working hard on new content and patches and they will be coming in the future. Sorry can\'t commit to a date, but its coming." would do us all wonders. Thank you for taking the time to read my thread. -Me P.S. Guys lets please keep this one flame free. It\'s in everyones best interest here. Just keep it bumped =)' WHERE post_id = 471851 AND is_historical = 1;
