UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Snagging CZero stuff and linking to it is a big "NO" on here', post_text = 'No. No no no no no. NO OK guys. We want to make it really clear that posting links to, or information on how to extract or get CZero stuff is a big "NO". No links to extracted files, stuff you "found" that got leaked, etc. I know it\'s "easy" to do, and I\'m sure some of you think Valve "owes" you this. But the bottom line is it\'s not exactly legal at all. Go talk about it somewhere else all you want, but not on Valve\'s own forums. You\'ll find threads on this subject will be closed, and the posters banned depending on how obvious (ie, stupid given this warning) the poster is.' WHERE post_id = 474947 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Pay to play on Steam. Now official? (see Screenshots)', post_text = 'Hi, I just read that there will be a online fee to play via steam. Is it now official? I read that payment software will come out within one of the next updates. http://www.counter-strike.de/newspics/counter-strike.de/200404/news-1-1080774604.jpg (http://www.counter-strike.de/newspics/counter-strike.de/200404/news-1-1080774604.jpg) http://www.counter-strike.de/newspics/counter-strike.de/200404/news-2-1080774604.jpg (http://www.counter-strike.de/newspics/counter-strike.de/200404/news-2-1080774604.jpg) Look at the screenshots. I guess we all knew, that this will happen sooner or later. Damn, I will not pay to play via this crapy steam s h i t. Even if it will just cost 1 $ a year. Is there any way to play CS 1.6 and DOD without steam? What will you do? It is pretty obvious that this is fake. Valve is a US company and in the US we use \'.\' not \',\' to seperate dollars and cents. Not only is the creator obviously European but he needs to try harder and do his homework. Also, IC Wiener I would like to see you edit this out now. Now your thread will die a slow painful death cause you made me lock it. Love Intrepid00' WHERE post_id = 489477 AND is_historical = 1;
