UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Ping Spikes', post_text = 'My ping spikes from ~70 to 200 (sometimes up to 1000) on all servers; causing a pause in the game. I first noticed it when the "offline" patch came out. This problem has pushed me away from Counter-Strike and often frustrates me when I try to play the game because it has become unbarable. This problem only seems to occur when playing games on Steam. Some days I will be fine, the next I will lag. I can play for hours without this lag, leave, and come back at a later time and be lagging. I usually notice the spikes when a sound goes off, but thats not the only time I spike, its always happening. I dont know what to do anymore because I have tried everything. I recently saw a post about error logs and I went to check mine. I have error logs for everyday as it seems. The following are the two errors that I am getting in the logs: Error:Failed to load dialog file Resource/UI/CareerBackgroundMenu.res Function trace: CGameUI::Start CGameUI::Initialize CBaseUI::Start CBaseUI::Initialize Host_Init CFileSystem_Steam::Mount() And... Error:Failed to load dialog file Resource/UI/ClassMenu.res Function trace: My system is not all that great, but it has run Counter-Strike lag-free in the past. AMD Athlon 750 mhz 512 Ram GeForce 4 - 64mb I have hardly any programs running in the background and turning them off seems to do nothing. I have searched for all any adware, spyware, and viruses. I have played with my rates and still nothing. So, any help would be great.' WHERE post_id = 492604 AND is_historical = 1;
