UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I may of found a solution, at least I think it works for me. What I have done, is turned off my "System Scan" on my virus scanner and it seems to do much better. System Scan scans almost every file at the second that it is used. It also expains the lag when sounds go off in Counter-Strike because it is scanning that file; and of course using system resources. I hope this helps to anyone else with this problem.' WHERE post_id = 496556 AND is_historical = 1;
