oad speed, resume downloads if you are disconnected and you can even schedule downloads for the middle of the night (it will automatically dial up and download the desired file and hang up when done) when you aren\'t using your pc. credit: http://forums.speedguide.net/showthread.php?t=68127 (http://forums.speedguide.net/showthread.php?t=68127) you can get the programs mentioned [cablenut, tcpoptimizer] @ www.speedguide.net (http://www.speedguide.net) or type the names into www.google.com (http://www.google.com) first link is correct one He just copyed and pasted from the Offical Steam Powered user fourms. why didnt he just made a link instead of just copy - paste it.' WHERE post_id = 1301056 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'VAC and the Banned. How many is too many?', post_text = 'Gentlemen: A simple question really.... I have noticed a huge increase in the number of "I\'m banned but I never cheated/hacked/haxor etc etc" threads and posts. It appears Steam-Valve has made VAC more and more strict in banning hacks and/or possible hacks with the result that some innocent users are being banned. 1. How many of these "I didn\'t do it" posts are legit? Are they ALL crying because they got caught or are some truely innocent? 2. If any are truely innocent, how many innocent players who are getting banned is too many? 10? 100? 1000? Remember...if there are actually innocent people out there getting banned, the next one could be you. Looking forward to your response. Regards, Zot' WHERE post_id = 501233 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'One of the main reasons why you might have seen a recent increase in those "I got baned but dinnit do no thnig" threads was because 2500 people were banned by mistake by VAC. Those people have been unbanned.\n\n__________________ Describe a color' WHERE post_id = 501247 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by bgesley426 One of the main reasons why you might have seen a recent increase in those "I got baned but dinnit do no thnig" threads was because 2500 people were banned by mistake by VAC. Those people have been unbanned. they have been, yes, but all the posts lately are obviously after april 1st... i really do think some of them are innocent. my step brother was banned and he told me about it. he was confused like "why the heck did it ban me? i didn\'t do anything." no he isn\'t a 12 year old...he\'s 18 for your guys\' information. and i know he sure as hell didn\'t cheat.\n\n__________________ <!-- Learn to incorporate what your thread is about INTO THE TITLE of the thread before posting!!!11 -->' WHERE post_id = 501270 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'banned', post_text = 'If buy scrpts are a hack then i\'m guilty. But i sure don\'t think you guys should ban me a year. You should atleast give people warnings. I have never cheated in my life at any game and i don\'t think that its fair for you to ban people for nothing or even using a buy script. atleast without a warning. STEAM_0:1:2287488' WHERE post_id = 501334 AND is_historical = 1;
