UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Backward facing players', post_text = 'Whos seen this bug in CS/CZ where you are looking at a player and it appears they are looking away from you when they are in fact facing you? It sems to have appeared more frequently over the past 4-6 weeks. Questions: --------------- 1) how often have you seen it? 2) When did you see it first? 3) Can you re-create it? 4) Were you runnning custom skins? 5) Was it CS or CZ or another mod? Any other info you can provide?' WHERE post_id = 544310 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Ive seen it a couple of times in the past week. 1) on the overpass in avalanche i was coming out of axis house to go across to church, though i had a nife kill...but no 2) under the bridge on kalt. I dont know if i can re-create it, i try not to, but ill see. No i was not running custom skins, and it was DoD, for those who dont know the maps. both kills were with the Thompson, i dont know if that matters. If i think of anything else, ill give it a try. Ill also go opn a 24-7 Ava/Kalt server and run of demo. Nothin better to do with the hd space []' WHERE post_id = 544329 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'ocarD, from what I have been able to determine this problem is prevalent in all official mods at the moment, at varying degrees in each. However, I have yet to observe the phenomena on any unofficial Steam mod. It is quite common in Counter-Strike/Condition Zero, and not nearly as much in the others, but a problem nonetheless. While I\'m not sure of the exact timeframe it appeared over, it may have been introduced with the 2.09 update [Someone else please confirm this]. I\'m still attempting to determine the situation that seems to be the cause, will report back later. BTW, it does not have anything to do with the use of custom models, as this has been observed by me on full default games of CS and DoD. ---Working on getting a good demo, will email.' WHERE post_id = 544353 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Thanks for the replies so far, please keep them coming. If anyone can get me a demo that would be helpful as well. 2/9/04 seems about right for the bug.' WHERE post_id = 544374 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'i play deathmatch on cs alot. since its nonstop play and people are constantly spawning in, i get this bug and sux cuz i think theyre lookin one way, i pull out knife and i get shot [] by them. since we\'re on the topic of bugs, i also noticed that the appenddemo command doesnt add to the file specified. unless its supposed to be different from 1.5 i type the following and it works in 1.5 record blah stop appenddemo blah 3 stop playdemo blah and it only plays the first part. it be different for 1.6? also... [] anyone notice how now you can literally fly when youre in the air and get shot up? i was in a server where i started off with 255 life and jumped towards a CT who was spraying me with his colt, his bullets kept pushing me back quite a distance and i was in the air. i know it had nothin to do with the server cuz its happened to me on normal match servers that have no mods.' WHERE post_id = 544569 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by |CC|Animal 100MB HDD LOL' WHERE post_id = 545083 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Re: Backward facing players', post_text = '1) how often have you seen it? No that often, maybe four or five times over the last six weeks or so. Each time it was confined to a particular session, if I shut down CS and played later in the day the problem was not evident. 2) When did you see it first? About 6 weeks ago I think. 3) Can you re-create it? Not purposefully - it seems random. 4) Were you runnning custom skins? No, only running the official skins. 5) Was it CS or CZ or another mod? CS 1.6' WHERE post_id = 545138 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = '1) How often have you seen it? Very frequently in the last 2 weeks. It happens in almost every server I play on at least once. 2) When did you first see it? About six weeks ago, but it only became a serious problem about 2 weeks ago. 3) Can you re-create it? Not intentionally, but it happens very frequently for me in servers. 4) Were you running custom skins? Yes - Wolf Recon (updated for 1.6) (http://www.csnation.net/skins/view_skin.php?id=3620) for CT\'s and Killage People (http://www.csnation.net/skins/view_skin.php?id=3894) for the Terrorists. However I have experienced it in CZ (less frequently) with the default models. 5) Was it CS or CZ or another mod? Most frequent in CS 1.6, yet still happens in CZ.' WHERE post_id = 545217 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'This happens all the time', post_text = '1. All the time. 2. Playing Counter-Strike. 3. Um it just happens while playing Counter-Strike or Counter-Strike: Condition Zero. 4. No. 5. I\'ve only seen it in Counter-Strike and Counter-Strike: Condition Zero.' WHERE post_id = 545245 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = '1) how often have you seen it? On an evening playing for 3-4 hours it appears one time at a minimum 2) When did you see it first? maybe about 2 months ago 3) Can you re-create it? No. But maybe it only appears, when an opponent is behind a wall firing/looking in another direction and then comes to my sight und he still looks in the "wrong" direction but killing me... 4) Were you runnning custom skins? No. My CS is standard 5) Was it CS or CZ or another mod? CS. Don\'t playing other Mods [] -- I think I haven\'t seen this bug on Cheating-Death servers, only on VAC servers... (but I want bet on this [])' WHERE post_id = 545262 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = '1) how often have you seen it? ...as often as a grenade kill? 2) When did you see it first? Yesterday, actually. 3) Can you re-create it? I saw this in two instances where players had shot instantly after reloading. They seem to be shooting at me while facing another direction. I\'m not sure that this is the cause, but I\'ll try to recreate it. 4) Were you runnning custom skins? No. 5) Was it CS or CZ or another mod? Counter-Strike.' WHERE post_id = 545353 AND is_historical = 1;
