UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by retribution ocarD, from what I have been able to determine this problem is prevalent in all official mods at the moment, at varying degrees in each. However, I have yet to observe the phenomena on any unofficial Steam mod. It is quite common in Counter-Strike/Condition Zero, and not nearly as much in the others, but a problem nonetheless. While I\'m not sure of the exact timeframe it appeared over, it may have been introduced with the 2.09 update [Someone else please confirm this]. I\'m still attempting to determine the situation that seems to be the cause, will report back later. BTW, it does not have anything to do with the use of custom models, as this has been observed by me on full default games of CS and DoD. ---Working on getting a good demo, will email. It hapens in cs to, and alot. Last night i played on assult as T, I was the last one on the T team, and one CT left. I was standing behind him, and i he was standing whit his back to me. I zoomed in whit AWP and his still standing whit his back to. Just as i was going to shot him i got a bullet in my head. I know he wasent cheating couse we was on a LAN and someone did watch his screen as it happend......... SO.......its not just MODS that has this problem.' WHERE post_id = 554703 AND is_historical = 1;
