UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Buggy Buggy :)', post_text = 'Questions: --------------- 1) how often have you seen it? 2) When did you see it first? 3) Can you re-create it? 4) Were you runnning custom skins? 5) Was it CS or CZ or another mod? Any other info you can provide? A1) Daily, I play anywhere of 6-11hrs a day, so yes I see this allot A2) hard to say....I recently started playin allot 3 weeks ago A3) It seems to happen everytime to the same player that I view. A regular of a server that I admin on. So I would say yes I could recreate it A4) No, I don\'t use any custom skins, only a custom spray image A5) I first noticed it on CZ. The server I play on runs the AMX-Mod Other: At first I had isolated it to a certain player because I get it with this player everytime they are on, I at first thought it was a hack but then I saw it on a couple more players. I\'m begining to wonder if it has something to do with a Mod or Plugin that the servers are using. Could possibly be messing up a certain section of coding.' WHERE post_id = 556372 AND is_historical = 1;
