UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Answer', post_text = '1) how often have you seen it? About everytime I play the game fo more than 10 minutes 2) When did you see it first? Around early Mars I think 3) Can you re-create it? Yes, it\'s easy, just turn 89 degrees and people watching you thinks you look sideways, possbile glitch is that you now can turn the torso, and the legs does\'nt rotate until a 90 degree turn. Remember that the hitboxes are made for an unturnable torso (my guess) and thats why it\'s harder to hit someone with the modelbug. 4) Were you runnning custom skins? No, all default. 5) Was it CS or CZ or another mod? Both mods, but less frequent in CZ (or I perhaps play it less)' WHERE post_id = 585308 AND is_historical = 1;
