UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by ripieces 20040507_hitboxbug.zip (~477 KByte) (http://home.arcor.de/matrixstorm/files/cstrike/20040507_hitboxbug.zip) here it comes, plz tell me if it the demo works (recorded on de_dust just ~8 minutes before this post). plz don\'t download to often cause of traffic, thx. I got yr demo ripieces I have my own here: http://whisper.ausgamers.com/downloads/hitboxe.dem (http://whisper.ausgamers.com/downloads/hitboxe.dem) So far, I have not seen any response from Valve reagarding the whole hitbox issue. If they have can they post the link here? Another idea would be top create a demo with hitbox sized models, that are just the polygons that make up the hitboxes so you can see precisely how far out of whack the hitboxes are. Thanks' WHERE post_id = 592169 AND is_historical = 1;
