UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = '@Whisper Thx 4 your demo (-e), but I am sorry: I guess your demo does not show the bug. [i]You\'re hitting the other player in his arm-hitbox, because of the recoil of your usp, so it is not a bug.[/u] The other player should have turned around a little, then you would get better results. You can draw the clientside hitboxes when recording for comparision: 1. sv_cheats must be turned on on server and client. 2. proceed to a new level (cvar shall not be overwritten). 3. now type on your client r_drawentities 3 in console (1= normal; 2= bones; 3= hitboxes; 4= model + hitboxes transparent) 4. start the recording. Drawing serverside hitboxes with an plugin is not that easy, because it causes traffic for each line drawn and also the only correct angle you can get is the one for the headhitbox (I didn\'t manage to get the correct other angles in the plugin (4 metamod) for CS). I guess VAVLE will first try to look into their code before they say anything. May be they don\'t answer right here, but a fix (steam update) would be also a good answer, wouldn\'t it?' WHERE post_id = 592271 AND is_historical = 1;
