UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I love Valve now! (In a Non-Sexual way [])\n\n__________________ /forums/showthread.php?s=&postid=575318#post575318 Golden Maven said: I love how some people complain because the weapons are more balanced now. The AWP is meant to be used for great distances, and Rebirth104, you shouldn\'t be able to eliminate 5 incoming enemies with a sniper, unless you are really, really far away from them. 1 man taking down 5 incoming enemies by himself with a sniper, now that\'s unbalanced. You do know what snipers are meant for, correct? Hint : It ain\'t assault. VALVe fixed a bug, plain and simple. Explain how you can rebolt the AWP while switching guns or holding a pistol in a fire-ready position? That\'s right, you can\'t, unless you have three arms. Use your heads people, the AWP was too powerful. You\'re just mad because you no longer have an advantage, and will have to play on the same grounds as everyone else. Too bad, let the fair(er) games begin. Cliffe said: Wow, Well Said.' WHERE post_id = 550632 AND is_historical = 1;
