UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'What are you talking about no one complained about it? I\'d say about 85-87% of all the CS have complained and [color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color]ed about the AWP. Now once they reform it, they complain and [color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color] about that. Just like everything they try to fix when people cry. Happens every time. Now spare us keep quiet.' WHERE post_id = 551165 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'uber...you don\'t even know what you are talking about... http://www.petitiononline.com/mod_p...ned.cgi?giveawp (http://www.petitiononline.com/mod_perl/signed.cgi?giveawp) please go there and sign the petition...I know petitions arne\'t much but they have to change this back...it\'s just horrible... Ok...first of all...What makes this game so good?...it\'s the game play...the element of gameplay...the idea...the engine of this game is what makes it good. Plus...THE main reason this is one of the #1 online games is because of these so called "glitches" that steam likes to call them. When we see someone not quick switching between the awp and deagle and not quick scopin too much what do we think?..this guy isn\'t too experienced. The fact that we could quick scope and quick switch made the experienced people feel good about them selves and the fact that they are better than others...I know that\'s not a good thing to say...But it\'s the truth..The fact that there are so many glitches in this game that people could take advantage of to have an advantage over others is what made this game so competitive...and now they are taking all those elements away. I\'ll bet anyone anything that 90% of cal I players will HATE this update. And have already been cursing it. And all you people that complain about the awp and are going to reply to this and state "STFU...you don\'t know what your talking about" you all gotta get over the fact that people can kill you with one shot...Stop whining that you get awped and hating the gun when you can use the awp yourself or learn how to avoid the shots/kill awpers. Now you will all probably be saying "listen to the one who\'s whining?...your the one whining..." I have a good reason too when it comes to this. I just hope this petition gets out....and that this gets resolved soon cause this is really going to kill the game and make many people quit....' WHERE post_id = 551279 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'thats nice, now "1337" players won\'t be able to "take advantage" over others, idiot. that\'s the whole point of it' WHERE post_id = 551373 AND is_historical = 1;
