UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'All I can say is...about bloody time. Re-learn the weapon kids. It\'s not that hard. The AWP was too easy with too many glitches. Sacrafices had to be made...you can thank all those that abused the glitches.' WHERE post_id = 551409 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = '"thats nice, now "1337" players won\'t be able to "take advantage" over others, idiot. that\'s the whole point of it" Are you on crack? Why don\'t you cry a little more just because someone\'s better than you. If you don\'t like it, get your own server or find one that\'s private enough that you don\'t have to worry about it. Valk, you\'re just as bad. AWP wasn\'t "too easy." You\'re just one of the whiney little idiots who couldn\'t take the time to learn it.' WHERE post_id = 551410 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I know what I\'m talking about. I\'ve been through almost every update in CS. People react the same way each time, which happens to be negative. Over time they get used to to it, and its fine and fun. Then there\'s anothe rupdate and the same thing happens--whatever the reason may be (such as your examples).' WHERE post_id = 551412 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I love the fact that this forum is filled with valve lovers...lol...And the fact that they listen to just people that complain about every damn thing in the game is just pathetic. I love the fact that valve ONLY fixed the awp glitch because so many inexperienced playesr complained about it. Especially that so many people complain about the ATI FPS Drops and the fact that they don\'t acknowledge the problem and they fix something like this. And it\'s not even a fix. Valve has to listen to the COMMUNITY and not just the threads they WANT to read on their forum community that doesn\'t know what they are talking about. I just hope the large ammount of cal I people that talk about this will make a change in this game. Cause this game is gonna lose a lot of players because of this. I bared with the autosniper fix and all the other fixes but this one is just way to over the top. also...jonnyboy....noticing that you complete OVERLOOKED the point of my post just makes me laugh "thats nice, now "1337" players won\'t be able to "take advantage" over others, idiot. that\'s the whole point of it"....They are not taking advantage over others..They are taking advantage of what STEAM CALLS "glitches"....Knowing how the game runs isn\'t glitching...it\'s being experienced and knowing how the game runs...that\'s experienced players...But bringing this game down to the fact that none of these little tricks will be in the system will just bring this games factor down to nothing...And all the experienced people will stop playing...and I aint just saying that..They are taking away what makes this game good...what seperates experienced people from inexperienced people... I just hope SOME people can understand what I\'m trying to get across...since most of this forum is valve lovers.... GG Valve!...you screwed up on the ati issue and haven\'t even acknowledged the problem and you did this drastic change to the awp?....Come on valve...Start listening to the COMMUNITY than overall just your forum which isn\'t that great either..' WHERE post_id = 551436 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'You have to look at the situation logically. If you have tens of thousands more people complaining about sometime over the people who don\'t complain, you\'ll obviously want to fix the complaints. You have to please the masses.' WHERE post_id = 551478 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I think it\'s funny how I\'ve seen someone who supports the update say "If you don\'t like the change, don\'t use it." Why is it funny? Cause I was actually thinking the same thing. If you didn\'t like how the game was, then don\'t play it. It\'s that simple. Then there wouldn\'t be these ridiculous changes.' WHERE post_id = 551502 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I understand the logical aspect. BUT..It\'s not logical at all for valve to only listen to the people complaining about the awp and just change it without advising the community...if they had atleast a poll or something that they could ADVISE the community about what they are going to do. That would be fine. Than the inexperienced and experienced players can both vote. You don\'t see the experienced people going to the forums and posting "LOVE THE AWP FOR QUICK SCOPING/SWITCHING!"...Cause it\'s part of the game. The only people that post are complainers and that adds up just because they get awped from people who are experienced and have played this game for years. I\'ve only been playing for 1.5....I hated getting awped but I adjusted to it and got use to it and started USING the awp. I just can\'t wait to see how the CPL/CAL Community and all the leagues react to this... A lot of people WILL be quitting because of bugs like this....Well....I just want to thank the people that give LOGICAL reasoning with this situation unlike the people "Stop [color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color]ing..it\'s been changed get used to it"....' WHERE post_id = 551543 AND is_historical = 1;
