UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Cryout to VALVe, please fix these ~50 bugs!!', post_text = 'projectile has posted a VERY interesting thread over at gotfrag. The thread gives us 50 rather important bugs that should be fixed in the game. (This is actually projectile writing with this account [] ) Anyways, VALVe, Please fix these things And for the players, give this thread some attention. http://www.gotfrag.com/cs/threads/82318/ (http://www.gotfrag.com/cs/threads/82318/) Also post ALL your views and other stuff in !THIS! Thread in the suggestion forum: /forums/...;threadid=82139 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=82139) Cut out of the thread(CLICK THE LINK TO SEE THE WHOLE LIST): ................................................ - Flying boxes. Comment: Why not fix both of the flying boxes instead of one? (de_nuke) - Forbidden areas. Comment: Forbidden areas such as the sky on de_dust should be removed beacause of the exploit in cups and so on. - Invisible walls. Comment: Invisible walls such as the one above the famous ledge in \'bombspot A\' on de_dust2 should be fixed. (If you are sitting on the ledge you can jump up and down and \'look over the wall\' and see opponents on the long yard or in the stairs.) - Boost thorugh ceilings/roofs. Comment: You can boost through thin ceilings and roofs if there is just enough space for two ducking players. Eg. the yellow house on de_nuke. The area over the catwalk ladder on de_nuke. - Weapons being seen through walls Comment: Sometimes if the wall is thin enough and your weapon is long enough the opponent on the other side can see your weapon through the door/wall. (This is if you are close enough to the door) - Models being seen through walls Comment: The same thing as with the weapons but with models instead of them. A well known example is the one where you are sitting down(ducking) in the yellow house with your [color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color] hanging out through the wall. (The yellow house in the main bombspot on de_nuke) //Misc - Cl_righthand gets the opposite value. Situation: When tabbing out to Windows and tabbing back again Comment: If you are using cl_righthand 0 it switches to cl_righthand 1 as you tab through windows. - Models being rendered the wrong way. Situation: Various, from time to time, when you are unlucky. (THIS IS THE MOST ANNOYING BUG IN THE WHOLE GAME, IT MESSES UP YOUR BRAIN AND HAUNTS YOU WHEN YOU SLEEP, DAMMIT FIX THIS ONE) Comment: The models are being rendered sideways or something. When you are watching the model (from another computer of course) it looks as if it is looking towards the side when it in fact is looking directly at you. This can be VERY devastating in a situation when you are sneaking up behind a lot of people. - Reload. Situation: Various Comment: The model sometimes acts as if it reloads, it doesn\'t really reload, it just looks as if it does. Very annoying, can be solved by either shooting or dropping and picking up the weapon or reloading it. - Glock. Situation: Various Comment: Sometimes the glock starts shaking as if it was having a seizure. Drop/pickup usually solves it. - Silentplant. Situation: When planting one half of the bomb inside a box and the other side outside the box. Comment: This bug has been around since the creation of de_ maps. ......................... Thanks. Navid "projectile" Christensen projectile #dot.spot @ se.quakenet.org projectile@tuol.org (mailto:projectile@tuol.org) Give this thread some attention, get the ball rolling. Links to sites that have highlighted this issue: SWE: http://www.fragbite.com/?newsID=5186 (http://www.fragbite.com/?newsID=5186) SWE: http://cs.nordicgamers.se/?news=0&a...f23593de128d5ac (http://cs.nordicgamers.se/?news=0&action=more&id=7603&PHPSESSID=a120e831cf1dbe2d2f23593de128d5ac) Int: http://www.gamers.nu/?p=news&n=1382#comments (http://www.gamers.nu/?p=news&n=1382#comments) Int: http://www.sogamed.com/?s=community...amp;news_id=447 (http://www.sogamed.com/?s=communitynews&sub=viewnews&news_id=447) Int: http://www.schroet.com/scenenews.php?id=4227#353607 (http://www.schroet.com/scenenews.php?id=4227#353607) Int: http://forums.csbanana.com/showthread.php?t=26188 (http://forums.csbanana.com/showthread.php?t=26188)' WHERE post_id = 567504 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Nice work projectile!', post_text = 'The 3 MOST irritaing bugs are... 1 The most irritating bug is the model bug for sure. The models seems too look sideways when he is aiming right at you... This bug came somwhere late in cs1.6 and I cant remember it from 1.5 2 The same for the switching weapon exploit, you can hear an emtpy wav file beeing played (I think thats why you here a "-eeehfrss-" sound when switshing between HE/Flash/smoke and prim/sec weapon. Some teams use this exploit to the fullest throwing 5 HEs at the location when a switching sound is activated. 3 See enemies through walls when switching fast between teammates. This bug has been around for some time. Cant be THAT hard to force a mp_fadetoblack thing 10ms that it takes to switch between teammates.' WHERE post_id = 567623 AND is_historical = 1;
