UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Ouch, That bug, the one when you see someone shooting at you, but he\'s not even facing you... i hate that one... Silent plant is no big deal but yea. let\'s keep valve busy by making them fix bug, this way they won\'t change stuff on our beloved guns lol jk' WHERE post_id = 567795 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Re: yay', post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by ocxigen cmon vALVE fix these stuff and counter-strike will be LOADS more fun, and probably more people will start playing it, cause i got like 10 friends that think CS is a ****ing BUG game and if u fix it then u guys gonna get more publicity ! Yeah, and don\'t "fix" something that no person is disagree with it (like Crosshair, awp an headshot symbol)!!!!! Speak more with the community, find out, what is better for the players ... If you won\'t be without work, u should fix the Crosshair, awp and headshot symbol, many peoples are angry of u! In my class, they say: Valve suxx .... (sry 4 the word, but it is so ...). And don\'t change something at awp or another gun, because after an update, we have to learn the weapon to use, and that is very difficult, if an update is once in the week .... !!!! And I find 1.5 was good, because you have a game and no so money updates and so many changes ... My idea is, you change the Crosshair, AWP and headshot symbol an then nothing. You work on a update, which updatet all the bugs in one update... so, the gamer haven\'t to learn the "new" gun very often ..!!! But find out, if the update get new bugs, then fix it before Steam the update updatet! Please tell me, what is your oppenion/what you say abot my oppenion? Cu, your Dfler ^^' WHERE post_id = 567805 AND is_historical = 1;
