UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Valve, How can a message of over 20000 players be ignored?', post_text = 'Just look at this petition, and tell me that it can be completely ignored. Please, as a loyal customer and supporter of Valve and their products, I only want the best of Counter-strike and Steam, and this latest update does not fit what is anywhere near best. Click here (http://www.petitiononline.com/giveawp/petition.html) to view the petition of over 20000 people who are upset about this update. Whether or not their maturity is there or not, it CANNOT be ignored. For the sake of your own product please rollback the AWP update at least in Counter-strike for this can seriously damage your (Valve\'s) reputation!' WHERE post_id = 569436 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'online petitions mean nothing! sweet tapdancing moses when will you figure that out?!' WHERE post_id = 569454 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I was curious to know how valve felt about the reaction.. if they cared or not. Personally, I am enjoying it more so now. I am having to relearn the game, and frankly its more fun. Dont know if it was supposed to be like this or what. Why havent they said anything in their news? Anyway, keep up the hard work valve, remember, you cant satisfy everyone [].' WHERE post_id = 569463 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Personally i have a question. If we email Steam Support about these updates, would they pay attention to that more than us posting here on the forums?' WHERE post_id = 569485 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Wow its impossible to make everyone happy with this game, can\'t you see that? 20,000 people? steamids are in their millions arent they? technically thats only a fraction of users, and even a smaller fraction even care Petition huh... countless people have signed that petition for a chance to put their clan channel, website or their "important" name across a popular counterstrike petition, some idea of selfimportance and the chance to be seen by someone they know gets their signature but not for its true cause with that in mind, how many of those people that signed it actually care about the awp? or have not double voted? In my opinion the delay should be lowered very slightly but if it isnt, so be it, its not like everyone who signed the petition hit every quickscope and no scope or even tried doing it and now the update gave them a permanent scar in their gameplay, people say awp is more defensive and thats not a terrible thing for it to be.' WHERE post_id = 569492 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'does that petition site only allow people to sign once btw?' WHERE post_id = 569495 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I got an email confirmation for it so im assuming yes' WHERE post_id = 569765 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'i have 3 e-mails, not only do i doubt its accuracy but 20000 is not a very impressive number in the largest game community. not that valve care for rants either.' WHERE post_id = 569791 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I wonder how many people signed it several times using fake emails? Factor that in it\'s less than 20000. 1,000,000/20,000 = 2%....such a large percentage of peoples want their awp back. And don\'t forget that there is more than 1,000,000 people on steam and more than likely less than 20,000 DIFFERENT people on that petition.' WHERE post_id = 569796 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Praestantia I wonder how many people signed it several times using fake emails? Factor that in it\'s less than 20000. 1,000,000/20,000 = 2%....such a large percentage of peoples want their awp back. And don\'t forget that there is more than 1,000,000 people on steam and more than likely less than 20,000 DIFFERENT people on that petition. 1,000,000 ppl dont play cs. the 1,000,000 is for HL+CS+DOD+TFC ect. ect. ect.' WHERE post_id = 569808 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Well...I cannot speak for every CS player out there...but I can speak for myself...my clan...and everyone I have played with or against since the update. Everyone I asked, or everyone who has made a comment has made negative comments about it. Just because you only have 22,000 signatures does not mean that there are not 1,000,000 people who don\'t like it. I wouldn\'t have even known about these forums if one of my clan memebers didn\'t tell me about it...and I have been playing CS long before steam. Do some testing... Go to a random server and start asking people what they think about the changes to the awp/scout? I guarantee you that you will get an overwhelming response to change it back.' WHERE post_id = 569814 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by shr3k 1,000,000 ppl dont play cs. the 1,000,000 is for HL+CS+DOD+TFC ect. ect. ect. 1.3 million people play all the mods. Considering how CS has more than all the other mods put together i would assume that is pretty close.' WHERE post_id = 569824 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'i started an upside-down petition, for people who like the update, NO ONE signed it, compared to 20,000 people that signed that one, what does that mean? Please people, there\'s many many cs players that have NO IDEA that these forums exist, so you can\'t do the math if you\'re missing numbers, hence my upside-down petition. have a nice day GG STEAM!' WHERE post_id = 569879 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Praestantia I wonder how many people signed it several times using fake emails? Factor that in it\'s less than 20000. 1,000,000/20,000 = 2%....such a large percentage of peoples want their awp back. And don\'t forget that there is more than 1,000,000 people on steam and more than likely less than 20,000 DIFFERENT people on that petition. Where is everyone getting this number from? Is it related to steam ID\'s? If so, it\'s a totally useless number due to these little things called lan centres that have several thousand (atleast..) copies of HL, where people that more than likely already own it are playing it, hence doubles. Then, factor in the fact that there is no feasable way that every single playing person has seen it. I\'ve seen two people from notable clans say that they liked the update, and many, MANY more from notable clans say they hated it. The leagues are getting screwed over, you know the people that actually care about this game and spend hours playing it, for the Pub Stars that walk into a server and play an hour a week. How is that fair?' WHERE post_id = 569976 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by k.l0wr3z i started an upside-down petition, for people who like the update, NO ONE signed it, compared to 20,000 people that signed that one, what does that mean? Please people, there\'s many many cs players that have NO IDEA that these forums exist, so you can\'t do the math if you\'re missing numbers, hence my upside-down petition. have a nice day GG STEAM! unlike the anti-update petitions you posted it once on one forum and gave it a name which dosent mention anything to do with what its about in the topic, im on these forums and would be happy to sign one if it was posted clearly.' WHERE post_id = 569990 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Cryout to VALVe, please fix these ~50 bugs!!', post_text = 'Posted the same thing in another part of this forum: The other thread (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=81835) Hoping that CLIFFE or someone else involved with valve takes a look at it. (This is projectile typing). Here it Goes: projectile has posted a VERY interesting thread over at gotfrag. The thread gives us 50 rather important bugs that should be fixed in the game. (This is actually projectile writing with this account ) Anyways, VALVe, Please fix these things And for the players, give this thread some attention. http://www.gotfrag.com/cs/threads/82318/ (http://www.gotfrag.com/cs/threads/82318/) Cut out of the thread(CLICK THE LINK TO SEE THE WHOLE LIST): ................................................ - Flying boxes. Comment: Why not fix both of the flying boxes instead of one? (de_nuke) - Forbidden areas. Comment: Forbidden areas such as the sky on de_dust should be removed beacause of the exploit in cups and so on. - Invisible walls. Comment: Invisible walls such as the one above the famous ledge in \'bombspot A\' on de_dust2 should be fixed. (If you are sitting on the ledge you can jump up and down and \'look over the wall\' and see opponents on the long yard or in the stairs.) - Boost thorugh ceilings/roofs. Comment: You can boost through thin ceilings and roofs if there is just enough space for two ducking players. Eg. the yellow house on de_nuke. The area over the catwalk ladder on de_nuke. - Weapons being seen through walls Comment: Sometimes if the wall is thin enough and your weapon is long enough the opponent on the other side can see your weapon through the door/wall. (This is if you are close enough to the door) - Models being seen through walls Comment: The same thing as with the weapons but with models instead of them. A well known example is the one where you are sitting down(ducking) in the yellow house with your [color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color] hanging out through the wall. (The yellow house in the main bombspot on de_nuke) //Misc - Cl_righthand gets the opposite value. Situation: When tabbing out to Windows and tabbing back again Comment: If you are using cl_righthand 0 it switches to cl_righthand 1 as you tab through windows. - Models being rendered the wrong way. Situation: Various, from time to time, when you are unlucky. (THIS IS THE MOST ANNOYING BUG IN THE WHOLE GAME, IT MESSES UP YOUR BRAIN AND HAUNTS YOU WHEN YOU SLEEP, DAMMIT FIX THIS ONE) Comment: The models are being rendered sideways or something. When you are watching the model (from another computer of course) it looks as if it is looking towards the side when it in fact is looking directly at you. This can be VERY devastating in a situation when you are sneaking up behind a lot of people. - Reload. Situation: Various Comment: The model sometimes acts as if it reloads, it doesn\'t really reload, it just looks as if it does. Very annoying, can be solved by either shooting or dropping and picking up the weapon or reloading it. - Glock. Situation: Various Comment: Sometimes the glock starts shaking as if it was having a seizure. Drop/pickup usually solves it. - Silentplant. Situation: When planting one half of the bomb inside a box and the other side outside the box. Comment: This bug has been around since the creation of de_ maps. ......................... Thanks. Navid "projectile" Christensen projectile #dot.spot @ se.quakenet.org projectile@tuol.org (mailto:projectile@tuol.org) Give this thread some attention, get the ball rolling. Links to sites that have highlighted this issue: SWE: http://www.fragbite.com/?newsID=5186 (http://www.fragbite.com/?newsID=5186) SWE: http://cs.nordicgamers.se/?news=0&a...f23593de128d5ac (http://cs.nordicgamers.se/?news=0&a...f23593de128d5ac) Int: http://www.gamers.nu/?p=news&n=1382#comments (http://www.gamers.nu/?p=news&n=1382#comments) Int: http://www.sogamed.com/?s=community...amp;news_id=447 (http://www.sogamed.com/?s=community...amp;news_id=447) Int: http://www.schroet.com/scenenews.php?id=4227#353607 (http://www.schroet.com/scenenews.php?id=4227#353607) Int: http://forums.csbanana.com/showthread.php?t=26188 (http://forums.csbanana.com/showthread.php?t=26188)' WHERE post_id = 569819 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'My mail to cliffe: Hello Cliffe, I\'ve made up my mind about getting your minds set to fix these bugs instead of updating counter-strike with what you call \'various improvements\'. This list that I have created has been recevieved very well all over the world. It is time for you to start listening to the counter-strike community. Read the comments regarding the threads. You will understand for sure. Thanks a lot. Here is the root link: http://www.gotfrag.com/cs/threads/82318/ (http://www.gotfrag.com/cs/threads/82318/) This is the main steam link: /forums/...mp;pagenumber=1 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=81835&perpage=15&pagenumber=1) This is the second steam link: /forums/...;threadid=82139 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=82139) Other links from various large international community sites: http://forums.csbanana.com/showthread.php?t=26188 (http://forums.csbanana.com/showthread.php?t=26188) http://www.sogamed.com/?s=community...amp;news_id=447 (http://www.sogamed.com/?s=communitynews&sub=viewnews&news_id=447) http://www.gamers.nu/?p=news&n=1382#comments (http://www.gamers.nu/?p=news&n=1382#comments) http://www.schroet.com/scenenews.ph...27#353590353602 (http://www.schroet.com/scenenews.php?id=4227#353590353602) Please answer this mail. It is a very important issue that deserves attention from everyone at VALVe and STEAM. Navid "projectile" Christensen projectile@tuol.org (mailto:projectile@tuol.org) #dot.spot @ se.quakenet.org' WHERE post_id = 569948 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'The "silent plant" and jumping through ceilings are the things that make this game so cool. Taking that away just make\'s it another game. Bugs or not, these things have been part of CS for a long time and should not be changed. The first time you found out how to silent plant, didn\'t you feel like you immediately wanted to show off your new knowledge to your friends or (if you don\'t have any) other people on the server? I know I did when i found out i could silent plant, jump through celeings, and walk in the sky. Changing these things just makes the game worse and you and many others fail to realize that.' WHERE post_id = 570132 AND is_historical = 1;
