UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Re: Cryout to VALVe, please fix these ~50 bugs!!', post_text = 'quote:- Models being rendered the wrong way. Situation: Various, from time to time, when you are unlucky. (THIS IS THE MOST ANNOYING BUG IN THE WHOLE GAME, IT MESSES UP YOUR BRAIN AND HAUNTS YOU WHEN YOU SLEEP, DAMMIT FIX THIS ONE) Comment: The models are being rendered sideways or something. When you are watching the model (from another computer of course) it looks as if it is looking towards the side when it in fact is looking directly at you. This can be VERY devastating in a situation when you are sneaking up behind a lot of people. It\'s odd, I got this all the time in DoD, but I never ever get these nowadays whenever I play CS... admittedly not often, but it happened a LOT in DoD.' WHERE post_id = 575948 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'this is the hard part', post_text = 'when was the last time VALVe listened to the community no matter how many people agreed with a certain thing, never... so what makes you think this will be any different. VALVe doesnt give a **** what we think... If you ask me, ruining cs is just a marketing plan so everyone quits and BUYS condition zero because VALVe is losing money on CS. And honestly, what happened to the aim? I recently played cs 1.3, holy jeebus, it was like a whole new game, things were registering!!! Just today i aimed for the head and, you guessed it, got a headshot!!! Another thing that ticks me off, both players standing still, you aim, directly at the head, your crosshair is completely covering the head, then you shoot, nothing, shoot, shoot, shoot, its like your shooting blanks. And i COMPLETELY agree with the hitbox situation when shooting someone in the BACK, it is SO completely disfigured its insane. Shooting someone in the back of the head doesnt even count as a headshot, and i think you should also include shooting someone in the side of the body/head as well as the back, because thats pretty messed up also.' WHERE post_id = 576903 AND is_historical = 1;
