UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Scorched 1ce Hitler didn\'t change anything, he forced Jews at gunpoint you stupid *******. What the ****. Why you brought up Hilter is something else. Valve didn\'t change the AWP because people complained, they changed it because of the stupid exploit that people were using to gain an advantage. Go get a history lesson. Hitler became the almighty of Germany and changed the law to make almost everything Jews did illegal. I brought that up because it\'s the only thing I could think of as a comparison having just finished my history term. So what you\'re saying is VALVe just randomly decided to now change the awp? No. I\'m sure the idea has been edging over a cliff for a long time, but the recent 50 page post pushed it over the edge and forced VALVe to do it. Guess what, people complaing about the exploit got the awp changed. If you can\'t realize that then your just an idiot.' WHERE post_id = 570282 AND is_historical = 1;
