UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Hey badomen, you were adressing "us types of people". Notice that noone in the thread agreed with the poster. Did you even read the subsequent posts? You think the AWP is useless? It\'s still more powerful and easier to use than the weapons in the game, and is still just as useful when used as a sniper weapon. Also, who mentioned anything about nerfing the ak/colt? Also what makes you think that none of us who posted in this thread have "skill", and "aim"? Way to stereotype. Speaking of which, I\'ve already sterotyped you as the type of person that has driven me away from public CS. It\'s not the game I don\'t like, it\'s a significant part of the community. Well, at least you\'re modest and don\'t make assumptions. (also goes with the stereotype...)' WHERE post_id = 572975 AND is_historical = 1;
