UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'lol there is no point in changing anything to do with the headshot hitbox, because at the end of the day whatever change occurs there will be alot of people whining. what would be nice is, - fixing the bullet registry, quite often bullet reg = wank. (most of the time when people whine about reg is because they cant aim properly, however there are alot of cases where the bullets dont actually register!!) -fixing the hitboxes of the rest of the body. i dont know if u ever played on a server with stats, but when i shoot sum1, 60% of the bullets hit the persons left hand, it happens with all my cs friends too.' WHERE post_id = 576165 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'FYI: SK say no to latest crosshair changes', post_text = 'One or two of the players from the biggest, most successful and well known clan in the history of CS have talked about the new changes to the crosshairs in CS. As you will no doubt all be aware that 3 of SK\'s players all use 640x480 and have done for some time. The recent changes have meant that the crosshair now resembles this in 640x480, using the 1024x768 crosshair in all resolutions:- http://www.btinternet.com/~sarah.m.gibbs/xhair3.JPG (http://www.btinternet.com/~sarah.m.gibbs/xhair3.JPG) Surely the fact that arguably the best clan in the World have talked about how they don\'t agree with or like it means something to VALVe. Please, stop pushing these changes on us. We don\'t all want a small crosshair. If you\'re going to change the crosshairs at least give people the option of using a crosshair from any resolution in the resolution of their choice (i.e. using 640x480 crosshair in 800x600, 1024x768 crosshair in 640x480, 800x600 crosshair in 1152x864 etc) I\'ll leave you with this from Potti. More comments can be found on regular SK forums and the Insider forums. #39 By SK|Potti / 2004-05-04 13:20:32 what the f*ck are they crazy, not many ppl out there got top of the line computers that can handel 1024 in res, and no point in playing any other res if the crosshair is based on 1024' WHERE post_id = 579519 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Not all of us have top of the line computers that can run 1024*768? Well, I played cs for a good bit at that resolution on a k6-2 450/128mb/16mb TNT just fine until they decided to quadruple the min specs on halflife a couple of years ago. The game used to run awesome on a system like that at almost any res (within reason.)' WHERE post_id = 579526 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'It\'s not the way the game runs, it\'s the fact we don\'t want the changes to our resolution. All the people that kicked up a fuss about 1024 being changed didn\'t like it either. Just put the crosshairs back to resolution specific sizes, not one crosshair for all. We don\'t want it!' WHERE post_id = 579538 AND is_historical = 1;
