UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Don\'t fix what isn\'t broken. Crosshairs were fine, if you wanted to use 800*600 cross hair...you used that resolution...if they saw this as a "problem" maybe they could have added a crosshair menu so users can select the cross hairs they want regardless of resolution. Right now they are just changing things for the sake of changing things, and enough people made a stink about the large cross hair so they changed it back. Completely missing the point in the proccess.' WHERE post_id = 579576 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'They didn\'t even change it back, they adjusted it so all the people in 1024x768 didn\'t have a problem anymore! Thanks VALVe! Now you just have to cater for the people that liked the 800x600 crosshair, the 640x480 crosshair, the 1152x864 crosshair, the 1280x1024 crosshair etc etc etc. 1. Undo the changes 2. Implement a menu system that allows for users to select their prefered crosshair for their prefered resolution 3. Have happy end-users again It\'s quite simple guys.' WHERE post_id = 579586 AND is_historical = 1;
