UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Ratings for above Packs', post_text = '--- --- Edit - BigDaddyK\'s Ranking --- Here\'s what I think of the above Mission Packs, with a rating of 1 to 5. - My rating is based on playing the Easy Level and looking at the other 3 VDFs (scouring for typos, etc.). - The rev number of the release is the author\'s rev, or absent that, the latest file date. - Updated by BigDaddyK 05-20-2004 Havok\'s Terrorist Mission Pack, rev. 5/1/04 playable mirror of the TurtleRock campaign, but needs 2 things: - more T based objectives - uses default bot profile and names are not reversed, mainly creates weapons problems early. this is a 2, but a quick refresher mod can make it a 3 (cannot get a higher rating as a mirror).- The Terrorist Mission Pack, rev. 0.2, by Anders Konradsen - very bland name, I renamed folder to cz\\MP\\KonradsenTerrorist - same bot problem as havok\'s - PLUS \'stoprescue\' on 4th map seems unachievable (bug?) - until fixed, a 0. National Insecurity Mission Pack, rev. 5/5/04 - second rev. on this pack, mostly for naming rules after Cliffe put out the dox. - CT tasks are a little weak on defusal/prevent plant. - this mission is a rearrange of the 18 CZ maps to form a basic regional background story. Reasonable low-cal attempt to do so. - this is probably a 2.5 mission, if you play the Turtle Rocks Mission 4 times and then try this one you\'ll find it repetitive, 2.5. SJ\'s Original CS Mission Pack, v02 - Note the typo list on bottom half of page 3 of this thread, \'rescure\'. -This Mission Pack is chock full of tasks to challenge the player, many of them innovative or at least interesting (steal mac10 from a T and kill with it on 747), but some of them are too much. (kill 3 with knife on easy level, kill 7 on survivor BUT kill 8 with mp5 [what is that?]). - If you want tasks and challenges that take time to complete, this one is it. BUT you may find yourself setting it aside and playing other faster MPs. Keep this around to munch on now and then, but also for inspiration, a 3. - I did not complete the Easy level before writing this review, CZ crashing snafu and last 4 maps very annoying challenges. - The Balancing Guide for Terrorist Bots, rev. 1.1, by BigDaddyK I wrote this and it\'s not a mission pack, good start for my later packs, 0. (If you drop this into Havok\'s folder and put the DB file in czero, you will see how it changes the play) Worst Case Scenario, rev. 5/5/04 - T-side mission, each triplets has a different theme location. - new T bot teammates created for this MP. - 2 zip files to install. - Eddy ? a new typo. fix the eddie typo yourself and try it out, 3. The Shadow Ops Mission Pack,rev. 5/6/04 [?] Have not played this one. Kidd Egg\'s Mission Pack, rev. 5/8/04 [?] Have not played this one. - BlackSun T Mission Pack , rev. 1.3b Have not played this one.' WHERE post_id = 589858 AND is_historical = 1;
