UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'here guys let me handle this i know how to communicate with VALVe, I learned from the master. First off, this isn\'t an "I hate COLT/AK post." I really don\'t mind the COLT/AK as long as people can actually use it without some kind of scripting action along with it. I swear that anyone who is a big time COLT/AK fan uses a script (especially found in clans), then when questioned, laughs about using once. But it\'s obvious just watching them. And for those of you new to this script: It\'s the AK/COLT script that instantly pulls down on your weapons once a bullet is shot from the chamber. It\'ll either pull down directly to the bottom of the screen, to where the guy is then back to the top again, and one even looks like shooting straight with AK/COLT. You\'ll never see the bullets go up like the recoil should. Now, don\'t say it\'s not a script, it\'s the lookdown button cause that\'s not true. It happens after every single shot so it\'s scripted. And I swear I am starting to think there\'s something else in there cause you can watch in first-person, they\'ll miss by a couple feet and still get the kill. AK/COLTers are seriously getting massive kill:death ratios and it\'s got no skill. If they miss, they\'ll fire a couple rounds off with the same gun right after, then switch back to a no recoil and try again. Makes it almost impossible to hit them when they\'ve got no recoil and can jump around with a pistol in hand. The script allows them to shoot accurately by not having any recoil. And you ever wonder why everyone uses an COLT/AK? Well for one COLT/AK is stronger than all the otherguns. But two, with an AK/COLT in hand it\'s the strongest gun in the game. There\'s no recoil of the gun shooting in your hand, it instantly pulls down and is ready. My suggestions: 1) Make the scripting action available to everyone. As the ol\' saying goes "If you can\'t beat \'em, join \'em" or "If everyone else is doing it, why shouldn\'t I?" 2) Actually make the recoil of the chamber mandatory (ie. Not skippable) The scripting process skips the recoil, even if you do it manually. 3) If the person holds a AK/COLT, they move same recoil no matter what other button they press at the same time. 4) Make a AK/COLT animation like the other guns when the shot is made to that weapon. bibliography: /forums/...;threadid=51759 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=51759)' WHERE post_id = 593015 AND is_historical = 1;
