UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'DeathLord666: You will have to further your explanation if you want help, give error messages etc. m0r0n: Checking "interact with service" will do nothing as there is no UI built into the service. The service loader is just a bootstrapper for the hlds_proc engine thats just gets it running. You will need to use hlds_proc_con or hlds_proc_web to use it. A good idea is to use hlds_proc_run (the app mode) to set up your servers, then when you are happy with your config switch to using service mode. The console applet is getting a complete redesign for Beta4 which will also expand its functionality. The UI for the service mode is really the web extensions. There are no current plans for a UI to be built for the service mode that uses Windows forms.' WHERE post_id = 618152 AND is_historical = 1;
