UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by ching0 i installed the blacksun 1.0 pack, and it works fine. i played for about 20-40 minutes and i\'m halfway through the normal. one thing i liked is "try to injure an enemy with..." whatever. i laughed. Yeah, that one is for glock only! On expert mode (and I think hard also) you actually have to *kill* people with the glock, but I thought it might be too much of a challenge on easy/normal modes. To people who reported errors with the as_oilrig preview images: Please try installing version 1.1 and tell me if the problem still persists. Regarding the inclusion of as_oilrig.bsp and .nav: Can someone please tell me for certain that as_oilrig is included in CZ so I can stop including it in this pack? I thought that only the _cz maps were included, but maybe I was wrong. Regarding bot names being mixed up: What exactly is the problem here, I wasn\'t sure what you meant. New version coming soon: The next version will fix any bugs mentioned above, as well as add custom bot names (i.e. terrorist names for the terrorists, names like Cpt. Scott, etc., for the counter terrorists , based on their skins).' WHERE post_id = 613881 AND is_historical = 1;
