UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Big question: will this be the final HL1 engine update to DoD? While it\'s great that the team is still working hard on DoD for HL, I have to admit that the possibility of seeing the DoD team continue its development by using Source excites me even more to no end.' WHERE post_id = 618170 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Apos Big question: will this be the final HL1 engine update to DoD? While it\'s great that the team is still working hard on DoD for HL, I have to admit that the possibility of seeing the DoD team continue its development by using Source excites me even more to no end. That is a hard question to answer. obviously we\'ll be moving on to "better stuff" (or shall I say "better sources" :^). Updates to 1.x stuff is going to be pretty sparse I imagine. That said, we have a nice collection of maps we will probably be trickling out over time to keep things interesting. But new core game features? Probably not. Bad bug fixes? Yes. Little bug fixes? Probably not. But one thing about this release. We tested it with a secret public test server and about 60 people from our gaming community. Long time players, mappers, friends of the pub and CAL types too. We think this is a very solid release.' WHERE post_id = 618187 AND is_historical = 1;
