UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'ATI & Half Life Deal', post_text = 'I was wondering which version of half life 2 do you get with the ati deal ? If we end up getting the singleplayer only, i\'m going to be mighty pissed off...' WHERE post_id = 625097 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'You know I was thinking about that the other day. I had gotten my radeon 9600xt months ago with the voucher, but untill just the other day I wonderd "Will I get some cheap ass single player only?" I sure hope I get single play + multiplay, I\'d hate to have to go and buy half life 2 again. Why can\'t they just make it all one version. 50 bucks. Full game. Everything included. Don\'t have internet? Too bad, burn in hell, you would only save 20 bucks anyway. I feel better [] I was also thinking about it this way: The voucher has a key to enter into steam to download via steam. Maybe valve realized that people that used the key via steam have internet, therefore they must want multiplay included. I pray the downloadable version via steam has multiplayer included. I also thought about it this way: People that buy it via steam(the ones without a voucher), may not have the option to get the single player only or single player plus multi(it may include both). Would vavle want two versions to have to send through steam? Maybe the voucher key, when entered, and half life 2 released, will give the option to download single player only or both inlcluded? Ahh too much input. Brain overload. Some of my questions may be answerd by some of you since I don\'t know the whole deal. All I can say is mine better include multiplayer []' WHERE post_id = 625394 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'It says \'Full Version.\' I\'m pretty sure you\'ll get the multiplayer aspect of the game, too.' WHERE post_id = 625396 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Hmmm, this could be a twisting of words which marketers just love to do. It might mean that you get the full version of the Single player game. But I could be wrong. I didn\'t mean to scare you.' WHERE post_id = 625619 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'lol, I know some people who who send some naster letters to ATI if they did that... But, hey, at least it\'s free. Honestly, i looked at that deal on the ATI boxes, it does say full version so I think you\'re ok, lol.' WHERE post_id = 625749 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'ATI', post_text = 'I was wondering this also yesterday, so I went to the ATI website to check it out and I think that on the different series graphics cards (9600, 9800) they have pictures of G-Man, Alex, and Gordon Face. On some website it showed that G-Man is single player, Alex is sp + mp, and Gordon was the Special Edition. On the 9600SE G-Man is on the box which is single player only. All the 9600 series have Alex on them which is sp+mp, and 9800 has Gordon, which means Special Edition. Not sure whats in Special Edition but there you have it. Atleast I think thats what all this picture mess is. And while we are on this topic, don\'t all you people that bought a brand spankin\' new graphics card back when HL2 was coming out the 1st time feel really bad? As much as computer technology is advancing, the 9800 Pro, which was $400 back when it was coming out, and now its only $230!!! Oh the beauty of patience! Now I only hope that the 9800XT goes down by the time this beast of a game finally comes out. Thanks for taking the time to read this.' WHERE post_id = 626488 AND is_historical = 1;
