UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Give shield a lifespan and improve animations...', post_text = 'Here a novel idea that might please quite a lot of people... Give the shield a life span of 250 armour points and improve the animations, so: 1. The shield can sustain damage and eventually become useless, much like regular armour. At the moment the shield is the only inprenitrible object in the game. We can shoot through almost any map wall (wood, brick, concrete and even steel), boxes of all types and sizes. But, we can\'t shoot through a shield?!? It\'s also the only piece of equipment in the whole game with infinite durability under fire, even after several nades had been thrown at the previous barer or it being hit with fire from 5 AWM\'s (by far the most powerful gun in the game). 2. We can properly tell, without a doubt, when the shielder is covered or uncovered. At the moment, nobody can trust the animations. For example (based on what I have witnessed): You shoot at a shielder that appears uncovered and hit nothing but shield, and later you shoot a shielder that appears covered and get a headshot.' WHERE post_id = 636054 AND is_historical = 1;
