UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'VALVe, HL2 and CS source comp specification?', post_text = 'I was wondering if AMD 64 bit 3200 with 512 mb ram, ATI 9800 XT 256 mb be good enough for HL2 at a consistent 100 fps? I\'ve had people showing me screenshot on IRC of their FPS in Hl2, somehow they got the leaked version and test it. The comp for that was something like ATI 9800 XT 256 MB, 3.2 ghz intel ht 1 gb ram, RAID hd, etc... and it would drop to 30 fps in open areas. I\'m hoping thats only due to the non retail version they got and hoping the retail version will be optimized. I mean 9800 XT 256 mb intel 3.2 ghz is pretty much top of the line, and if it won\'t run the game smoothly at a consistent rate, then how will people move onto that game for competition in leagues and tournaments? Perhaps you guys can fill us in on the specification required to run HL2 and cs source smoothly at a consistent 100 fps rate in all areas? Some information would be kindly appreciated. Thank you.' WHERE post_id = 641872 AND is_historical = 1;
