UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Temporary Fix To "ERROR! Server Verification Failed"', post_text = 'For those of you getting the "Error! Server Verification Failed..." Error, here should be a temporary fix for you until VALVE comes out with a permanent one... <>[] CZ Users []<> 1. Go into the game you want to play... 2. Click on New Multiplayer Game ( This is only in CZ i beleive.. ) 3. play atleast one round of a game with bots there... 4. and that should fix the problem <>[] CS Users []<> 1. Go into the game you want to play... 2. Click on New Game 3. play atleast one round of your custom game there as terrist and bomb a place or do whatever.. 4. and that should fix the problem -------------------------------------------- This will only work till you restart STEAM again, once you do that you have to do this all over again... I have only tried this with CZ ( Condition Zero )... If it works with other GAMES\\MODS, post here so people will know [].... -------------------------------------------- A SOLUTION BY: jas Make sure steam is shutdown then delete this file C:\\Program Files\\Steam\\ClientRegistry.blob Open steam and it will do another update which replaces the .blob file. After this all has benn working well again. I only play CS and CS WC3mod, so not sure about other games. Hope it works you you. Jas ------------------------------------------- I hope this fixes your problems. Please post back here if this works for please...' WHERE post_id = 650538 AND is_historical = 1;
