UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:12 - Weapons being seen through walls Comment: Sometimes if the wall is thin enough and your weapon is long enough the opponent on the other side can see your weapon through the door/wall. (This is if you are close enough to the door) 13 - Models being seen through walls Comment: The same thing as with the weapons but with models instead of them. A well known example is the one where you are sitting down(ducking) in the yellow house with your [color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color] hanging out through the wall. (The yellow house in the main bombspot on de_nuke) These are basically unfixable right now. They occur because models are clipping through the walls because collusion hulls don\'t actually cover the entire model + gun. And if they did, it would make movement very awkward and difficult because you\'d get caught on everything, not be able to get very close to walls, etc.' WHERE post_id = 673495 AND is_historical = 1;
