t " are not members of the Steam Staff. So we don\'t care about it. Try to read one more times this post. And think about them. Best Regards. JuhWork.\n\n__________________ Stones From my Ennemies, Roses From my Friends.' WHERE post_id = 692296 AND is_historical = 1;
