st cried reading that, its so fuc,king true *takes hat off to Juhwork* also the thing about us not asking for steam is so true, we didnt ask for this cr.ap they made us d-load it along with 1.6, from there on we\'ve had nothing but troubles, maybe if they\'d stop constantly updating the bloody thing we wouldnt complain, but the fact that they keep doing this all the time almost every fuc.king month just brings about the same amount of problems. Why cant steam just update once the program is completely as they want it to be with every single thing they want in it, and then and only then release an update not every fuc.king month!!! God, i wish all of us lot could play the "steam team" on CS, and just fu.ck them up and embarass them, they\'re prolly a bunch of n00bs.\n\n__________________ THERES THIS COUNTER STRIKE AND HALF LIFE SERVER APPLICATION THINGY THAT SUCKS - WONDER WHAT IT IS?!!....' WHERE post_id = 692368 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'your mum is a noob agt CS, but i bet she still kicks your ass in real life. another day in the life of a 12 year old steampowered.com forum member...\n\n__________________ There is NO such thing as a Keygen which creates valid online keys for use with Steam. You can get so-called \'Keygens\' which simply contain a list of PREVIOUSLY stolen keys, but these are likely to have been banned already since so many people have access to them. The mathematical probability of guessing a working, valid key of the form XXXX-XXXXX-XXXX is infintesimally small. KEYGENS FOR ONLINE CD-KEYS ARE A MYTH!' WHERE post_id = 692406 AND is_historical = 1;
