UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I\'m going to put down a lot of the arguments right here... You can still play your game without steam... You can install Half-Life out of the box and play single-player and LAN games all you want... You don\'t have to install the upgrades and you don\'t have to run Steam. You paid for HL, and you can play HL And for all the people who are saying "I want to take a mallet and bash the Steam servers," Steam isn\'t centralized at Valve HQ... And to the people who said "I want to pour hot water on the Steam developers," I suppose you are going to come to my house and beat me up for writing this post as well... And to both, I hope you can hang on to that soap in jail, because Big Bubba is watching Someone said to use a win32 interface... Steam is "The Players never asked to change" - The players never asked Valve to make the best FPS game to date, but look where we ended up... If Valve waits for the players to decide everything that should happen then nothing will get done. And Valve is doing a pretty good job of handling all of those games And someone talked about making you download 1.6... Again, you don\'t have to download it... Go look up an old beta installer and play LAN games... Nobody forced you to use it' WHERE post_id = 692458 AND is_historical = 1;
