UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Many and I mean many of the Steam problems are with the user and not Steam itself. Ive seen probably thousands of cases solved by Quicksilver because the person didnt have thier computer configured right. Remember Steam is still in beta. WON is final. It is more stable. If you dont like how steam is working for its not like its the only option. The people that get me are the ones that have one small problem think that Steam blows and they unistall and install to fix it. The ever looping update is the first time Ive ever had a really serious problem with Steam. Many people just give up and dont try anything. Its sad but I dont care for people who do that.\n\n__________________ To all the people that are saying why wont VALVe work on this or that, they have only 60 people in their company. Cliffe told me so it must be true. Plus they are working on all this: CS, CS:CZ, DoD, Source (the engine itself), CS:S (and other Source ports?), HL2, CS2, TFC2 and DoD2 (?)!!!! {-DB-} Custom Maps Server: 69.93.116.250:27015 Great pings even for the Euro guys, 30 person and most of the time admins are present. Drop on in for a great time. Posted by Silicon Vampire: All the pointless arguements trying to justify cheating are rendered moot for one simple reason. As soon as a cheat is written/run with the intention of avoiding anti-cheat measures and gaining an unfair advantage against other players, there is no justification possible. It is what defines a cheat and it is wrong.' WHERE post_id = 692781 AND is_historical = 1;
