UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Shield glitch is getting out of hand', post_text = 'At this point, I think it is safe to assume that Valve is actively ignoring the two latest glitches. Before the last 2 updates, I assumed that they were working on them, but it was just taking a lot of time. However, there have been 2 updates recently, and niether of them included a fix for the 2 shield glitches. The latest glitch is especially bad, because it allows the player to use a rifle, and be covered by an invisible shield. At the very least, Valve could tell us that they are being worked on, but to this point, they have been ignored altogether. I can\'t speak for everybody, but I think fixing these horrible glitches is more important than added CZ models. So what is the story Cliffe?' WHERE post_id = 690183 AND is_historical = 1;
