UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by sonson post the e-mail, how hard is that? just posting words on the screen is not proof, and any way in gabes usual style i got a 4 word reply when asked if CZ will also port to source Quote Gabe Newell "CZ will as well" -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- From: arron cohen [mailto:MY EMAIL GOES ERE] Sent: Thursday, May 27, 2004 5:50 PM To: Gabe Newell Subject: Condition Zero Steam Dear Gabe , I understand you must be a very busy man, With hl2 CS-source Etc Etc 1st off I\'d like to thank you and your team for all the hard work you have put into your company and your games over the last few years. It has been a true excitement for me to see one of my favorite games evolve over time and as a player to be able to actively see the evolution of Hl/CS.Steam Beta and Then into the full 1.6 was a great. Ok well i do have 1 burning question i\'d love to have answered if at all possible.With all the talk now on half life 2 and it\'s multiplayer counterpart CSS,What will condition zeros\'s future hold.I absolutely adore CZ over 1.6 for many many reasons,but if CSS comes out and CZ gets no port i don\'t see i\'ll be playing CZ if CSS is out.. Any clues you maybe able to give or even a tiny bit or reinsurance for the 180,000+ cz owners would be great. Many thanks Yours Arron Cohen ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Gabe Newell <GABES EMAIL GOES ERE @valvesoftware.com> Sent : 28 May 2004 21:47:33 To : "arron cohen" <MY EMAIL GOES ERE> Subject : RE: Condition Zero Steam "CZ will as well." --------------------------------------------------------------------------------' WHERE post_id = 707044 AND is_historical = 1;
