in walked Gabe in a pimp outfit (from pimphats.com). He took took one look at them and said omfg i pwn joo, joo h4lf l1f3 nubcake h4xors. With that, he walked out and the MIBS bag and tagged them and took them back to Valve HQ. -phr0z3n' WHERE post_id = 715997 AND is_historical = 1;
