UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'To the Mighty Cliffe', post_text = 'I used to have some respect for you, for developing a big community and game out of no where. You are the reason why CS is so big today. Now I\'m sorry to say, my respect to you is gone. You washed away my respect to you times after times. Don\'t you realize that these unecessary changes are making loads of frustration for people? First you forced people, especially competitive players to use a buggy application called Steam, then steam drains our computer performance, which affect our game play greatly. Which is all fine, we could deal with that. Then you took huge changes to our beloved game. Whats the point? Honestly and I think a lot of people would agree, including the pubbers, people who dont check this forum. The BEST solution is to keep the game exactly the same as HL CS 1.5, except with VAC, the new money system, the timer, and the two weapon, gali + famas. Thats it. Don\'t mess with it anymore. These new changes are just ridiculous. I don\'t spend hours working on a game just to be screw over by you. It\'s darn right disrespectful to us. Restore the hitboxes, etc into the CS 1.5 state. Seriously 1.5 was more of a consistent environment and in order for players to improve and to get anywhere in the game, they need consistent environment to work on. If pubbers don\'t like 1.5, why do you think they still play 1.5? They know about steam, they just choose not to use it. They are pubbers, not clan players, not in any leagues so they aren\'t required to switch. But for clan players, you are really messing us up. Do us all a favor, conduct a poll and do a research , do the poll on steam whenever a user connect, and let them decide if they want this CURRENT 1.6 stuff or 1.5 on steam plus VAC plus money system plus round timer and 2 additional weapon. Dont mess with anything else. I know you probably don\'t care, but if you ever play the game as much as we do, you will see my point. Please do your supporter a favor and just conduct that research and see what people truly want. Forcing your customer to obey a product that they don\'t really like is no different than punking them. Please be a good company and show us that we can trust you guys for dedicating our time onto this game. The awp being taken out without a word, the new hitboxes, the new recoil, etc. These "small changes" to you are big changes to players who spent numerous hours to get these things natural state. I hope you read this and only you. Disregard the people who reply to this thread, because thats only one portion of the opinion, to effectively determine what your customer wants, conduct a poll on Steam whenever they connect on-line, just like how you guys did for the HL2 survey. I hope you will restore my respect for you, otherwise you will see lots of people like me. Please do us all a favor. Thank you.' WHERE post_id = 765584 AND is_historical = 1;
