UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'CS not included with HL!', post_text = 'Read the latest news at CSnation.net "Counter-Strike has been removed from Steam\'s purchasable Half-Life. Up until recently, customers who bought Half-Life via Steam automatically received Counter-Strike and other Valve-supported mods for free (see image, note that CS is gone). If a new customer wants to play CS they will need to purchase Counter-Strike: Condition Zero via Steam or possibly buy one of the Half-Life family games (including CZ) in stores. Current Half-Life, Counter-Strike, and Condition Zero players are not affected by this change. Counter-Strike has always been free for Half-Life customers, so hopefully this was an oversight on Valve\'s part that will be fixed soon. If this was intentional, it\'s not likely to earn Valve any positive press." This is really good, Valve. /sarcasm As if taking WON down wasnt enough, now us WON users without Steam accounts have to buy Condition Zero for 40 dollars if we want to ever play CS again. It wont work because a lot of us WON players werent going to "upgrade" to Steam anyway, and if they also plan on charging us even if we own a HL cdkey and CS... Well, you get my point. I hope the forums and the mods are braced for an onslaught of hate posts.' WHERE post_id = 772697 AND is_historical = 1;
