UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I\'m 28 I think the average age depends on the country you are from. In countries where Internet access, especially broadband is very expensive, players tend to be at least in their twenties because they have jobs and can pay for access that kids cannot extort from their parents. In countries where Internet access is cheap and most households have broadband the average age drops because kids have more time on their hands. The real question though, should be, what is the average age of users on this forum because almost every thread turns into a juvenile flame war.' WHERE post_id = 790513 AND is_historical = 1;
