UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Druidwitch Well, I am 26 and have been playing for about 3 weeks lol - so I guess since 1.6. You never know one day I might be able to say that and sound good! I have to admit though I have found the CS hype a little over rated (braces for a flaming). After hearing about it time after time after time I purchased Half Life and downloaded all the juicy Steam extras. After playing CS for a few weeks I just dont think it is up to its own reputation, well not any more anyhow. I think Counter Strike : Source is desperatly needed - for me anyhow - for the game to be worth taking time out from other games to play. Daniel 1.5 was better...' WHERE post_id = 790555 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Druidwitch I have to admit though I have found the CS hype a little over rated (braces for a flaming). After hearing about it time after time after time I purchased Half Life and downloaded all the juicy Steam extras. After playing CS for a few weeks I just dont think it is up to its own reputation, well not any more anyhow. I think you have started playing at the wrong time. CS has been in a kind of transition phase for a year or more now. Before 1.4 it was a spectacular game with a brilliant community but recently has been plagued by cheats and horrible mods. The basic premise of the game though is timeless and I think CS:S will for a time return the CS community to the good old days. Stick with it, CS is a keeper, I look forward to hearing my kids whinge that CS4 is no where near as good as CS3.8 was.' WHERE post_id = 790577 AND is_historical = 1;
