UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by zerostone I heard hl guard monitors headshots and that many so qiuck might have triggered it to think aimbot and it ban cause of that. If there\'s any truth to this statement (which I doubt) then that\'s the lamest detection method ever!' WHERE post_id = 798761 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by interspaced I thought CD blocked the cheat i didn\'t know it has a bit of hl guard in it I believe you can set a threshold in CD for headshots and once reached it kicks/bans you based on what the admin has set to penalty to be.' WHERE post_id = 798804 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by psycho_thrasher If there\'s any truth to this statement (which I doubt) then that\'s the lamest detection method ever! Yup thats true. HLGuard detections blow. They are horrible. Ive been kicked from prolly 10 or so for an aimbot because I moved to the enemy too fast. Ummm no got a 14 sensitivity.' WHERE post_id = 798816 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'HLguard aimbot detection is awesome. We have tested it by downloading aimbots on non-vac servers and it did not take long for hlguard aimbot detection to catch us. We use hlguard on our servers, and obvious hackers got caught again and again. Hlguard not only catches aimbots, it also catches cheat scripts. GO HLGUARD........ Hlguard gave LIFE to Half-life Mods and CS.' WHERE post_id = 799060 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Cheat scripts is a myth. HLGuard is horrible. Not only is the aimbot detection horrible but if you switch to your pistol too much itll detect that as a fast switch script. It also zaps power from the server and makes pings skyrocket. HLGuard is horrible. It detects me as having an aimbot and I suck.' WHERE post_id = 799067 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by bballr4567 Cheat scripts is a myth. HLGuard is horrible. Not only is the aimbot detection horrible but if you switch to your pistol too much itll detect that as a fast switch script. It also zaps power from the server and makes pings skyrocket. HLGuard is horrible. It detects me as having an aimbot and I suck. Hlguard is the BEST Aimbot detection tool out there. It is possible that n00b admins set it up poorly. But, with standard settings, Hlguard cannot go wrong (99% of the time). On our server, we do give 2nd chance to those who gets caught+banned by hlguard just to take care of the 1% posibility of a false ban.' WHERE post_id = 799113 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Uhm I didn\'t think HLGuard detected aimbot at all, what it does is measure reaction time / speed and accuracy of shots and when it deems a shot too accurate and the reaction time too fast it logs it on a text called "aimwarn", the server admin decides what the aimwarn is set to normally being around 5/30 (5 flags on the list in 30 mins) but often admin who don\'t understand that seeing isn\'t all and that some players use sound :/ drop this setting to 3/30 or less, making the likelyhood of an honest player being banned much more likely. Also whilst UA deny it, HLGuard does make mistakes with aimwarn, use it on a laggy under resourced server (and we all know how common they are) and you\'ll find it flags just about everyone as an aimbotter.' WHERE post_id = 799283 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'That has got to be the worst way of detecting cheats I have ever heard. I always thought they had some sophisticated system to check the running processes and see if they were cheats, but now I am told it just checks if you are, in it\'s opinion, too good to be playing fairly.. I pity the people who are so good at cs they get banned everywhere they go..' WHERE post_id = 799302 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'HLGUARD aimbot detection is pretty good, since we have tested it ourselves and have been using on all our servers for over 1 year now: From United Admins, how hlguard works: quote: HLGuard\'s aimwarn works kind of like: Each frame (some frames skipped to reduce cpu usage) HLG draws a line from each player to each other (enemy) player. If there is a wall between then nothing is done except noting down the "time". As soon as 2 players can see eachother (enemies to eachother) HLGuard records time untill damage/kill, angle of crosshair movement, speed of crosshair movement and such things. Combined players will get aimwarns according to hlg_aimbotlevel.' WHERE post_id = 800772 AND is_historical = 1;
