UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'TFC keeps crashing - even after a format!', post_text = 'Ok, for a few days now Team Fortress Classic has been making my PC crash. What happens: _______________________________ Fine for a minite or two.. Oh-er a bit of lag, maybe my brother is downloading? But he\'s sleeping! WTF... It\'s lagging again, oh, this is local lag, not connection lag. Ahhh this is annoying, oh it\'s moving again. FS it\'s stopped again........still not doing anything..........hello??..............bah PC Crashed totally! CRTL + ALT + DEL!!!!! Bahh who stole task manager?? PC Froze, pressing reset - again. Lost all IRC and MSN connections, etc, all messages awaiting gone but oh well. And hey, lets not save any changed Windows settings either. _______________________________ And before you ask, these are NOT the problem: > The server I\'m on, I\'ve tried many, and I get a ping of 20ms to them too! > My TFC Files, I formatted my hard disk and this STILL happens. Also, the team fortress classic.gcf file was not backed up so that is totally fresh. _______________________________ What\'s up Steam? Fix this please, TFC happens to be my favourite all-time game and I\'d happily buy Team Fortress 2 (when it finally comes out), but not with this problem. It\'s putting me off the whole game. Thanks in advance for supporting, Adam.' WHERE post_id = 799816 AND is_historical = 1;
