UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Doubt its steam. Is your connection active when your PC is idle? I took my PC out of my firewall and stuck it in a DMZ to download some stuff over bittorrent. After sticking it back in my connection was always active. Looking around I had files I never heard of in task manager. Closing them and deleting stopped the problem and didnt cause any nasty system crashes looking for files that were deleted. http://www.thebanlist.com/forums/sh...highlight=files (http://www.thebanlist.com/forums/showthread.php?t=512&highlight=files) Ive also had another one on someone elses PC not too long ago that I had to fix http://forums.freddyshouse.com/showthread.php?t=22357 (http://forums.freddyshouse.com/showthread.php?t=22357) At the time google didnt show up anything for netclna.exe. Now however it brings up spyware and trojan websites.' WHERE post_id = 800928 AND is_historical = 1;
