UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Well, when they take something that\'s working fine and consistantly break it people get upset. When they try to fix things no one cares about while ignoring serious bugs and issues that have been brought up to them repeatedly people get upset. When the game no longer works because of an update no one wants anyway people get upset. When pretty much the entire community goes from stable cs to crashing cs and are told to check their OS people get upset. I\'m just a sarcastic person, I\'m not going to create a real thread to explain the existing problems because they\'ve all been brought up before and if there\'s one thing I know it\'s the developers just don\'t care. They couldn\'t have tested this patch before they released it to steam users. Why do I say this? Because it crashes cs all over the place, how do you not notice this?' WHERE post_id = 811964 AND is_historical = 1;
