UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Another Bug', post_text = 'lolol. not sure if this one has been around alot or not. but, yesterday I was chillin with a clanmat in assault using pumps only, and he was comng in the back door, and he threw a smoke grenade at the door, so the door opened, he ran in, let it close then ran out. (not sure why). He then, put his character against the door. THe part that would touch the Door FRAME when it closes, not like the body of it, but the end, He then became ATTACHED to the door and his character would follow the path of that door. I went and I saw it, so I wa slike, ok let me try it. So Ir estarted round and went back, smoked the door and same thing happened, execpt I was land sharking, and then he jumped on my head and we were swinging with the door together. I have that on Demo too. lol It was pretty funny. But I also think its the same thing that gets me killed with doors, where the door closes and yoiur dragged in with it.' WHERE post_id = 1050214 AND is_historical = 1;
