UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Re: Recoil - Will post till fixed', post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Bam0r ...same problem for me. Noticed it about 3 weeks ago?.....something like that. Recoil is a BITCH and you either resort to camping in dark corners because you just cant take people on or trying one-tap shots, which means you just get wasted by a sprayer who doesn\'t have the recoil problem. I have tried different gfx drivers - now on Omega\'s whereas before was on CATS 4.2 or 3.7. None of the drivers has helped. It is NOT ram imo. I have 512 of OCZ PC4000 DDR. High quality ram. I watched a clan mate the other day and noticed his recoil was same as it used to be. TBH I\'m sick to death of posting in STEAM forums asking for a fix. My game should be the same as anybody elses, only difference should be hardware or skill, not buggered development. I\'m 37, and I guess in the last few years of online gaming days, well ones that require fast reactions, and it\'s real nice to kow that I\'m being n00bed by players because they don\'t have a lag/recoil problem and I/we do. Valve, please sort this problem. Bam man ur sound like a 12 year old ... or ur just a 37 year old with no life..' WHERE post_id = 818149 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Energie, screw off, There is no reason to insult people.' WHERE post_id = 818156 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Re: Re: Recoil - Will post till fixed', post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Energie man ur sound like a 12 year old ... or ur just a 37 year old with no life.. And you type like a 12 year old. On topic, I agree. Somedays my recoil is great, can spray and pray and still hit if need be. Other times with an AK, one bullet is accurate, and any more are way off. Not just spray, 3 bullet bursts rarely hit the target.' WHERE post_id = 818165 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Mess with your rates and check your recoil, It actually changes the spray patterns. They really need to fix the spread, no gun and I MEAN NO GUN in real life will hit the wall or ceiling when you shoot it. I don\'t care if you are doing jumping jacks.' WHERE post_id = 818241 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Then again, no real person uses crosshairs and fires from their hip when firing in real life. The crosshairs just merely represent you aiming through the ironsights of the gun. The recoil and spread simulate the gun when it\'s fired (shakes around, pulls back, etc etc). It\'s not realistic at all in CS...don\'t treat it as it should be.' WHERE post_id = 818258 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'And in real life a person wouldnt be able to shoot you from, down a ramp for example with only the top of their head showing.' WHERE post_id = 818273 AND is_historical = 1;
