UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'My 10 cents. Graphics problem. No idea what exactly, but it\'s not a rates issue, fact. I have been using the same rates for ages and have only noticed this problem recently, as I said about 3 weeks ago. After you fire either a colt or AK, where as ost peoples xhiar shrinks back down to normal size rapidly, mine just shrinks back down in stages, taking (random guess) about a second longer than most. I guess it\'s not OS (XP) or drivers - I have done nothing major to my system in that time, I also have a ghost image of my pc when CS was working perfectly, and restored that, still the same problem. I give up because I know this wont be fixed. New game maybe. All gets a bit to much when all you want to do is play the same as others. (violin) Bam []' WHERE post_id = 818303 AND is_historical = 1;
