UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'The Official Hackers In CZ', post_text = 'Some people don\'t think there are hacks for Counter-Strike Condition Zero. But they are wrong. Tonight I have witnessed someone hack and admit it and even tell us where he got his hacks. His name is KyA | hyper-knuckles {Le@DE|2}, STEAM ID: STEAM_0:1:3288574 17 13:35 56 0 If you would kindly report him to steam and help me out and all the rest that were in the server it would be greatly appreciated. I know that may only be one of thousands that hack but at least it will help. This guy that was hacking said that he found his hacks on www.**********.com (http://www.**********.com) and he said that he is using a cd key that thousands of other people have got. It is a cd key that has been hacked by someone and now posted on a web site somewhere that anyone can use. He also said he got free games such as CS:CZ and Blue Shift from this site. Just by downloading him. I believe he did and whoever thinks that can not happen should back away from their computer now and never go on it again. Steams anti-cheating system(VAC) seems to not be working very well because there are still many hackers that haven\'t been caught and probably many that never will be caught. But I think steam should improve there anti cheat system. A good recomendation for servers to have is HL Guard. Also known as Half-Life guard. It is a very good anti-cheating software program that can catch hackers on your server and ban them and unlike cheating death the other person does not need to download it on there computer in order to play. I think all servers should have this because it is a great idea for a server. If any of you could report this hacker than maybe he will be gone. He plays on my favourite sevrer and always comes in hacking. When people hack it\'s just not fun to play Counter-Strike and many people are quitting Counter-Strike becasue of it. I believe that if steam came down harder on these hackers the game would be more enjoyable for you and everyone else and more people would play Counter-Strike. Please reply and tell me what you think.' WHERE post_id = 847732 AND is_historical = 1;
