UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Due to the fact that demos/Steam ID\'s can be faked, please dont post on how to get a specific player banned because you have a demo of them cheating. VALVe uses VAC for its bans only. The recommendation is that you contact the server owner where you saw the possible cheater and discuss it with the admin. You can also contact www.thebanlist.com (http://www.thebanlist.com). they are a group, not afiliated with VALVe, that can ban across all Banlist enabled servers only, given enough proof. While we appreciate you wanting to rid the games of cheaters, VALVe lets VAC do its banning. However, if you know of a new cheat, especially private cheats (ones that arent on a public website), and can provide the links or the actual binaries, please PM a moderator and we\'ll pass it along to the VAC team. Thanks. Update: United Admins has teamed up with SteamBans.com in the latest release of HLGuard. Soon the ban lists will be combined and future bans will happen across both networks. BTW www.steambans.com (http://www.steambans.com) is a great place to send demos. quote:Please do NOT post Hacker SteamIDs in the forums. Valve / Steam / VAC does not Ban players by other players say-so especially since it can be used maliciously against innocent individuals. The issue here is not the SteamID itself which is basically public information. The issue is you, the player or server operator relaying information which cannot be verified and can easily be faked. I\'m not interested in seeing any discussion about this issue, just accept it as fact and move on. Any existing posts with IDs in them will just be ignored, I just don\'t want to see any new posts with SteamIDs in them.' WHERE post_id = 850319 AND is_historical = 1;
