UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = '... Mission Pack intention...', post_text = 'I ran into a problem with the third mission, namely the MAC-10 quota. I\'m not a gun expert, so I use the F1 key if the gun model doesn\'t register with me. That said as a CT I don\'t believe I have access to the MAC-10. I\'ve assumed the closest to that is the low-end submachine gun, but I thought the MAC-10 was a terrorist weapon. So I guess the question is, do I have to kill a terrorist and snag his weapon hoping it\'s a MAC-10 or should this weapon be available via the F1 key? I was just wondering.... that\'s all. I just haven\'t been lucky enough to kill a T carrying one.' WHERE post_id = 865509 AND is_historical = 1;
