UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = '.. ffs, steam is the worst piece of **** ever. What was wrong with WON?!? had it working okay after hours of f*cking about with it, downloaded the gcf files from bittorrent as the steam 512kb updater didn\'t work. Played 1.6 for a week which is really really bad, far too easy for 21-0 scores imo. It\'s been not working for a week, but is for other people?! Steam have somehow forgotten (or it seems they have) about my account as I was one of the 1st to register. So i uninstall it and re-try to update, and i cant. Why mass release something before it works?! /rant' WHERE post_id = 116902 AND is_historical = 1;
