UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Tab 1) Using scope weapons now have a zoomed in time? Like Call of Duty? 2)Did you or anyone use any of the less used weapons like the M-249 SAW or the Styer TMP? Have they been improved at all? 3)What didnt like you about the changes? 4)Did anyone play the game online with any other cyber cafe\'s? How was the lag? 5)Any weapon pricing change? 6)How many people where at the lan center? 7)Do flashbangs hurt? Did you go deaf from those? 8)Does the 3-Short burst from the Glock or Famas fell any different? 1. When you right click to zoom you see your screen go in. 2. One person killed me with a m-249 sounded crazy. Ill check on improvements next time i go. 3. I wasnt to happy about flashes flashing you even if they were behind you but i didnt mind that much. 4. no we all played lan 5. Nope not that i saw 6. it was 12 on 12 i believe 7. Flashbangs dont hurt and yes you do go deaf 8. The glock didnt feel different and i was 1st person watching a guy play with burst famus didnt look different' WHERE post_id = 916395 AND is_historical = 1;
