UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Calling all bug reporters!', post_text = 'ATTENTION ATTENTION ATTENTION With the current and upcoming stages of the CS:S beta, participants will be able to report bugs directly through Steam. But what about everyone else? And what about after the beta? And what about bug in the other games? Fear not! The answer is here. Project Boil (http://projectboil.pixel10.co.uk) is a community initiative to create a database of professional quality bug reports for Steam and its games. We currently sport a repository of over 60 bugs in Steam, CS and CZ and we are expanding it every day. But we need your help. The more community input we get, the stronger the project becomes. So if you�ve found a bug in Steam or one of its games, head over to Boil (http://projectboil.pixel10.co.uk) and submit it! [UPDATE] The site is down at the moment. Will notify when fixed.' WHERE post_id = 917466 AND is_historical = 1;
