UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Creating Buy Binds', post_text = 'Alright Here Is a guide to making buy command binds on CS:S Beta. It will Also show you the minor differences between 1.6 buy command binds and CS:S Beta buy command binds. First Here Is a link that gives a Basic explanation please read before continuing. http://www.csnation.net/articles.php/cssguide_200/ (http://www.csnation.net/articles.php/cssguide_200/) You Can open up the config.cfg files with mircrosoft notepad. After you have read that you should have some idea of what Your new binds will look like. Next Here is my old CS or CZ 1.6 binds they can be found in C:/ProgramFiles/Steam/YourAccount/counter-strike/cstrike/config.cfg or for CZ C:/ProgramFiles/steam/YourAccount/ConditionZero/Czero/config.cfg I Like using the F1, F2, etc keys for binding my buy commands. bind "F1" "primammo;defuser;" bind "F2" "mp5;primammo;defuser;" bind "F3" "famas;galil;primammo;defuser;" bind "F4" "m4a1;ak47;primammo;defuser;" bind "F5" "hegren;flash;flash;sgren;defuser;" bind "F6" "awp;primammo;defuser;" bind "F7" "vesthelm;" bind "F9" "snapshot" bind "F10" "save quick" bind "F11" "load quick" bind "F12" "quit prompt" (I leave F8 Unbinded as a barrier or buffer between buy commands and other counsol options.) As you can see i binded AK47 and M4A1 on the same key. If I\'m a CT I\'ll get an M4A1 if I\'m T ill get an AK47. This is also commonly done with the Clarion(Famas) and Defender(Galil) The Order you put the items In, DOES matter, You buy them in the order the items are typed left to right. Now for the CS:S Beta Config You Can find it at C:/ProgramFiles/Steam/YourAccount/counter-strike source beta/cstrike/cfg/config.cfg With Mine I Set it up basically the same as my cs 1.6 because I like my custom feel for it. bind "F1" "buy primammo;buy defuser;" bind "F2" "buy mp5;buy primammo;buy defuser;" bind "F3" "buy famas;buy galil;buy primammo;buy defuser;" bind "F4" "buy m4a1;buy ak47;buy primammo;buy defuser;" bind "F5" "buy hegrenade;buy flashbang;buy flashbang;buy smokegrenade;buy defuser;" bind "F6" "buy awp;buy primammo;buy defuser;" bind "F7" "buy vesthelm;" bind "F9" "jpeg" bind "F10" "save quick" bind "F11" "load quick" bind "F12" "quit prompt" If you Follow the Above format On your keys it will work correctly. The few things that you must change to your old binds is the "Buy" command. You must add it before every item on the hotkey. Also the gernade names changed From in 1.6 bind "F5" "hegren;flash;flash;sgren;defuser;" To This in CS:S Beta bind "F5" "buy hegrenade;buy flashbang;buy flashbang;buy smokegrenade;buy defuser;" the differences are clear. Also If you want to check spelling for adding in other binds they can be found by typing "Buy" in counsol on a server. (The list that comes up will look exactly like this. The commands on the following list are 100% accurett) ] buy usage: buy <item> primammo secammo vest vesthelm defuser nvgs flashbang hegrenade smokegrenade galil ak47 scout sg552 awp g3sg1 famas m4a1 aug sg550 glock usp p228 deagle elite fiveseven m3 xm1014 mac10 tmp mp5navy ump45 p90 m249 Weapons/Items by Type Pistols _________ usp glock p228 deagle elites fn57 Shotguns __________ m3 xm1014 SMG\'S __________ mac10 tmp mp5 ump45 p90 Rifles __________ galil ak47 scout sg552 awp g3sg1 famas m4a1 aug sg550 machine gun __________ m249 Ammo __________ secammo primammo Equipment __________ vest vesthelm hegrenade smokegrenade flashbang ( Can be used 2x in same bind) (bind "key" "buy flashbang; buy flashbang) To re-enable counsole as ~ (key) you first must hit ESC in game or go to options. Then go to the Keyboard tab, Hit the advanced button then check the second box which says, "Enable developer Counsole (~)." Those were the only differences I have found in creating buy command binds, If their are more Please send me a AOL-IM as NamesDontMatter6, PM me, or e-mail me at NamesDontMatter2@yahoo.com (mailto:NamesDontMatter2@yahoo.com) If anything sounds confusing and you would like for me to clarify It please e-mail me. I Will Check The Thread hourly so any Questions relating to the article should be posted below. Also I would like to Thank the True beta testers out their who are actually helping steam by doing what their supposed to be doing, reporting bugs.' WHERE post_id = 977699 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I use the nostromo 52 speedpad by belkin so the more each button can do and the less i have to press the better. Having said that heres my scripts for anyone interested: //rates rate 25000 cl_cmdrate 60 cl_updaterate 45 cl_interp 0.05 //weapon scripts bind "j" "buy m4a1; buy ak47; buy primammo; buy vest; buy defuser; buy hegrenade; buy vesthelm" bind "k" "buy awp; buy primammo; buy vest; buy defuser; buy hegrenade; buy vesthelm" bind "l" "buy primammo; buy secammo; buy vest; buy defuser; buy hegrenade; buy vesthelm" bind "x" "buy deagle; buy secammo; buy vest; buy defuser; buy hegrenade; buy vesthelm" bind "z" "buy flashbang; wait; wait; use weapon_flashbang" bind "c" "buy smokegrenade; wait; wait; use weapon_smokegrenade" bind "MOUSE5" "buy hegrenade; wait; wait; use weapon_hegrenade" //plant script bind "MOUSE3" "+rze_plantc4" alias +rze_plantc4 "use weapon_c4; wait; +rze_duck; +attack" alias -rze_plantc4 "-attack; -rze_duck; go_slot2; go_slot1" alias +duckjump "+jump; +rze_duck" alias -duckjump "-rze_duck; -jump" alias +rze_duck "goduck1" alias -rze_duck "goduck0" alias goduck0 "alias +rze_duck goduck1; alias -rze_duck goduck0; -duck" alias goduck1 "alias +rze_duck goduck2; alias -rze_duck goduck0; +duck" alias goduck2 "alias +rze_duck goduck2; alias -rze_duck goduck1" alias go_slot1 "use weapon_mp5navy; use weapon_m4a1; use weapon_m249; use weapon_p90; go_slot1b" alias go_slot1b "use weapon_scout; use weapon_awp; use weapon_g3sg1; use weapon_sg550; go_slot1c" alias go_slot1c "use weapon_sg552; use weapon_aug; use weapon_tmp; use weapon_mac10; use weapon_ak47; go_slot1d" alias go_slot1d "use weapon_ump45; use weapon_xm1014; use weapon_m3; use weapon_famas; use weapon_galil" alias go_slot2 "use weapon_usp; use weapon_glock18; use weapon_deagle; use weapon_p228; use weapon_elite; use weapon_fiveseven" NOTE; the planting code is rze\'s, i just tweaked it a lil to work with cs:s' WHERE post_id = 978064 AND is_historical = 1;
