UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I agree, you run a server and implement your own rules fine,but for you to malishusly destroy or corrupt someones computer because they piss you off is completly childish,thats what kick /ban is for,but you go one step farther which makes you a f|_|cking idiot.As for promoting your server ,i wouldnt say he promoted anything.I\'d say he warned ppl of a childish nub who thinks he can do whatever the f|_|ck he want to ppls computers.I myself would like to come to your server and poon you and your admins asses and i know i could, but for the simple reason that you are doing this to ppl cuz they piss you off well me owning you would piss you off,so.....I myself am going to promote your server,and everyone will know that you and your admins are childish hacking f|_|cks,and i promise you ,your server will not be too popular by the time im done.and for the guy who says that this guy has the right to run client commands on the connecting puter,thats bull hacking someones computer and destroying files is NOT a client command,and is illegal and punishable and i hope you get whats coming to you nub.' WHERE post_id = 1081863 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'how great responses guys, I completely agree with most of you. Here\'s the facts: (...apparently i can\'t use quotes here...oh well, i\'ll still try...) [quote="FJTJ324"]Why should I have to reinstall STEAM because I complained about being spawn camped. I told them I did it to distact them, so that others could get out, and it worked.[\\quote] Oh, is that what you were saying? We couldn\'t make it out between the F*** this and F*** that\'s... [quote="FJTJ324"]Thanks for openly admitting you did hack my PC, and the other one, at least it warns people about how you are.[\\quote] I did nothing of the sort...with the other one i have a vague idea of what\'s wrong, and I would probably have told you what I would do in your situation...but you\'ve been telling me to screw off lately...so,...yeah...and your computer that was "hacked" or whatever i have no idea...i would suggest getting a firewall...possibly an antivirus program...but i honestly have no idea what\'s wrong with it. [quote="Mr.Buzbuz]did the server rules ask you not to complain?[\\quote] [quote="FJTJ324"]nope, did not say anything about complaining, just hacking/cheats.[\\quote] You obviously didn\'t read all of the rules, among them are the following: [quote="server rules"] 3. Do not spam any channel, voice or text. 4. Give proper respect to -}KSA{- clan members. This is their home. [\\quote] of which you violated both and were asked multiple times to please stop which you decided to ignore. [quote="Moe_FuGGeR]I myself would like to come to your server and poon you and your admins asses and i know i could,[\\quote] Please do, it sounds like you might be skilled...I\'d enjoy playing against you and would definitely give you props if you can beat me...you can go ahead and pwn the other clan members though, i\'ll laugh at them along with you []. seriously though, we have a wide range of skill in the clan, and I think you would receive a challenge if that\'s what you\'re looking for. Anyways, enough of this essay, I\'ll tell you right now, we try to run a respectable server, but don\'t take my word for it...and certainly don\'t take his. Make up your own mind and your own opinion. Come on our server and play, and we\'ll tell you what we tell everyone else: If you don\'t like our server, you can leave, it\'s there for those who enjoy having a good time not having to worry about hackers, racists, or people who swear too much...that\'s right folks, it\'s a kid friendly environment, so bring your children. (and don\'t worry, if you like swearing, go ahead, just don\'t use capslock too much, or you MIGHT be asked by admin to settle down a little). Peace. -Arakus' WHERE post_id = 1082131 AND is_historical = 1;
