UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Points per hit - Not kill', post_text = 'Hey all, Just a suggestion really - In publics you notice alot of "kill stealing" whether your at the recieving end of actually stealing the kill. So heres the suggestion. Points added to score board (so you have your kills and you have your deaths but you also have your POINTS) Your rank (height in score board) will be linked to your POINTS rather than kills. You will get points by giving damage. this means if you shoot someone down to 1% health you will get say 9 points... the guy who kills him with get 1 kill but 1 point due to only giving tiny ammount of damage. this will: Reward the guys who do the damage Reduce fustration from "kill stealing" get a better ranking system going Whats your thoughts? (ps a mate brought this up, I just added to it and now posted here so maybe valve can consider it).' WHERE post_id = 1199443 AND is_historical = 1;
