UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'You guys are foolish... "Learn to kill your enemies" that\'s bull and anyone who has actually played a decent match knows that. If you run out and focus all of your effort on killing one opponent at a time you\'ll get mowed over. I\'ll assume most of the people using this argument are either retarded or just don\'t have much play experience. You take pot shots, hit and run, you use grenades and suppressing fire. If I throw a grenade and take three guys down to 30 health or I take a shotgun and pepper a group of enemies doing 300+ damage and getting one or no kills I still want credit. This isn\'t Quake 3, it\'s about teamwork, so any damage you do should be credited to you in some fashion. How about a variation on this idea: How about you list kills and damage seperately on the scoreboard? Action Quake did this, it worked out pretty well. Just list frags on the left, you can still use that to determine who has the highest score, and damage on the right, equalling the total point damage you did each round. You can cap it to 100 per person or keep in the ridiculous amounts of damage you get from AWPing people in the head. It\'d just give you a read out of who is doing more work for his team.' WHERE post_id = 1199730 AND is_historical = 1;
