UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Can\'t buy 2 copys of HL2 with same CC??', post_text = 'Ok I got my pre-order for HL2 done and all is fine (did it yesterday at 12 PST) and now today (friday) i wish to buy one for my friend becuse he has no access to a credit card, but i have made "to many" steam purcheses on this card and i can\'t do it at this time. (it goes on to say becuse of fraud issues) Well i don\'t see why buying it 2 times in 2 different days would be banned, i can see maybe 3 or more times in 2-3 days then locking it down but why one. If this is how it is meant to be then they should change the wording on the "error" message from "to many" to " another steam pucrahse has been made on this card in the past <some many days>. So that we know how long we must wait and also that you can only make one. -Xqnine EDIT: Yes i did do a Support and forum search with no luck on this subject, yes there is one about not being able to buy 2 copys but it was already dealth with in a different manner.' WHERE post_id = 1269456 AND is_historical = 1;
