no i mean i know your wrong, lol. No one likes change around here, but everyone still deals with it anyways. With cs being ported to source, it just put many more years into counter-strikes life. Whether they add and/or take away something SOME people dont like.' WHERE post_id = 1275111 AND is_historical = 1;
