UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Tutorial : How To Install Cs:Source On Linux Debian', post_text = 'This is a little tutorial to help with cs:source on debian, thanx to person wich help me on this forum 1�) edit /etc/apt/sources.list modify version : woody or stable or other to sarge exemple : deb ftp://ftp.fr.debian.org/debian/ (ftp://ftp.fr.debian.org/debian/) sarge main non-free deb-src ftp://ftp.fr.debian.org/debian/ (ftp://ftp.fr.debian.org/debian/) sarge main non-free deb http://non-us.debian.org/debian-non-US (http://non-us.debian.org/debian-non-US) sarge/non-US main non-free deb-src http://non-us.debian.org/debian-non-US (http://non-us.debian.org/debian-non-US) sarge/non-US main non-free deb http://security.debian.org/ (http://security.debian.org/) sarge/updates main non-free Then do : apt-get update apt-get upgrade then apt-get install libc6 gdb when asking updata to glic to new version say : Yes then your cs:source server will work with command line : then make a linux user called steam (or other name or use an existant user) exemple : useradd steam then : su steam cd mkdir hl2ds cd hl2ds wget http://www.servmcs.com/serveurs/steam.tar.gz (http://www.servmcs.com/serveurs/steam.tar.gz) tar xvzf steam.tar.gz rm steam.tar.gz ./steam (steam client will upgrade to version 10) ** if you don\'t have a steam account do : ** ./steam -command create -username YourUsername -email you@isp.com (mailto:you@isp.com) -password YourPassword -question "who is servmcs ?" -answer myhoster ** exemple : ( ./steam -command create -username SteamServmcs -email steam@servmcs.com (mailto:steam@servmcs.com) -password steam4servmcs -question "who is servmcs ?" -answer myhoster ) Now you have to download your cs:source server using your steam account : exemple : ./steam -command update -game "Counter-Strike Source" -dir /home/steam/hl2ds/ -username SteamServmcs -password steam4servmcs ** NOW Cs:Source Is installed ** don\'t forget to put a server.cfg to your cstrike/cfg/ directory then launch server like this : ./srcds_run -game cstrike +ip XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX +hostport 270XX +maxplayers 14 +map de_dust2 if you\'ve got some error like : many : free(): invalid pointer 0x401c7d00! and other : Executing dedicated server config file CMaterial::GetNumAnimationFrames: no representative texture for material sprites/zerogxplode server will work ! don\'t forget to update hlsw to v1.0.0.31 beta or newer to see cs:source server up if you\'ve got any problem post here, i will help you []' WHERE post_id = 1304573 AND is_historical = 1;
