UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'one thing since I\'ve received a PM about this - DO NOT use the above if someone is cheating. Cheating is a whole different world. You have zero legal recource if someone is cheating. You do not own the software and there isn\'t anything illegal about cheating. Cheating falls within Valve\'s realm. It is up to Valve to do something about cheating. but if someone takes down your server (or in this case service and disconnects the users attached to said service), that is a Denial of Service. DoS can be considered "harrassment" by some states and counties. While you\'ll NEVER get a judgement against someone for the above type of hacking, they can technically be charged with a crime under the National Information Infrastructure Protection Act of 1996. Educate yourself by reading the following: http://www.usdoj.gov/criminal/cyber...rime.html#VIIIa (http://www.usdoj.gov/criminal/cybercrime/compcrime.html#VIIIa) Anyways, I\'m hoping someone else is taking the time to shut these kids down. To be honest, it\'s kinda fun in a sick way because you know someone\'s getting in serious trouble on the other end. []' WHERE post_id = 1335940 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = '*bumpin* I run a source clan server and lo and behold a member of the clan tried this - with a full server nonetheless. I am tryin to seem impartial because this is going in my forums as well. Suggestions?' WHERE post_id = 1336130 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I\'ve run a CS server in one form or another for 5 years (since 1.0 so however long that is). If someone who has been playing on my server that long pulled this stunt, I wouldn\'t hesitate to notify his ISP. You can say that I\'m passionate about this but this is also my job (cyber-security). If someone who you call a teammate/friend doesn\'t have enough respect of your server (your $$$, your bandwidth, your time) then he doesn\'t deserve you not calling BS on him and reporting him. But that\'s my $.02.' WHERE post_id = 1336184 AND is_historical = 1;
