UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'VGS, its just the ****ing internet they can live without it and i would rather they didn\'t have it seeing as how they are crashing people off of servers. They most likely also use hacks,cheats, or scripts. Also if your going to pull a "I have two stars and I have been here longer than you", don\'t even try, i have been around since 2000. I just made a new account for steam. One more thing thing, learn some grammar.' WHERE post_id = 1336374 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'VGS, I\'m not really understanding where you are coming from. You are saying that it\'s ok for a script kiddie to do something as innoculous as DoSing a game server. What do you think some of these people become? The future for *some*, and I grant you a very small minority, will be doing bigger and worse things (like EBay, ETrade and Yahoo attacks). What about those who DDoS the Steam service? Is that ok because it\'s "just a game"? You don\'t need monetary loss to prove DoS. And I\'m not a fan of conspiracy theories so the whole Ashcroft is a Nazi/Police State thing doesn\'t spur me on. Cybercrime is cybercrime. If you start trying to justify the fact that some is "ok" just because it\'s on a game, you begin to whittle down the entire system. Anyways, talking tough over the internet proves how childish you are. I\'m done. Act like an adult and talk rationally and maybe we can discuss this like responsible people.' WHERE post_id = 1336448 AND is_historical = 1;
