UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I wish it was legal for the government to take your friend and hold him for a couple of years untill his dumbass learns not to F other people\'s **** up. Why are people pissed? Maybe you wouldn\'t mind if I came to your house broke your windows and spray painted your car would you? Its not like anyone is going to get hurt! We are pissed because there are a bunch of retards messing up our property (yes servers are property and their services are property). So just tell us where you live and we will show you and your friend why it is no big deal.' WHERE post_id = 1335947 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'EDIT: I hardly think physical threats (which are 99.9% useless over TCP/IP) are neccessary. Especially since the poster had nothing to do with it. It IS a DoS attack, and the Server Admin did the right thing. Read Road Runner\'s ( I\'m assuming thats the ISP you meant by RR) Acceptable Use Policy. It\'s against thier rules to use a computer using their service to perform any illegal activity, such as a DoS attack. You\'re right it\'s not funny, cool, cute, or "l337" to crash a server, but since he violated the AUP Road Runner has every right to disconnect him.' WHERE post_id = 1335964 AND is_historical = 1;
