UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = '!Spoiler! Pics: Gold Package Goodies - 56k\'s BEWARE', post_text = 'So I received my Gold package goodies. Excellent. Had to pay FedEx at the door because of canadian customs, then I opened the FedEx cardboard box to find a VERY DAMAGED HL2 box. Here\'s the content: http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_1.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_1.jpg) You can see the entire content of the package. http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_2.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_2.jpg) Damaged box. So much for "collector\'s box" eh. The trash can will collect it. Wow I really need to trim my nails, that\'s horrible. Moving on... http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_3.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_3.jpg) Again, the box. Cheap paper. Fold and collect! http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_4.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_4.jpg) High quality HL2 cap. Nice stuff and I was surprised how it widens quite a lot to fit my oversized head. http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_5.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_5.jpg) Inside of the cap. http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_6.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_6.jpg) Cover of Prima book. Great quality. http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_7.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_7.jpg) Backside of Prima book. I didn\'t take a pic inside so to not spoil anything. http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_8.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_8.jpg) Thickness. It\'s thick, 300 pages. http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_9.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_9.jpg) City 17 postcard, HL2 sticker (remove paper in the back and stick), HL2 soundtrack which I haven\'t listened to (yet). http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_10.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_10.jpg) Posters. Disappointed that they were folded, a small tube would have been better. Nice print, somewhat blurry but good stuff. That\'s it, pretty nice package overall [] Edit: Bleh, img tag doesn\'t seem to work. Bummer.' WHERE post_id = 1480292 AND is_historical = 1;
