UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Half-Life full story? *POSSIBLE SPOILER WARNING*', post_text = 'Yup, so is there any site where I could find full story of the original HL. I did play it a bit, but then my pc just went broke and after that I haven\'t played. But now, before release of HL2, I\'m very interested about that story, so please, someone, tell me [].' WHERE post_id = 1497232 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = '*In a nutshell* 1. you are gordon freeman. You work for black mesa. you are a scientist who tests specimins in this crazy wierd machine. 2. while getting ready for your job, you overhear other scientists talking about an unstable test subject. 3. while testing the subject, a resonance cascade occurs (crazy flashing lights and other dimensions open up). The dimension opened up a portal to the world of Xen, an alien race. 4. You try to get the hell out of black mesa, and while doing so a man in a blue business suit and a grey face is constantly following you. (We call him G-man) 5. about halfway you realize that the government wants you dead. (they get assassins to try and kill you) 6. After a crapload of fighting and zombie killing, you meet up with a scientist who transports you to xen in order to close the portal. 7. You fight this big spider thingy with an eggsack and you kill it. 8. You fight this crazy big baby thing called the nihilanth. 9. You kill it and go through a portal 10. G-man is waiting for you and tells you that you have done a good job, and that he may have further use for you. You go into a portal and the game ends. HL2 is supposed to take place after this. Apparantly the Xen aliens took over the world. And now these new aliens called the Conbine control the cities. We still don\'t know anything about g-man. We are assuming that Gordon has been chryogenically frozen or something and has awakened. And now G-man wants you to go and kick some ©©©. And you proceed to do so, with much pleasure.' WHERE post_id = 1497351 AND is_historical = 1;
