UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Audio Stuttering', post_text = 'There is bound to be more threads on this as its becoming apparent a lot of people are experiencing this issue in HL2. I suggest making a sticky on it. Basically, whenever the game loads sounds on the fly, the game takes a performance hit, stuttering the sound and causing the game to judder. I and others have tried numerous solutions to fix it and so far, nothing as worked sucessfully. I have even ran the game in a window with an MP3 running over the top. The game stuttered, the MP3 did not suggesting this isn\'t a soundcard issue. Please post here if you have this problem so it can be highlighted as its ruining a bloody fine game. I have contacted Valve via their support system but lets make them aware of it here too....and keep it clean. We want the problem sorted, not blown up. Cheers Sie' WHERE post_id = 1532026 AND is_historical = 1;
