UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'What\'s the deal with the ending? (spoiler-esque)', post_text = 'Wow, I loved the whole game... until the very end. I was very disappointed with that ending. Perhaps I missed something but there just seems like too many plot holes to deal with and not enough resolve. Another 6 years to figure out what is going to happen is just too long! I just wanted to vent my frustration to the people who\'d probably understand the most. Spoiler: Who are the benefactors (besides the aliens controlling Earth)? The carbine soldiers are humans, right? Why are the aliens controlling us? What are their motives? Did you kill Alyx? Who\'s the G Man and who\'s he working for? Why is the G Man have a hard time talking - is he an alien? I have a hundred more questions if anyone would like to talk about HL2. Any comments on the ending? A possible discussion?' WHERE post_id = 1538089 AND is_historical = 1;
