UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'G-Man is dead! (Bug)', post_text = 'I finished the game ealier today. Tonight I felt like driving the scout car and smashing some antlions, so I loaded up the coast level and started driving and smashing away. I didn\'t stop at any of the houses along the way, except the one where I ran over the soldiers. I drove all the way to the town where you meet with that anoying British guy and fight the gunship. I stopped just before I got there, but that guy still came running up to me and told me to get to the basement. I ignored him, turned my car around and drove back the other way smashing more antlions. I got to the house where the soldiers are with the binocular things. I killed the soldiers and looked to see if the g-man was still there. He was, but after it made it\'s first pass he didn\'t dissapear like he did before. I get back in the car, drive back to the town and sure enough, he\'s still standing there with the British guy. http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/...75/original.jpg (http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/36559275/original.jpg) http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/...76/original.jpg (http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/36559276/original.jpg) http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/...77/original.jpg (http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/36559277/original.jpg) I go upstairs for a closer look, and for some reason the Brisish guy runs from me. He ran around the side, but the G-Man stayed there. He\'d even look at me every few seconds. http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/...78/original.jpg (http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/36559278/original.jpg) http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/...79/original.jpg (http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/36559279/original.jpg) I ran downstairs to see if the Brittish guy would be there, and he was. Then I ran back up to see if he was still up top, he\'d dissapeared from up there, but G-Man was still there. http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/...80/original.jpg (http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/36559280/original.jpg) I couldn\'t shoot him, so I went back to the basement to grabbed the rocket launcher so the attack would begin. I ran back upstairs just in time to see the alien gunship mow down G-Man. [] http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/...81/original.jpg (http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/36559281/original.jpg) After I killed the gunship, the G-Man was still there, his bony hands still clutching that brief case. http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/...82/original.jpg (http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/36559282/original.jpg) Now I could shoot him and watch his body jump around, it felt good for some reason. [] No matter how many rounds I put into his dead body, he wouldn\'t let go of that damned briefcase. I guess we\'ll never find out what\'s inside. http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/...83/original.jpg (http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/36559283/original.jpg) http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/...68/original.jpg (http://www.pbase.com/jchaney/image/36559568/original.jpg)' WHERE post_id = 1563236 AND is_historical = 1;
