UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Hl� mutiplayer menu download!', post_text = 'Read this if you create a server! 1)Give the ip 2)Say if Sv_cheats is 1 or 0 3)Say what Multiplayer version you use! #1 or #2 -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Multiplayer #1 -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- First, a new Hl�multiplayer mod is available you can download it by this link Select a server -------------------------------------------------------------------------- Server: Create and give an ip! Ps: This 127.0.0.1:27015 is not a good ip! Server 1: 213.202.216.10:27015 Maps (http://uploads.savefile.com/redir_show.php?file_name=hl2mpmappack.rar) Green=Online Red=Offline ""To add a server go in Half-life2>Server>Favorite>Add a server Or by Steam, go in Steam>Server>Favorite>Add a server"" --------------------------------------------------------------------------- No console command needed! Readme: To play whit this Multiplayer-Mod 1.Extract the hl2mp_11a_full.zip in X:\\Steam\\SteamApps\\accountname\\half-life 2\\ 2. Add to your Half-life2 shortcut : -applaunch 220 -game hl2mp -console 3.Now start the shortcut and have fun [] -------------------------------------------------------------------------- If you need help for this mod, Visit me (http://www.hl2mp.tk/) German -------------------------------------------------------------------------- Half-life� Multiplayer Radio! Clik on "mp3 listen" Green=Online Red=Offline -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Multiplayer #2 -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Here to play in multiplayer! You can Join/create server and play! Direct download! Clik me! (http://perso.wanadoo.fr/diablo150/HL2_multi.rar) Ps: The readme is in french and english! Screen *in french*: Screen1 (http://img60.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img60&image=creerserveur01.jpg) Screen2 (http://img61.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img61&image=creerserveur02.jpg) Screen3 (http://img61.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img61&image=partie01.jpg) Screen4 (http://img95.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img95&image=multi.jpg) -------------------------------------------------------------------------- All maps here (http://homepage.ntlworld.com/sebastian.birlet/hl2mp_mappack_v2.rar) Extract the maps in X:\\Games\\Valve\\Steam\\SteamApps\\hotmail.com\\half-life 2\\hl2\\ -------------------------------------------------------------------------- Server: Create and give an ip! Ps: This 127.0.0.1:27015 is not a good ip! Server 1: 24.201.100.122 Server 2: 4.5.29.12 Server 3: 212.84.153.132 Green=Online Red=Offline ""To add a server go in Half-life2>Server>Favorite>Add a server Or by Steam, go in Steam>Server>Favorite>Add a server"" --------------------------------------------------------------------------- No console command needed! Readme: To add multiplayer menu in Half-life 2 Go to this folder: C:\\Valve\\Steam\\SteamApps\\xxx\\half-life 2\\hl2\\resource\\ And add the file "GameMenu.res" (he is in this package). Go to C:\\Valve\\Steam\\SteamApps\\xxx\\half-life 2\\hl2\\cfg\\ Add the file "settings.scr" (make copy of original file, for security) Enjoy, you can create a multiplayer game with Half-life 2 interface. If any folder don\'t exist, create it! ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- Also visit The shibby zed-hl2 (http://www.theshibby.com/zed/hl2/hl2.php) for usefull command! ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- Clik me for some Ip (http://hl2world.com/bbs/viewtopic.php?t=15708)' WHERE post_id = 1572865 AND is_historical = 1;
