UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'G-Man Sightings & Odessa *Spoiler*', post_text = 'First off, I am sorry if this was already posted, the Steam search page displayed: EDIT - Read this (/forums/showthread.php?s=&postid=1762613#post1762613) regarding the response to this thread. "Sorry. The search function has been disabled by the administrator." and I didn\'t really feel like browsing through the endless pages of the Half-Life 2 Forum to find out! [] Also, I realize there is a "G-Man About Town: Checklist" that is under the ANOMALOUS MATERIALS section of the Prima Guide. That said, this thread is mainly for those who either do not have access to the guide or just want to know where you can find G-Man about town (and 2 other locations that I found that are not necessarily discussed in the checklist). I took these images while playing through the game. 1. Intro: Wake up and smell the ashes. http://img93.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img9...ation_10007.jpg (http://img93.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img93&image=d1_trainstation_10007.jpg) 2. Chapter 2: A Red Letter Day - On a monitor screen in Kleiner\'s lab. http://img109.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img...tion_050058.jpg (http://img109.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img109&image=d1_trainstation_050058.jpg) 3. Chapter 3: Route Kanal - On a television a Vortigaunt is watching inside the red train carriage. http://img109.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img...nals_010062.jpg (http://img109.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img109&image=d1_canals_010062.jpg) 4. Chapter 4: Water Hazard - Standing on pier in front of Station 7. http://img109.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img...nals_060068.jpg (http://img109.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img109&image=d1_canals_060068.jpg) 5. Chapter 4: Water Hazard - Flickering on a giant monitor attached to the high-rise building. http://img100.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img...nals_060076.jpg (http://img100.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img100&image=d1_canals_060076.jpg) 6. Chapter 4: Water Hazard - On a small gantry near 2nd covered bridge. http://img100.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img...nals_120004.jpg (http://img100.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img100&image=d1_canals_120004.jpg) 7. Chapter 4: Water Hazard - Standing on the dam, before entering Black Mesa East. http://img100.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img...nals_130016.jpg (http://img100.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img100&image=d1_canals_130016.jpg) ***** 8. Chapter 6: "We Don\'t Go To Ravenholm" - Walking into a train tunnel beyond the railcar blocking the railroad. http://img100.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img...town_050045.jpg (http://img100.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img100&image=d1_town_050045.jpg) 9. Chapter 7: Highway 17 - Peering through the binocular tripod on one of the windows. http://img95.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img9...oast_030047.jpg (http://img95.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img95&image=d2_coast_030047.jpg) ***** 10. Chapter 9: Nova Prospekt - On a monitor screen looking through a window. http://img95.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img9...ison_020074.jpg (http://img95.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img95&image=d2_prison_020074.jpg) 11. Chapter 11: Anticitizen One - On a television at the ruined foyer of a tenement block. http://img94.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img9..._c17_020078.jpg (http://img94.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img94&image=d3_c17_020078.jpg) 12. Chapter 14: Dark Energy - Top of Citadel Spire stopping time and exiting into space. http://img94.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img9...reen_010047.jpg (http://img94.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img94&image=d3_breen_010047.jpg) ================================= 13. Chapter 11: Anticitizen One - Above the main plaza on the large Breen monitor on the central column. http://img99.exs.cx/img99/3391/Gman_w00t.jpg (http://img99.exs.cx/img99/3391/Gman_w00t.jpg) * - denotes the locations not mentioned in the checklist. = - denotes the new sightings line. What do you guys think of the G-Man sighting off Highway 17?! He is talking to Colonel Odessa Cubbage... and based on the guide, "...much about the Colonel is open to question: from his slightly askew mustache, to his supposedly British accent, which many suspect is as false as the military exploits with which he regales his followers." I wasn\'t too sure of this fella either. Do you think he would make an appearance in the future story -- or is he too small of a part to base any strong opinions? Anyways, I thought this was interesting and worth taking a look at, as well as that mysterious agent who is not quite comfortable with human speech. [] Legend RED - new sighting possibility CYAN - new sighting possibility confirmation VIOLET - possible link to g-man EDIT - New Sighting Possibility #1 quote:Originally posted by buhj54 I\'m not positive this is a G-man sighting because of the distance and you dont have zoom on the main menu but take a look at this picture. http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...round060000.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v509/Bobw34sfs/background060000.jpg) Wait at that main menu for 20-30 secs and stare at the window i circled in red. You see a guy walk over pause then he just kinda dissapears like the G-man does. I think you can make a briefcase out in his hand but its so far away. Anyone else notice this one? Nice observation buhj54, I past that background loading screen while playing through the game -- maybe we\'ll get some confirmation. EDIT - Sighting Possibility #1 Confirmed! The man in the window is not G-Man, but in fact a woman civilian. Proof below thanks to Caboose [] quote:Originally posted by Caboose The character in background06.bsp is not the G-Man. I opened it in a text editor and changes some of the entitie properties around on the info_player_start so I could move. Then nocliped my way over to that figure. http://xs5.xs.to/pics/04493/background060000.jpg (http://xs5.xs.to/pics/04493/background060000.jpg) That\'s what I found on the other side. EDIT - Possible Link to G-Man? #1 quote:Originally posted by MalcolmCarmen Here\'s an interesting spray, not exactly a sighting though [] http://img130.exs.cx/img130/731/d3_c17_10b1.jpg (http://img130.exs.cx/img130/731/d3_c17_10b1.jpg) Closer view... quote:Originally posted by Xanthos http://home.wi.ps.pl./~abania/screen2.jpg (http://home.wi.ps.pl./~abania/screen2.jpg) EDIT - Possible Link to G-Man? #1 Pending... Any more theory or explanation toward the dark figure in a trench coat holding an umbrella in the (acid?) rain? EDIT - New Sighting Possibility #2 quote:Originally posted by Outlandish Making a change from all the Deathmatch threads, found your long-awaited 13th sighting. In Anticitizen One at one point some citizens are pulling down one of the massive Dr. Breen screens, and the Gman flashes on it repeatedly and briefly. Hard to take screenies as it flashes fairly quickly, but it\'s definitely him. EDIT - Sighting Possibility #2 Confirmed! The blurry image poses a very close resemblance to my 5th sighting (http://img100.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img...nals_060076.jpg (http://img100.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img100&image=d1_canals_060076.jpg)). Thus, becomes the 13th sighting! Thanks to Outlandish and mace1337 [] Excellent discovery you two! quote:Originally posted by mace1337 Ok, so i\'ve played the level, made a movie with fraps, opened in vdub, and forwarded it frame-by-frame.... I think this is G-Man, but it\'s very blurry, anyway, who else in this game wears a blue suit with a tie? http://img99.exs.cx/img99/3391/Gman_w00t.jpg (http://img99.exs.cx/img99/3391/Gman_w00t.jpg) I really like what you guys are coming up with... again, refrain from using cheats to propose your sighting(s) -- description good, pictures better. Using cheats to confirm a new sighting is fair game as far as I\'m concerned [] Side note: If you find the layout of my thread confusing please PM me. Thank you. - Shank' WHERE post_id = 1575656 AND is_historical = 1;
