UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = '/forums/...threadid=178246 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=178246) quote:Originally posted by ritalin In that pic on the coast. You are looking through a combine binocular set up. Though it seems like an ordinary "Hey, the gman is there" situation. I zoomed in on that pic (try it yourself) he is talk to the colonol (the dude with the british accent who gives you the RPG) Check out the leet toque on his head. I\'m sure it is him. So, then you drive over to that town and everyone says "We are expecting a Gunship attack." Now how the ©©©© do they know that? Could be a few ways, intercepted radio transmissions, or maybe the Gman said it. Maybe the Gman SOLD the RPG to them (Perhaps he makes profit on war. As he says at the end of the game, "I have numerous employers who want to buy you." or whatever.) Also, when going on the underground railway (in the canel) you drop down into a broken down rail cart, with a Vort and a Resistance member. If you are quick enough, you can see the Vort, by the TV, is watching the Gman... Why? ©©©© if I know. Very relevant here ritalin. I enjoyed reading your thoughts on the HL/2 story thus far, as well as others. I am subscribing to your thread []' WHERE post_id = 1576368 AND is_historical = 1;
