UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Howdy! Thye audio stutter patch didnt work at first. Was the same as before. I then restarted windows, set my AGP size to 256 (I have 768 ram total) in the bios. Then added all the suggested console commands, (heapsize, forepreloads etc..). (I had done all these before, but they had no effect so i reset my changes). Also made th autosave files read only! Stuttering is now all but gone. I think the command that is helping the most now is snd_async_fullyasync 1 The only time I notice anything bad now is when I fire a gun for the first time since last load, the sound lags about 1 second behind the shot animation, but thereafter its ok, and theres never any stutter. amd 2600+ 768 ram audigy plat WD 10,000rpm sata rapter HDD ATI 9700 pro (latest DNA drivers with HL2 optimised option) winxp sp2 proff gigabyte 7dxr motherboard' WHERE post_id = 1624457 AND is_historical = 1;
