UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Rather than sitting here drawing out in detail MY tactics for for CS and CS:S I\'m going to give you a hand in developing your own tactics. What should do (I\'m assuming your new to the CS world) is learn the maps first of all, thats very importiant. Second, play with each weapon and learn its goods and bads for your particular playing style. Some would say the AK-47 is the best and other will argue that the mp-5 is the best, it just depends on what you think is the best. Same thing with grenades, learn the map and learn when and how you should use them for the situation your in. There is no real stratagy guide for CS and CS:S, just play and don\'t get frustrated, eventually you\'ll be rackingup kills like your in the CAL. Besides, even the best players have bad days where they couldn\'t kill an AFK.' WHERE post_id = 1641012 AND is_historical = 1;
