UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = '1. Respect other players. Avoid going into arguments with people you don\'t know (cause it\'s pointless), like cheaters or other lamers. Everybody was a noob once. Don\'t ever accuse people of cheating (90% of the people who blame others are wrong), if there is no doubt, just say it in teamspeak. 2. Learn from others. Walk along with the top players of your team (check scoreboard). Avoid being in his way and just observe what he does/how he does it and why. Avoid trying to walk alone (or camp in a corner). Work as a team as best you can (mostly it works out when teammembers see it work). Observe top players when you\'re dead. 3. Learn the rules of the game (bomb placing/hostage rescueing) and live them (don\'t camp if it\'s not your objective in the game). 4. Learn the maps and the starting routes. 5. It\'s okay to pull back when under fire. Just reload when your safe and don\'t stay in one spot too long. 6. Get used to the AK or the Colt rifle. Every weapon has it own recoil to get used too. Since these are the most common weapons (mostly laying on the ground), it\'s more efficient to start with these rifles. 7. When in close encounter with an enemy, full fire, strafe and aim at the troat. 8. When in middle range distance with an enemy, burst fire (2 - 4 shots at a time, depending on your hit percentage). If your enemy doesn\'t die after 2 / 3 bursts, try aiming better (chest or head). 9. When in long range, crouch, aim at the head / upper chest, 2 shots at a time when crosshairs stop moving inwards. Take your time to aim (don\'t shoot just because you get hit by enemy), and you\'ll find that you\'ll win most of the time (because 80% of the community fires too inaccurate). 10. Practice above steps. Practice hard. Don\'t give up. Don\'t blame others of mistakes. It\'s just a game. [] And try to believe in your hit accuracy in one point in time. When you do, you\'ll find that you can stop reloading so often, because after muchos practicos, you can kill about 5 people with one 30 bullet clip. When you do, people start to accuse you of cheating, and that\'s the point you\'ll know your above average and end up in the top 3 in each game. Good luck! []' WHERE post_id = 1642323 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'And dont call "cheater" to every good player in game. [] Many pple has been playing this game for years and anticipe almost any move you can do, and any tactic you can think without using hacks. So try to learn from the best players, enjoy and practise till your fingers drop, and eventually you will became a good player.' WHERE post_id = 1642503 AND is_historical = 1;
