UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'lycos declares war on spam servers', post_text = 'From slashdot.org - IT: Lycos Declares War on Spam Servers Posted by michael on Friday November 26, @09:07PM from the spam-it-forward dept. Psychotext writes "The Register have posted a story about a new screensaver from Lycos that targets known spam servers (taken from spamcop and verified by hand) with traffic in order to raise their bandwidth costs and hopefully price them out of the game. Lycos state that this is not a DDOS as Lycos monitors the site\'s responsiveness and throttles back when the site starts to falter. The screensaver is available here for Mac OSX, Mac OS9 and Windows, though you might need to lie about what country you are from." Reader JohnGrahamCumming writes "As part of preparing for the MIT Spam Conference I\'ve put together a survey on what people are experiencing out there with spam, what they are doing about and followed it up with a test of different views of an inbox filled with spam and ham. You can take the test and be part of the survey results in January." You can get the screensaver from here: http://makelovenotspam.com/intl/ (http://makelovenotspam.com/intl/)' WHERE post_id = 1651779 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I\'m thrilled by this idea. I\'ve not done any research, but I suspect there might be some legal problems with using this screen-saver in the USA. But, if it gets enough publicity, there\'s bound to be enough places around the globe that it can be run so that it does actually place some pain on the spammers. Viva "Death Wish". (A Charles Bronson movie reference. IOW - vigilantism lives.)' WHERE post_id = 1652099 AND is_historical = 1;
