UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'System specs...', post_text = 'Thanks for your replies and support guys. But don\'t forget to post your system specs if you\'ve tried all the suggested requirements and have run out of options trying to make the game run consistently. What\'s really sad is that it\'s been a week since I sent SecuROM my report and I have yet to hear back from them. Vivendi support has only repsonded ONCE to my report, telling me to delete the ClientRegistry.blob file and restart Steam. Not to be rude here, but I get the feeling they were just blowing me off. I mean, you\'d think that if I spent hours writing a 2000+ word error report I\'d have at least tried that suggestion already. Now I\'m somewhat concerned as to what their next suggestion will be, if they ever bother to respond, of course; perhaps they\'ll tell me to make sure my PC is plugged in and powered up? [] Mister Marbles' WHERE post_id = 1673279 AND is_historical = 1;
