UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'DX8 Water Reflection Patch [WIP] CSS Beta now Available!', post_text = 'I have found a way to make Fully reflective water for DX8 I am now making a patch that will let all Nvidia and DX8 users have full reflective water in HL2. I am still ironing out the bugs and the quality isnt like DX9 but its a heck of alot better than a cubemap. Once I get this dont there will be 2 versions a HL2 one and a CSS one here\'s some screens ---Test Screens---- These are from a test map I made to test the power of the DX8 reflections http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...tertest0000.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/dx8_watertest0000.jpg) http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...tertest0001.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/dx8_watertest0001.jpg) http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...tertest0002.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/dx8_watertest0002.jpg) http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...tertest0003.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/dx8_watertest0003.jpg) http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...tertest0004.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/dx8_watertest0004.jpg) http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...tertest0005.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/dx8_watertest0005.jpg) ---Patch Screens--- And here are some from the patch http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...nals_060000.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/d1_canals_060000.jpg) http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...nals_060001.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/d1_canals_060001.jpg) http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...nals_060004.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/d1_canals_060004.jpg) http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...nals_060002.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/d1_canals_060002.jpg) I have tested with a few people with ATi DX8 cards but so far it hasnt worked Still need to test with other Nvidia cards. my Specs 1.4GHz AMD 368 MB or Ram Nvidia Geforce FX 5200 128MB I will keep you updated on my progress [] Update the CSS beta is now available here http://pcgamemods.com/8827/ (http://pcgamemods.com/8827/) I need feedback for this so the HL2 one can be final once I release it.' WHERE post_id = 1686198 AND is_historical = 1;
