UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'disable the Gravity gun', post_text = 'hahah server admins, start dsiabling the gravity gun! everywhere noobs throwing stuff at eachother. my 1st game on HL2DM was 116/67 finishing #1 in a 14 player server. yes i also used the GG and i did get many kills using it, but i got even more with the pistol or the crossbow or the machingun cuz i actually got some aiming skills and i hate getting killed by noobie players throwing a desk at me. i predict all the ladders will be disabling the GG cuz its such a waste lol no skill required whatsoever. and for the GG noobs out there, plz go for the smaller objects, u can throw em further, are more accurate and require less energy from the GG. now go and use it some cuz that thing will be banned soon ahahha' WHERE post_id = 1718938 AND is_historical = 1;
