UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'FPS random drop problem', post_text = '** Sorry if this thread exist I swear I\'ve searched and read tons of threads without success ** Well this is my problem, I play cs 1.6 or any steam game for that matter and I\'ll have 99 - 100 fps constant then a few minutes in the game it will turn into 30-40 constant This is what I\'ve done to try and fix it ------------------------------------------------- Reinstalled all my ATI 9600 AIW Drivers Switched to the Omega ATI 9600 Drivers Formated my HDD Formated the Drive that Steam is on Reinstalled Steam Tried Random Tweaks I found on here Search the New for any Video Card Problems Did some Benchmark test And Now I\'ll all out of ideas... if anyone could help it would be appreciated thanks in advanced ************************************** These are my specs OS: WinXP Professional 5.1 Service Pack 2 (Build #2600) CPU: Intel Pentium 4 , 3.00 GHz HyperThreading Enabled Mobo: Asus P4P800 Deluxe VIDEO: Compaq V70 ALL-IN-WONDER 9600 SERIES (1024x768x32bpp 85Hz) DirectX 9C SOUND: SoundMAX Digital Audio MEMORY: 512MB Kingston Hyper X Ram PC3200 HDD: Seagate Barracuda 7200RPM 200GB Network Adapter: 3Com Gigabit LOM' WHERE post_id = 1831845 AND is_historical = 1;
