UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Xp|icit~Sh0cK ya u all get good performence becuz u all have pretty good computers on 1.5 this machine had a geforce 2 and i was getting 80-100 fps on 1024x768 2xAF 4xAA but on 1.6 it droped about 50 fps ya i know its the cleron such a pos im hopeuflly getting a new MB and getting an Athlon xp or something or maybe just a P4 with HT i can have AF and AA cranked without fps drops so my video card can keep up but my ram and cpu cant so im hoping on getting a new one sometime soon Punctuation is your friend. Next I would download Detonator Destroyer and reinstall your video card drivers with the lastest ones from the nVidia website. There is no reason to be running at that low of an FPS even with your crummy CPU and RAM amount. It sounds like you didn\'t properly clean out the previous drivers from your GeForce 2 when you installed your GeForce 6800. CS is a six year old game, and even with Steam installed you should be having such massive frame rate loss with a 6800.' WHERE post_id = 1975287 AND is_historical = 1;
