UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'how a cd key process works', post_text = 'I am a computer programmer and here is the simplest explanation: say you have a key of 25 digits. what you do is: use a randomize command on c++ and what it does is it circles between 0 through 9 and a through z as soon as that number/letter is determined the program stores it in a place called array (differentiating between numbers and characters) finally because the operation has to be done 25 times we use a loop which let;s the program run and stops as soon as all 25 spaces are filled then it sends that 25 digit key to the system and stores it there there are no patterns whatsoever. the way randomize function is designed.. it is meant to randomize whatever on purpose. here is a simple example (in pseudocode) for (int key; start; end){ key_now=random_chosen; key holder(of current step 1-25) =key_now; } } this is a silly example but this is what the program does. it takes 1 minute to write it. it takes 1 minute to write sendtosystem function and finally the rest of the time is done printing it out, sticking into game packages etc' WHERE post_id = 520233 AND is_historical = 1;
