UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Valve\'s dilemma', post_text = 'I can\'t believe that valve would up and change the whole feel of the awp because a couple of nubs wanted it changed. Whether you like it not guys, the awp/deagle switch wasn\'t an error, it\'s the way the game was designed. Leave it like that. I\'ve been playin cs for right at 4 years this summer, when you\'ve used an awp like I do, its impossible to change what you do. I used to come home and look forward to playing cs, now I can\'t wait to uninstall. This forum is the most pathetic display of cs skill I\'ve ever seen. Just listen to Viiraxe, he\'s an admin of the REAL cs gaming community over at gotfrag. Whew, ok my flame is over, now for the real post. It\'s just funny, nubs gripe gripe gripe about the awp because they are too stupid to know how to use one, or how to pick an awper. Well guess what, the awp is still there, and now MORE camping is gonna happen as a result of it, because now instead of being able to pull out your deagle then go back, you have to leave your awp out if you wanna try a second shot. All they did was slow the game down more. I know nobody here remembers 1.3, but the game was nice and fast then.... It should be like that again, I can\'t believe you people who call yourself cs players try to change the weapons and crosshairs when the game has real issues it needs to fix. Valve you\'ve done many good updates since 1.6 has been out. The money system was the best thing you ever did to competitive cs. Adding the galil and famas was also one of the best things you ever did. Well, changing the awp and the crosshairs was just a mistake; and you have the chance to redeem yourself by changing it back. The crosshairs aren\'t even that huge of a deal as long as you play in 640 like I do. You have an entire community(other than a few noobs) at your fingertips right now, this decision could help you sell a LOT more copies of hl2. In fact, if they don\'t fix the awp, I will never buy another valve product again.' WHERE post_id = 562165 AND is_historical = 1;
