UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'tru, the awp was not an unbalanced weapon. just like automatic rifles they have their uses, it was a Long range weapon that took skill to use close range / to kill others using the awp by being more skilled. Autos = closer range weapon which took skill to use at long ranges. now valve has taken away the short range capabilities AND the distinguishing factors in being able to truly "out-awp" the unskilled players that wanted the fix in the first place. comments like "i like the awp change, i do better in pubs now and my record is better" from users that like the update.. Give us all an idea of the mentality from these group of so called cs players. The game is about challenge and competition, not decreasing the level of skill that can be reached so that new players stand a better chance at being sucessful. the awp change has ruined cs. i do not see why i would want to support this game when it is no longer the game i have played over the course of 3 yrs. this is by far the worst update in my opinion. we will continue to lose more of the great players that are the backbone of this community. valve why don\'t you just the same delay to all other guns as well, as the logic would fit your need for "realism". cuz u know there are ppl that have autos and shoot off a few, switch to pistol, shoot off a few pistol rounds etc., then go back to auto to shoot etc. and u know what? OMG they\'re glitching cuz they just bypassed the recoil recovery time on each gun by switching! by the way Valve that last part ^ is sarcasm. please don\'t add those 2 u next "upgrade" if u know what i mean. alright then i quit Cinco de Mayo if CS is not fixed. I agree with u Frantic1, cs is no longer enjoyable. mark on my calandar - May 5th 2004 - QUIT CS.' WHERE post_id = 562389 AND is_historical = 1;
