UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'As far as I know right now, this is a client system problem and not a Valve problem. In every instance that it\'s been seen in the past, it was solved by one or more of the solutions I\'ve detailed as long as the player actually tried it and followed through. Unfortunately, this problem doesn\'t seem to be one of those that can be replicated easily, if at all. You have to realise that if I was sitting there at your computer trying to solve this problem, I would follow exactly the steps I\'ve detailed ... but the difference is at each step how the problem changes tells me something that I could use for the next step. Since I\'m not there, I\'m mostly blind, and if I\'m lucky enough to get a solution in place, most players usually never even tell me they are so happy to be able to play. The only other possible solution that has worked in the past (that I know of) was to replace the network card, but this is difficult and not a guaranteed solution either, although not that expensive these days.' WHERE post_id = 570407 AND is_historical = 1;
