UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I still see no need for this \'realistic\' playermodels. Where is the realism when you shoot 20 bullets on your enemy and he survives? Even talking about realism in CS is so stupid and that\'s the point. We don\'t want a realistic game. We want a working game that is fun and could be used for official esports, tournaments and LANs. It was really fun and it still is more fun than other games, but if you keep this way (making the game more realistic and newbie friendly) you\'ll lose many players with every update. The best thing would be, asking the community, what they wanna have changed or at least let a choice of what being changed (like at cl_dynamiccrosshair/cl_radartype). You can use use Condition Zero or whatever for earning money. Don\'t ruin a mod, which had grown so big, because it was non-commercial. Just think about it VALVe.\n\n__________________ [ Addicted to funmaps? | www.planet-zYk.de ]' WHERE post_id = 587467 AND is_historical = 1;
