UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'it cant be...', post_text = 'im the computer geek around my area, and two of my freinds have come to me because they have been banned. i believe in vac. i was skeptical. however im a man of reason and decided to listen to them. they both got banned under the exact same circumstances. i tried what they did, and got banned myself, yes i sacrificed my own account (its ok i have 6). here is what happened: 1. set up 2 comps on a lan. 2. log into one comp using account x. 3. join this server-its the one we all got banned on. (play 4 a min or 2) 66.103.151.18:27015 4. exit that server, dont exit cs, leave it running. 5. log into another comp using the same account x. 6. log into that server. (66.103.151.18:27015) it doesnt always work, keep trying though. i wasnt succesful until i tried my 3rd account (total tries, like 20) that server has vac running, however they may not have updated steam in awhile, its a 24/7 server, i can tell they have an outdated version of some of their 3rd party plugins. (i dont know, but if you have client side c-d running and you join a vac server does c-d still stop you from cheating? i, not my freinds, was running this during my expirement.) if anyone is willing to try this, plz do. post back if you get banned. i want to know if this is a one-in-a-million thing, or if something else is at fault. i think there was a virus or something else was at fault here that caused this, and we are at fault. i have always believed in vac, however there was the winamp bug...so there is a very VERY small chance, but a chance none the less, there is a bug. thx. note: test my theory at ur own risk. i will not provide cd-keys for those who get banned. on a(nother) note- when we got the ban error, we had just joined, we were still downloading the security module.' WHERE post_id = 785666 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'look, im not saying "OMFG VALVE U SUC VAC DOESNT WORK, I WASNT CHEATING" but maybe sometimes people arent. there are literally countless appplications out there on our systems, running in the background. i know that one of them could be a false positive, just as hlamp was. if i had the time and resources, i would run every application combo imaginable, and i ASSURE you that something will turn up. however, most people dont know which ones were running when they got banned. all im saying is...look for common problems, or how about this idea that popped in my head when i was writing that last scentance (and this one)..... create a poll-like thing, if you were banned by vac, you fill it out. it would include: what apps were running? what isp/connection was running when it happened were there multiple ppl logged in this account ect. filter out all the similarities if more than o say..10? 20? 50? ppl reply with the SAME problem and look into it, test it ect. i still believe in vac, and that the bans on me and my freinds werent just, we will accept it and move on. we all decided to post this, so you dont have all 3 of us spamming the boards and not using the search button, to look for posts on the same topic [] with my best regards -|Veni_Vidi_Vici*- (say can we get a signature font for our signature on these boards? like [sig]blah[/sig], italics just doesnt cut it...)' WHERE post_id = 785703 AND is_historical = 1;
