UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'If you are experiencing freezing lag, etc... that can sometimes cause the game to crash, try these commands: rate 999999 cl_cmdrate 100 cl_updaterate 100 Sometimes steam just completely resets these to the default values which are.. well... crap. Default Values: rate 7500 cl_cmdrate 30 cl_updaterate 30 Usually setting these commands to 999999, 100, and 100 respectively takes away most, if not all of my lag. Check these settings often if you are experiencing lag, for they will reset very often.' WHERE post_id = 813744 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'i have an autoexec.cfg that sets these values when i start the game though :/ ________________ My AUTOEXEC.CFG // <email hidden> Half-Life Configuration // Autoexec.cfg ECHO Setting configuration from Autoexec.cfg... cl_lw "1" cl_lc "1" cl_download_ingame "1" cl_allowupload "1" cl_updaterate "45" cl_rate "20000" cl_cmdrate "100" cl_cmdbackup "2" cl_showfps "1" fps_max "100" fps_modem "0" hud_fastswitch "1" mp_decals "300" rate "20000" bind 1 slot1 bind 2 slot2 bind 3 slot3 bind 4 slot4 bind 5 slot5 bind 6 slot6 bind 7 slot7 bind 8 slot8 bind 9 slot9 bind 0 slot10 // End of File' WHERE post_id = 814326 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Hack detection built into steam', post_text = 'Well, I know this is a big task yet if completed it would be beneficial to all, especially server owners who want rock sloid proof if someone hacks or not. I play and am admin on the [RAW] server and we catch quite a few aimbotters. Many contest the ban incurred by HLGaurd, yet we stay firm with the ban. Even though we have full trust in the system it would further help us and thousands others to be able to determine someone with hacks or not by using a trusted software program and what\'s better than steam? This is the reason why I decided to suggest this, a player recently who is scared he will get banned due to recieving several HLG flags said this: quote:im getting really freaked out. i got aimbot warning #2. so im wondering if theres a program to find any hax downloads or something. this stuff is really freaking me out again. Many people, at least people who don\'t live alone, have others using their computers and hence have access to CS and the internet and can potentially download hacks onto one\'s system without letting the owner know. This was the case for one or two palyers on our server and we set them straight, keeping our trust in them. Maybe something like this won\'t be able to be handled effectively by vavle, yet it\'s a place to start. BTW, I have posted this issue on UA forums as well, take a look and see the replies: http://forums.unitedadmins.com/inde...t=0#entry234090 (http://forums.unitedadmins.com/index.php?act=ST&f=185&t=40513&st=0#entry234090)' WHERE post_id = 807773 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'You never heard of VAC (Valve Anti Cheat)?' WHERE post_id = 807788 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Unfortunatly, thats a major flaw in steams design, one of the only ones. There is no way to tell for an absolute certainty that a player did not place a hack themselves. It is the responsibility of the user to safegaurd his/her own computer against roomies/siblings/hobos not steam\'s. Someone once suggested a more secure email disclosure, when his password was easily guessable. How does HLG work for you? does it work better than VAC?' WHERE post_id = 807806 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Actually, HLG is doing a great job, and in my opinion is far more effective than VAC. Then again, I have not had a chance to play with the code, yet with experience I believe that HLG is superior to VAC. Just my humble opinion. And I understand that there is a level of one\'s own responsibility involved in maintaining a cheat free computer, but being able to scan for unknown hacks on one\'s hard drive is a nice thing to have.' WHERE post_id = 807858 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Dizzman786 Actually, HLG is doing a great job, and in my opinion is far more effective than VAC. Then again, I have not had a chance to play with the code, yet with experience I believe that HLG is superior to VAC. Just my humble opinion. And I understand that there is a level of one\'s own responsibility involved in maintaining a cheat free computer, but being able to scan for unknown hacks on one\'s hard drive is a nice thing to have. Have I read right? HLG superior to VAC? HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA. Come on bud, you cannot be that ignorant. You have no clue about VAC or it\'s capabilities. You have no idea how it works or just how effective it is. Have you played on a VAC enabled server? I have played on many HLG servers and have seen way too many cheaters. VAC > HLG VAC > Anything.' WHERE post_id = 808639 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'screw the hacks' WHERE post_id = 809301 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'uh, sorry Jeff, but last time someone told me VAC was omnipotent I told them to give me his server\'s IP (it was a nice coincidence he had a server that ran VAC) and I downloaded some hack. booted them up, went to his server, and he never got a single warning about me. ever. there\'s no system that can 100% tell you someone\'s hacking and be right all of the time. Cheating Death SOUNDS like it could, but I don\'t know enough about it.' WHERE post_id = 809534 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'And Jeff, another thing. If you read my first post then you would know that we run a WARCRAFT server. VAC software would catch everyone that IS NOT a hacker, why? Because VAC is not fully compatible with WAR3 gameplay, however, HLG can be made compatible to a WAR3 server. It won\'t be perfect, but it will still do a better job than VAC. Which is why I said that in my opinion HLG owns VAC. And thank you Darius for further proof of VAC\'s incompitence. And I know HLG is not perfect either, nothing is except God. And please don\'t post unnecessary posts and waste others\' time, I don\'t care for posts that say "screw the hacks" that is plain ignorant.' WHERE post_id = 810289 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Maxey You never heard of VAC (Valve Anti Cheat)? sorry but that still doesn\'t work...' WHERE post_id = 810545 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'HLG\'s aimbot detection is horrible. All it is is an educated guess. Someone moves the xhair to thier enemy a little too fast and OMG you are an aimbotter. Also VAC does not warn any admins if a hacker has been playing on thier server. It will never do so. Many people like HLG because you get to know which players are supposedly cheating but do you care that much that you believe in a system that guesses??' WHERE post_id = 810604 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Another rant.', post_text = 'Now, I am normally a steam enthusiast. I always have defended VALVe in the whole crowd of hating Steam. But, I am tired of this lag. It is affecting my score and my server. Also, the friends network is always down. Wtf is with that? Kinda BS if you ask me. I need it because my friends use multiple IM programs (F*ck trillian), and I use friends to contact them. When will it be resolved? No, I don\'t think I was ripped off like another thread. I paid only $20 for my CD key. But I do feel like we could be getting a little more. But, I do appriciate all the work VALVe is doing. []' WHERE post_id = 806206 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Re: Another rant.', post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Spazztastic Also, the friends network is always down. Wtf is with that? Kinda BS if you ask me. I need it because my friends use multiple IM programs (F*ck trillian), and I use friends to contact them. When will it be resolved? No, I don\'t think I was ripped off like another thread. I paid only $20 for my CD key. Yes, you paid. You paid for a video game - not a friends network. I don\'t recall us getting a friends network originaly, and nobody is paying any extra to have one. tbh, for $20, or around �8 in UK, you get Half-Life, Counter-Strike, Day of Defeat, Team Fortress Classic, Deathmatch Classic, Ricochet, and all the third party mods you can eat. You can\'t really expect anything more for so little.' WHERE post_id = 806233 AND is_historical = 1;
