UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'individuals being blamed for lag', post_text = 'i\'ve noticed a lot of players blaming other people for the high ping on a server, or servers going so far as to auto-kick players with a ping higher than some set number (usually 150). the prevalent idea here seems to be that a player with a high ping is going to lag the rest of the server. for example, i just joined a server where everyone was pinging at 400ms, except one guy who had 800. they kicked the 800ms player, presuming that he was causing the server problems. kicking him didn\'t improve anything. ping is simply a measure of the rate at which the server can communicate with an individual player. why do people think one player\'s ping is going to effect everyone else\'s? is there any merit at all to this idea? do the game servers do something to try to compensate for a player\'s high ping?' WHERE post_id = 892336 AND is_historical = 1;
