UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Re: The complete Counter-Strike Source review/article!', post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by Raziel1Slipknot -] If you fall from a high place, you cant start walking right away, for about 1-2 seconds you stay still. -] When i tryed to bind stopsound it said it was a cheat and that i couldnt use it in multiplayer -] Flashes are different also. You cant duck flashes anymore, if a flash lands behind you, you still get flashed. -] Awp delay seems shorter, and it also seemed like you cant quickshot anymore. The gun would just switch. The awp zoom is also really cool now. The glass is alittle dirty while being zoomed in. There is no more red dot its just 2 lines forming a cross. (I liked this a lot) While unzoomed the glass on the scope reflects whats behind you. While zooming in with the awp you actually see the zoom in its not like a instant zoom. -] The recoil seemed a little different for all guns. -] If you get shot it seemed like your accuracy goes to zero. -] The zoom for the sig/aug wasnt instant, you see the zoom like the awp. ACK!!!!! quote:Originally posted by Raziel1Slipknot -] The hitboxes felt better, everything seemed to hit perfect and i mean perfect. YAY! Why go into more detail then that? I would just get flamed anyway...' WHERE post_id = 928757 AND is_historical = 1;
