UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'The update is here!', post_text = 'Heres the update guys! I have also updated the main page. Gameplay changes. -] Shooting through walls is different. Walls that you were able to shoot through in Cs:1.6 you cant shoot through now. You can only shoot through walls that are very thin. Bunny Hopping/Strafe jumping -] Bunny hopping is impossible now. In 1.6 you can perfect bunny hopping but now in Cs:s once you jump and fall you emediatly stop in your tracks. -] This is wrong. When me and my friend went the first time we tryed bunny hopping with the mouse wheel. We tested it again today and found out that the mouse wheel doesnt register to good. We tryed bunny hopping with the space bar and it was more then posible, we managed to get in about 3-4 strafe jumps. -] You can still do a 90 degree strafe jump Grenades/Smokes/Flashes. -] All nades where able to go over certain walls in de_dust. If you throw the nade to high or at a place that a nade cant go past, it bounces back. -] All nades show up on the model when not in the players hands. (If you only have one flash, only one flash will be shown on the model) -] Nades dont do damage through walls Physics System. -] If barrels run into you they push you back. -] When you shoot a person in the head with the awp, the person that got shot flies back realistically. -] If you jump on a tire from a high spot you loss one to none hp. -] You can shoot away guns -] Nade explosions push guns on the floor Game options/looks. -] You can only bind one key in the options menu Console -] Typing status in console will now give you a lot more information. It shows the true ping/ms, name, time, in/out kbs, build, and drop for each player separately. Gun models/Character models. -] When switching teams the dead players model doesnt change -] If you have the usp silenced and take the silencer off, the silencer doesnt come off in 3rd person. -] When you have the silencer on no flash comes out of the gun in 3rd person. -] When you dont have the silencer on a flash appears from the end of the gun Sounds -] When getting shot players make "hurting" sounds -] Some guns (m4, para, nades) sound a lot better/real -] The map extra sounds add to the feel of the game and environment Extra. -] When the bomb is dropped you cant move it -] The text on the bottom of the screen now fades away -] Alt Tabing the beta will make it crash almost 75% of the time for me (While i was taking notes it crashed about 12 times) -] When you make a listen server your ping is shown as 5 and not 0 -] You can put html and chinese characters in your name now. -] If you type the % symbol in public chat it now appears If you have any questions or comments plz post. ================================================== ================================================== quote:Originally posted by CanadianMob thanks slip... do they have the shield? No shield.' WHERE post_id = 929266 AND is_historical = 1;
