UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'Re: Let\'s discuss the flashbangs', post_text = 'quote:Originally posted by thisnameistaken 1) It\'s difficult to get close enough to your own exploding flashbang to take advantage of it when it goes off. Lobbing one around a nearby corner, intending to charge in after it detonates, will often get you blinded. Yeah, it\'s called having skills. I for one think the flashbangs are just perfect the way they are. I\'m a *very* average CS player and yet I\'ve been able to defend myself very well against stronger opponents, often snipers, just be using a well placed flashbang. And when I get flashed myself, I bow down to the opponent and admit defeat. Because it was good sport. Finally a gameplay mechanic that rewards thinking and outsmarting your opponent rather than just godlike aiming and lightning reflexes. The flashbang is just fine. It\'s like the AWP. People [color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color] because they don\'t know how to use it, or play against it.' WHERE post_id = 1030788 AND is_historical = 1;
