UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'I\'ve played against CAL-I players in pubs. They are nothing special. Look at the stupid pubs they play in, it\'s a bunch of CAL-O kids trying to look good in front of the pub-allstars. Then when the CAL-I people come in they get all mad and start calling hacks. I decided to play a few normal pubs yesterday. I was banned from EVERY single one of them. 7/1 KD ratio every game. Usually I only get about a 3-1 KD ratio on DM servers... I always play on DM servers, simply because it helps me in tough 3-on-1 and 4-on-1 situations. They also don\'t keep me sitting for 3 minutes while I watch a kid (who\'s been playing for a week and he thinks he\'s some kind of pro) camp in the corner and wait there for the entire round with a TMP and a 5-7. Honestly though, CAL-I pub demos aren\'t a damn thing to look at. It bores me to the point where I fall asleep at my computer. If I uploaded a couple of my own pub demos you would be amazed. Pubbing with Mouz = Fun.' WHERE post_id = 1309413 AND is_historical = 1;
