UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'If all these CAL/CPL players are so good, why exactly do you need a pro-mode for them to play? If they are fine, let them be fine. If they are complaining, obviously the game is a little too difficult for them and they need to lower the skill gap by removing the delay to make it easier on getting kills. There\'s no question, you are blowing away realism by even mentioning removing the delay. CS is about realism and great gameplay. This isn\'t a game where you jump around like rabbits switching around guns like they are coming out of your pockets. Valve doesn\'t need to cater to anyone - pro or pub. Blizzard doesn\'t do that either. THey make one game and therefore equal. They don\'t introduce StarCraft-pro edition. That\'s just idiotic. If you can\'t handle this version, quit. No amount of complaining is going to improve your lack of skills. If team 3D or Heaton or KSharp want a pro mode, let them come on here and explain themselves. They probably won\'t cause they don\'t need any nerfs to this game. That\'s exactly what pro mode is, a nerf to the existing game to make it easier.' WHERE post_id = 1309442 AND is_historical = 1;
