UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'You guys have gotta remember that Half Life has this wonderful big community behind it , and extremely skilled and experienced modders (I am soooo jealous of those guys) the other games around at the moment are having content made for them mainly by the studio that produced them. Valve embraces decent mods, adds them to the list and makes sure that everyone possible can play. HL2 DM is only going to get better, and so what if the machine gun is crappy, it might make people think a little about tactics and weapon choice. just think of those maps with only grav gun enabled, aaaaah that should be sooo much fun []' WHERE post_id = 1735616 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_text = 'Before you claim that HL2 DM is copying Halo2 DM try playing deathmatch in a few FPS games that have come out in the past 6 years. If it\'s copying anything that thing would be Q3. It would appear to me that the weapon values have not been changed from single player and that players have the same amount of health as a SP NPC. So they probably just did pretty close to a direct port of SP to MP with a few small changes. I\'d bet that Valve will come out with a gameplay patch in the near future which will resolve alot of the gameplay issues based on community feedback. Issues like the magnum, how a cardboard box can have an insta-kill, the annoying rocket launcher etc. BTW if you look at HL2 single player and Halo2 single player there are alot of striking similarities though. The poppers from Halo series = the zombies with a bunch of black headcrabs on them. You have the good guys (Marines/Resistance) who fight along side you who fight against the major bad guys (covenant/combine) and then you have the zombies who kill whatever (Flood/headcrab zombies). I\'m not saying Bungie copied Valve or vice versa because that would be really dumb.' WHERE post_id = 1735653 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'OMG', post_text = 'That post was so long I lost interest in it. Over - Analyzing. Halo 2 is a fun MP game because of the \'one of a kind\' party list, and ranking system. Bungie.net has so many stats for a single match that it boggles me every time I look at it. Please, don\'t flame yet. HL2 is the best game I have EVER played. HL2 DM has topped the cake, and I can\'t wait for the mods. If HL2 had the online system, and a dedicated, instant-update, online ranking system.... nothing would touch it for years. Bottom line... Halo 2 has bungie.net, Half Life 2 has everything else.' WHERE post_id = 1735680 AND is_historical = 1;
UPDATE phpbb_posts SET post_subject = 'My gift to all: Vehicles on dedicated servers!', post_text = 'Well all, after countless and frustrating battles with the enemy (you may know him or her as source) I have fixed being able to use buggies and airboats in multiplayer dedicated servers (both linux and windows variety)... Step 1. Download http://www.jasongaunt.pwp.blueyonder.co.uk/mpjeeps.zip (http://www.jasongaunt.pwp.blueyonder.co.uk/mpjeeps.zip) and unzip it to the hlds_l folder in linux or the source dedicated server folder in windows. Step 2. Restart your server. Step 3. For test purposes you\'ll find a very early release of a map I\'m making called fun_city there too, it includes above all things a faster jeep with 2 prisoner pods attached to the rear which freely allow players to enter and disembark. Hope you all have a nice xmas, Foxdie out! [Update 2004/12/10 05:58] I\'ve made a lite version of the filepack which is significantly reduced in size (5.91MB > 41KB) but I am unable to test it, it contains just the raw lst files and original buggy and airboat vehicle script files to get you going. I\'m pretty certain it\'ll work but I\'ll need feedback. You can find this version at http://www.jasongaunt.pwp.blueyonde...pjeeps-lite.zip (http://www.jasongaunt.pwp.blueyonder.co.uk/mpjeeps-lite.zip) [/update] Jason "Foxdie" Bhalla-Gaunt Total Illusions Entertainment http://www.totalillusions.net/ (http://www.totalillusions.net/) #is04 on irc.gamesurge.net' WHERE post_id = 1790152 AND is_historical = 1;
